<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">- YAO BIBLE VERSION</book>
  <para style="h">2 Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu chaaŵili cha Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Sam</para>
  <para style="mt2">2 Samweli</para>
  <para style="mt1">Chitabu chaaŵili chi che Samweli</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Itabu ya 1 Samweli ni 2 Samweli kuundanda yaliji chitabu chimo chichamanyikaga nti “Chitabu cha Samweli.” Pa ulendo waandanda chitabu chi chagaŵikwe ni kuŵa itabu iŵili pa litoleo lyalikuŵilanjikwa, “Litoleo lya Seputuaginti”. Lyeleli lyaliji litoleo lyakuundanda lya tafusili ja Lilangano lya Kalakala mu chiŵecheto cha Chiyunani. Liina lya tafusili jo lyajigele malumbo gakuti tafusili jo jaŵichikwe chile ni ŵakusyoma 70 pane 72 ŵa Chiyahudi. Mu tafusili ja Chigiliki ji, itabu ya 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli yaŵilanjikwe 1 umwenye ni 2 umwenye, ni mu litoleo lya Chilatini lilyakuiye pakumala lyelelyo, itabu yo yagalawiche ni kuŵilanjikwa 1 Mamwenye ni 2 Mamwenye. Kwayele itabu yaikumanyika lelojino nti 1 Mamwenye ni 2 Mamwenye yaŵilanjikwe 3 Mamwenye ni 4 Mamwenye. Itabu ya 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli ikusala nkati utame wa jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu che Samweli, mwenye che Sauli, ni mwenye che Daudi. Che Samweli ŵaliji chilongola jwambesi katema chilambo cha ku Isilaeli pachatyosile kulongoswa ni ŵakulamula ni kutanda kulongoswa ni mamwenye. Che Samweli jujojo ni juŵaajitilile mauta che Sauli ni che Daudi kuti aŵanje mamwenye ŵaŵili ŵaandanda ku Isilaeli. Itabu ya 1 Samweli ni 2 Samweli ikusalichisya indu ya chihisitolia ya chilambo cha ku Isilaeli pa chipindi cho.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngapangwa jwakummanyilila juŵalembile itabu ya 1 Samweli ni 2 Samweli. Jwakulemba nganalisala nsyene mu itabu yo, nambo panepa ŵaliji jwanjumi pa chipindi chose cha utawala wa mwenye che Daudi, ni panepa ŵaliji chiŵela jwanjumi namose pakumala utawala wo, nombe panepa ŵaliji ni ukombole wa kulola ni kusyoma ikalata ine iyasalaga nkati ndamo sya che Sauli ni che Samweli. Kwalingongo lya ungamanyika wa mundu pane ŵandu ŵalembile itabu yi, ungamanyika wo utesile itabu yi ikamanyika kuti yalembekwe chakachi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yaili mwelemo</para>
  <para style="io">Che Daudi iŵatite kuŵa mwenye jwa ku Yuda ni kanyuma ŵaliji mwenye jwa ku Isilaeli jose, mu sula ja 1 mpaka sula ja 5.</para>
  <para style="io">Che Daudi iŵatite pakutawala mpela mwenye ni kwapunda achajinji mwa ŵammagongo ŵakwe mu sula ja 6 mpaka sula ja 10.</para>
  <para style="io">Che Daudi iŵatesile sambi ja chikululu ni kuulaga, ni iŵatite kwamukwa ni jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu che Natani mu sula ja 11 mpaka sula ja 12.</para>
  <para style="io">Che Daudi iŵatite pakugalaukwa pa ulendo waandanda ni waaŵili mu sula 13 mpaka sula ja 20.</para>
  <para style="io">Maloŵe gambesi gagakusala ngani sya utawala wa che Daudi ali mwenye mu sula ja 22 mpaka sula ja 24.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1" />
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akusalilwa kuti che Sauli awile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1" />Paŵawile che Sauli, che Daudi ŵausile pakumala kwapunda Ŵaamaleki, ŵatemi ku Sikilagi kwa moŵa gaŵili. <verse eid="2SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2" />Pa lyuŵa lyaatatu ŵaiche mundu kutyochela ku chigono chi che Sauli, ali apapwilepapwile yakuwala yakwe, sooni ali alitasile luundu muntwe mwakwe. Mundu jo paŵaiche ku che Daudi ŵaligwisisye paasi pa makongolo gakwe kuti ŵaape luchimbichimbi. <verse eid="2SA 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3" />Che Daudi ŵammusisye, “Nkutyochela kwapi?” Nombejo ŵajanjile, “Ndolweche ku chigono cha Ŵaisilaeli.” <verse eid="2SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4" />Che Daudi ŵammusisye, “Muusalile indu yaliji uli kweleko?” Mundu jula ŵanjanjile, “Ŵandu ŵetu ajiutwiche ngondo, achajinji mwa uweji aulajikwe. Kupunda ni yeleyo, che Sauli ni che Yonatani mwanagwe nombe aulajikwe.” <verse eid="2SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5" />Che Daudi ŵammusisye jwanchanda jula, “Nkumanyilila chinauli kuti che Sauli ni che Yonatani mwanagwe awilenje?”<verse eid="2SA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6" />Jwanchanda jula ŵajanjile, “Yagambile kutyochela pe, une naliji pa chitumbi cha Giliboa. Nammweni che Sauli ali ajegemele mpamba wakwe ni ŵakukwela falasi ŵa ŵammagongo ni mutuka syao ŵaliji nkwaŵandichila nnope. <verse eid="2SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7" />Che Sauli paŵagalawiche kunyuma, ŵamweni une, nipele ŵamilasile. Uneji najitiche, ‘Ndili apano mwenye!’ <verse eid="2SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8" />Ŵamusisye kuti ‘Mmwe ŵani?’ Nanjanjile kuti une ndili Mwamaleki. <verse eid="2SA 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9" />Pelepo ŵaasalile, ‘Mmandichile muumulaje, pakuŵa amulesye kwannope, ni ipwetesi ipundile. Nambo ndili chiwela jwanjumi.’ <verse eid="2SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10" />Kwayele, nanjaulile ni kummulaga, ligongo naimanyilile kusyene kuti agwaga paasi, ngakombola kulama mwakupunda. Nipele chindu mpela singwa cha chimwenye chichaliji muntwe mwakwe ni likembe liŵawasile mmakono mwakwe, yanayose nanjigalile mmwe, ambuje jwangu.”<verse eid="2SA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11" />Che Daudi ŵaipapwile yakuwala yakwe mu kusupuka. Ni ŵandu ŵaŵaliji pampepe nawo ŵala ŵatesile iyoyopeyo. <verse eid="2SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12" />Ŵalisile ni kulila kwamalumbo, kwaligongo li che Sauli, ni che Yonatani mwanagwe ni Ŵaisilaeli, ŵandu wakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, ni ŵataŵile mpaka ligulo, pakuŵa achajinji mwao ŵaliji aulajikwe ku ngondo. <verse eid="2SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13" />Che Daudi ŵammusisye ajula jwanchanda juŵampelechele utenga, “Nkutyochela kwapi?” Jwelewo ŵajanjile “Uneji ndili Mwamaleki, ngutama mu chilambo chenu nti jwannendo.” <verse eid="2SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14" />Che Daudi ŵammusisye, “Yaŵele uli mmwe pangajogopa kummulaga mundu jwasagulikwe ni Ambuje Akunnungu kwa kwajitilila mauta?” <verse eid="2SA 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15" />Nipele che Daudi ŵammilasile jwanchanda jumo mwa achachanda ŵakwe ni ŵansalile, “Mummulaje mundu ju!” Jwanchanda jula ŵansomile Mwamaleki jula ni kummulaga. <verse eid="2SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16" />Che Daudi ŵansalile, “Nliulajisye mwasyene, ligongo nsasile mwasyene kwa kang'wa jenu kuti, ‘Nammuleje mundu juŵasagulikwe ni Ambuje Akunnungu kwa kwajitilila mauta.’”<verse eid="2SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akulila malilo ga che Sauli ni che Yonatani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17" />Che Daudi ŵajimbile lujimbo lwakunlilila mundu jwawile kwaligongo li che Sauli ni che Yonatani mwanagwe. <verse eid="2SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18" />Che Daudi ŵalamwile kuti ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda ajiganyikwe lujimbo lo, nombe lujandichikwe mu chitabu cha Yashali. Che Daudi ŵajimbile yeleyi:<verse eid="2SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19" />“Ŵandu ŵankulilapila ni kwasangalilali mwanya Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:19">aulajikwe pa matumbi genu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:19">Iŵatite kuwa ŵandu ŵaakukombola kujiputa ngondo!<verse eid="2SA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20" />Nkaasalila jele ngani ji ŵandu ŵa musi wa ku Gati</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">pane mmatala ga musi wa ku Ashikeloni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">Nangaŵa yeleyo, achakongwe ŵa Ŵafilisiti tachisangalila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">achiŵali ŵa ŵandu ŵangakwamanyilila Akunnungu tachijangalalila.”<verse eid="2SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21" />“Mwanya matumbi ga ku Giliboa, mangame ni ula jikanya pa ŵanyamwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">Namose migunda jenu jikasogola indu moŵa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">Pakuŵapo kweleko chindu chakulichinga pangondo cha mundu jwakumanyilila kujiputa ngondo chapatwiche paasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">chindu chakulichinga pangondo chi che Sauli nganichichimbichikwa.<verse eid="2SA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22" />Kwaligongo lya miasi ja ŵandu ŵaulajikwe, kwaligongo lya ilu ya ŵandu ŵali ni machili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">che Yonatani ŵaliji ŵakulonda yambone ni upinde wao.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">Lipanga li che Sauli lyauleje ŵandu ŵajinji.”<verse eid="2SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23" />“Che Sauli ni che Yonatani ŵanonyelwe ni kunonyelecheka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">Nganalekangana ali chijumi atamuno pa chiwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">ŵaliji ŵachitema kujipunda kapungu, ŵaliji ŵamachili kugapunda masimba.<verse eid="2SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24" />Achakongwe ŵa ku Isilaeli, munlilile che Sauli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:24">ŵammwasisye mwanya yakuwala yechejewu ya ndalama jekulungwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:24">ŵatotele yakusalalisya ya sahabu mu yakuwala yenu.<verse eid="2SA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25" />Yatiteje kuwa ŵandu ŵakumanyilila kujiputa ngondo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:25">awilenje ali pa ngondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:25">Che Yonatani agonile ali awile pa matumbi.<verse eid="2SA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26" />Ngulilasika kwaligongo lyenu, che Yonatani nlongo njangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">mwaliji ŵa pantima pangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">Chinonyelo chenu pa uneji chaliji chakusimonjeka nnope,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">chaliji chekulu kupunda jwankongwe kunnonyela ŵankwakwe.<verse eid="2SA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27" />Yatiteje kuwa ŵandu ŵakumanyilila kujiputa ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:27">ni yakumenyanila yao yangondo yangali masengo.”<verse eid="2SA 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2" />
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akutendekwa mwenye jwa ku Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1" />Ni yaliji, pakumala yeleyo, che Daudi ŵammusisye Ambuje Akunnungu kuti, “Ana nyaule ngaujigale musi umo mwa misi ja ku Yuda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajanjile “Njaule!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Che Daudi ŵausisye “Ana nyaule pa musi chi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajanjile, “Njaule musi wa ku Hebuloni.” <verse eid="2SA 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2" />Kwayele che Daudi ŵajawile ku Hebuloni, pamo ni achiŵankwakwe ŵaŵili ŵala, che Ahinoamu jwa ku Yesileeli ni che Abigaili jwankongwe jwaŵaŵililwe ni ŵankwakwe che Nabali kutyochela musi wa ku Kalimeli. <verse eid="2SA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3" />Sooni che Daudi ŵaajigele ŵandu ŵakwe, kila mundu ali ni ŵapa ulongo wakwe. Ŵatemi mmisinda jijaliji chiŵandi ni ku Hebuloni.<verse eid="2SA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4" />Nipele ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda ŵanjaulile che Daudi ku Hebuloni ko, ŵanjitilile mauta aŵe mwenye jwawo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:4">Che Daudi paŵapilikene kuti ŵandu ŵa ku Yabeshi Gileadi ni ŵaŵansichile che Sauli, <verse eid="2SA 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5" />ŵaatumile ŵandu ku Yabeshi Gileadi ko kwasalila kuti, “Ambuje Akunnungu ampe upile, pakuŵa mwalosisye kulupilichika ku che Sauli mbuje gwenu pa kunsika mwilembe. <verse eid="2SA 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6" />Sambano, Ambuje Akunnungu anlosye mwanyamwe chinonyelo chawo changamala ni kulupichika kwawo kukwenu. Ni une tinantendele indu yambone ligongo lya intesile yo. <verse eid="2SA 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7" />Sambano nlimbeje ntima ni kukola ntima wangajogopa, pakuŵa che Sauli, ambuje ŵenu, awile, ni ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda anyitilile mauta une me mwenye jwawo.”<verse eid="2SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Ishibosheti akutendekwa mwenye jwa ku Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8" />Che Abuneli mwana ju che Neli chilongola jwankulu jwa mpingo ŵa ngondo u che Sauli ŵaliji anjigele che Ishibosheti mwana ju che Sauli ni kunjausya ku Mahanaimu. <verse eid="2SA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9" />Kweleko, che Abuneli ŵantangesye che Ishibosheti kuŵa mwenye jwa chilambo cha ku Gileadi ni ku Asheli ni ku Yesileeli ni ku Efulaimu ni ku Benjamini ni ku Isilaeli kose.<verse eid="2SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10" />Che Ishibosheti mwanache ju che Sauli ŵaliji ni yaka alobaini paŵatandite kutawala ku Isilaeli, nombejo ŵatawele kwa yaka iŵili. Nambo ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Yuda ŵankuiye che Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11" />Che Daudi ŵaliji mwenye jwa ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Yuda kwele ku Hebuloni ko, kwa yaka saba ni nusu.<verse eid="2SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli ni ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda akuputana ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12" />Che Abuneli, mwana ju che Neli ni ŵangondo ŵa che Ishibosheti mwanache ju che Sauli ŵatyosile ku Mahanaimu ni kwaula ku Gibeoni. <verse eid="2SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13" />Che Yoabu mwana ju che Seluya ni ŵangondo ŵa che Daudi ŵatyosile ni kusimana ni che Abuneli ni ŵandu ŵakwe ku litanda lyalili ku Gibeoni ko. Mpingo umo waliji upaande umo ni mpingo wine waliji upaande wine wa litanda lyo. <verse eid="2SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14" />Che Abuneli ŵansalile che Yoabu, “Achachanda ŵenu ni ŵetu aiche, amenyane tulole.” Che Yoabu ŵajanjile kuti, “Yambone, amenyaneje.” <verse eid="2SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15" />Pelepo ŵangondo kumi na mbili waŵajimi pamalo pa che Ishibosheti ni lukosyo lwa Benjamini ŵamenyene ni ŵangondo kumi na mbili ŵa che Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16" />Jwajulijose ŵankamwile jwammagongo jwakwe ntwe, ni ŵansomile njakwe jo mumbalati ni lipanga, kwayele wosepe ŵanaŵaŵili ŵagwile pasi, ali awile. Kwayele pamalo po paŵilanjikwe Helikati Hasulimu, malumbo gakwe, “Luŵala lwa mapanga.” <verse eid="2SA 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17" />Nipele ŵandu wose ŵatandite kuputana. Mbaande syose siŵili syalimbene kwannope, nambo ŵangondo ŵa che Daudi ŵaapundile che Abuneli ni ŵangondo ŵa ku Isilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18" />Ŵanache ŵatatu ŵa che Seluya: Che Yoabu ni che Abishai ni che Asaeli ŵaliji kukoko. Che Asaeli ŵaliji ŵakupakombola kuutuka mpela ngolombwe. <verse eid="2SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19" />Che Asaeli ŵantopwesye che Abuneli pangapela, ŵagambile sokota pangalola kunchiji pane kunlyo. <verse eid="2SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20" />Che Abuneli paŵagalawiche panyuma ni kummona che Asaeli, ŵansalile kuti, “Ana mmweji che Asaeli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:20">Nombejo ŵajanjile, “Elo, ni uneji.”<verse eid="2SA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21" />Che Abuneli ŵansalile, “Nneche kuumutusya, ngaulauche kunlyo pane kunchiji, mumbulaje jwangondo jumo, njigale yanayose yakwete.” Nambo che Asaeli nganasaka kuti aleche kuntoposya che Abuneli jo. <verse eid="2SA 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22" />Che Abuneli ŵansalile che Asaeli kaaŵili, “Nneche kuundoposya. Kwachichi nammulaje? Pakuŵa nammulagaga timengane ni achimwene jwenu che Yoabu.” <verse eid="2SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23" />Nambo che Asaeli nganasaka kwaleka, kwayele che Abuneli ŵansomile che Asaeli jo mlutumbo ni mpamba wakwe, mpamba wo wakopochele kungongo kwakwe. Che Asaeli ŵagwile pasi, ni kuwa papopo. Ŵandu wose ŵaŵaiche pamalo pele piŵawilile che Asaeli ŵajimaga jii.<verse eid="2SA 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24" />Nambo che Yoabu ni che Abishai ŵatandite kummutusya che Abuneli. Palyakapilaga lyuŵa, ŵaiche ku chitumbi cha Ama, chachili kungopoko lyuŵa kwa Gia, ku litala lyalikwaula ku chipululu cha Gibeoni. <verse eid="2SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25" />Ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini ŵasongene pamo kukamulangana ni che Abuneli, kwayele ŵakweile pa chitumbi ali chile kwa ngondo. <verse eid="2SA 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26" />Nipele che Abuneli ŵammilasile che Yoabu ni kummusya, “Ana tutumenyane moŵa gose? Ana ngankwiwona kuti mbesi jakwe tijiwe jakupwetesya? Uweji tuli achalongo, ana chakachi timwalekasye ŵandu ŵenu kututoposya?”<verse eid="2SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27" />Che Yoabu ŵansalile, “Ngulumbila kwa Akunnungu ŵajumi, kuti ngankaŵechete chele chindu cho, kusyene ŵandu ŵangu ngakaleche kwatoposya achalongo achinjawo mpaka malaŵi kundaŵi.” <verse eid="2SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28" />Kwayele, che Yoabu ŵagombile lipenga, ni ŵandu ŵalesile kwatoposya Ŵaisilaeli, ni ngondo jila jamalile pelepo.<verse eid="2SA 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29" />Che Abuneli ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵajesile chilo chose ku lichemba lya lusulo lwa Yolodani. Ŵajombweche lusulo lwa Yolodani, ŵajesile muusi wose ni ŵaiche ku Mahanaimu.<verse eid="2SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30" />Che Yoabu paŵausile kwatopola che Abuneli, ŵasongenye ŵandu ŵakwe wose, ni ŵamanyilile kuti ŵangondo kumi na tisa ŵa che Daudi, asoŵile, pamo ni che Asaeli. <verse eid="2SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31" />Nambo ŵangondo ŵa che Daudi ŵaliji auleje ŵandu mia tatu na sitini ŵaŵaliji pamo ni che Abuneli, ŵaŵatyochele mu lukosyo lwa Benjamini. <verse eid="2SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32" />Che Yoabu ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵachijigele chiilu chi che Asaeli, ŵachisichile ku lilembe lya atatigwe, lyalili kwele ku Beselehemu ko. Nipele ŵajesile chilo chose, ni lyuŵa likanaŵe kopoka ŵaiche ku musi wa Hebuloni.<verse eid="2SA 2:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1" />Nipele japali ngondo kwa moŵa gamajinji pasikati ja ŵandu ŵaŵakamulangene ni ulongo wa che Sauli, ni aŵala ŵaŵakamulangene ni che Daudi. Nambo che Daudi ŵapundile kukola machili kwannope ni upaande wa che Sauli machili gawo gajendelechele kumala.<verse eid="2SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵanache ŵachilume che Daudi ŵaŵapagwile ku Hebuloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2" />Ŵeleŵa ni ŵanache ŵachilume ŵaŵapagwile ni che Daudi paŵaliji ku Hebuloni malinga ni iŵatite kupagwa: Che Amunoni, jwakwitiwo jwakwe, achikulugwe ŵaliji che Ahinoamu jwakutyochela ku Yesileeli, <verse eid="2SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3" />Che Kileabu jwaaŵili kupagwa, achikulugwe ŵaliji che Abigaili, jwankongwe jwaŵawililwe ni ŵankwakwe che Nabali jwakutyochela ku Kalimeli; ni che Abusalomu, jwaatatu kupagwa, achikulugwe ŵaliji che Maaka, mwali ju che Talimai mwenye jwa ku Geshuli, <verse eid="2SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4" />che Adoniya, jwancheche kupagwa, achikulugwe ŵaliji che Hagiti, che Shefatia, jwansano kupagwa, achikulugwe ŵaliji che Abitali, <verse eid="2SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5" />ni che Itiliyamu jwasita kupagwa, achikulugwe ŵaliji che Egila. Ŵelewo ni ŵanache ŵa che Daudi ŵaŵaŵeleche paŵaliji nkutama ku Hebuloni ko.<verse eid="2SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Abuneli akukamulana ni che Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6" />Ngondo pajaliji nkwendelechela pasikati ja ulongo wa che Daudi ni aula ulongo wa che Sauli, che Abuneli ŵapundile kukola machili gamajinji pasikati pa ulongo wa che Sauli.<verse eid="2SA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7" />Che Sauli ali ŵajumi ŵakwete chilanga jwakuŵilanjikwa che Lisipa, mwali ju che Ahiya. Nipele che Ishibosheti ŵammusisye che Abuneli, “Ligongo chichi ngonile ni chilanga cha atati ŵangu?” <verse eid="2SA 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8" />Che Abuneli ŵatumbile kwannope ligongo lya aila yaŵechete che Ishibosheti, ni ŵansalile kuti, “Uli, mmwe nkuganisya kuti une ngupakombola kwagalauka che Sauli? Uli mmwe nkuganisya kuti une ngwatumichila chilambo cha Yuda? Nnole une mele jwakulupilichika kwa ulongo wa che Sauli atati ŵenu, achalongo achinjakwe ni kwa achambusangagwe, ni nangosile kuti che Daudi akampunda mpaka lelo. Kwayele nkuumona kuti ndili jwakuleŵa kwaligongo lya jwankongwe. <verse eid="2SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9" />Ngwapopelela Akunnungu kuti anyamuche iŵaga nganaakamuchisya che Daudi kukola yose yati Ambuje Akunnungu ŵannumbilile. <verse eid="2SA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:10" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵanlumbilile che Daudi kuti tachiusamisya umwenye kwa ulongo wa che Sauli ni kwapa ŵelewo. Nombewo tachitawala Isilaeli ni Yuda kutandilila ku Dani mpaka ku Beli Sheba.” <verse eid="2SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11" />Che Ishibosheti nganakombola kusala chachilichose, pakuŵa ŵaliji nkwajogopa kwannope che Abuneli.<verse eid="2SA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12" />Nipele, che Abuneli ŵaatumile ŵantenga kwa che Daudi, kwele ku Hebuloni ko akaasalile, “Uli, jwakamulile chilambo chi nduni? Ntende lilangano ni une, ni une tinankamuchisye kujitawala Isilaeli jose.” <verse eid="2SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13" />Che Daudi ŵajanjile, “Mwambone, tindende lilangano ni mmwe. Nambo ngusaka ntende chindu chimo, patinnyiche muunyichisye ŵankwangu che Mikali mwali ju che Sauli, pelepo ni patutujilane.” <verse eid="2SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14" />Sooni che Daudi ŵatumile ŵantenga ku che Ishibosheti mwana ju che Sauli achitiji, “Mumuchisye ŵankwangu che Mikali junalombele kwa misumbu mia moja ja Ŵafilisiti.” <verse eid="2SA 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15" />Nipele che Ishibosheti ŵatumile ŵandu akaajigale che Mikali kwa ŵankwakwe, che Palitieli mwana ju che Laishi. <verse eid="2SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16" />Nambo che Palitieli ŵajawile pamo ni ŵankwakwe akuno ali nkulila litala lyose mpaka kwele ku Bahulimu. Che Abuneli ŵansalile che Palitieli, “Mmuje kumangwenu.” Nombejo ŵausile.<verse eid="2SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17" />Che Abuneli ŵaasalile achachekulu ŵa ku Isilaeli kuti, “Kwa moŵa gamajinji mwasachile kuti che Daudi aŵe mwenye jwenu. <verse eid="2SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18" />Sambano, nchitende chele chindu cho, ligongo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵanlanjile che Daudi yeleyi, ‘Kwa nkono wenu mmwe che Daudi jwakutumichila jwangu, tinjakulupusya ŵandu ŵangu Ŵaisilaeli kutyochela kwa Ŵafilisiti ni tinjakulupusya kwa ŵammagongo ŵao ŵane.’” <verse eid="2SA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19" />Che Abuneli nombe ŵakungulwiche ni ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini, nipele ŵajawile mpaka ku Hebuloni kunsalila che Daudi yankati aila yose yalangene kutenda ŵandu wose ŵa ku Isilaeli ni lukosyo lose lwa Benjamini.<verse eid="2SA 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20" />Che Abuneli paŵanjaulile che Daudi ku Hebuloni, ŵajawile ni ŵandu ishilini, che Daudi ŵaatendele chindimba. <verse eid="2SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21" />Che Abuneli ŵansalile che Daudi, “Sambano uneji tinyaule ni kwasonganya ŵandu wose ŵa ku Isilaeli kwaligongo lyenu mmwe ambuje ŵangu mwenye, kuti akombole kutenda lilangano ni mmwe, kuti mme mwenye jwawo, nomwe timwatawale wose nti inkutikusaka.” Che Daudi ŵanlanjile che Abuneli kuti ajaule, nombejo ŵatyosile kwa chitendewele.<verse eid="2SA 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yoabu akummulaga che Abuneli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22" />Pakumala che Daudi kwalanga che Abuneli kuti ajaule kwa chitendewele, che Yoabu ni ŵandu ŵampepe ŵa che Daudi ŵaiche kutyochela kuŵajile kuputana ngondo, ali ajigele indu iŵasumwile ku ngondo. Kwayele che Abuneli nganaŵa pamo ni che Daudi kwele ku Hebuloni ko pakuŵa che Daudi ŵaliji ŵalanjile ajaule. <verse eid="2SA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23" />Che Yoabu paŵausile ali ni ŵangondo wakwe wose uwaliji nawo, ŵasalilwe kuti che Abuneli mwana ju che Neli ŵaliji aiche kukuwonegana ni mwenye che Daudi, nombe mwenye che Daudi ŵaalesile ajaule kwa chitendewele. <verse eid="2SA 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24" />Che Yoabu ŵanjaulile mwenye ni kunsalila, “Sambano nkutenda ichichi? Nnole che Abuneli ŵaiche kukwenu, kwachichi munnesile ajaule? <verse eid="2SA 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25" />Uli, nkwimanyilila kuti che Abuneli mwana ju che Neli ŵaiche kukunlambusya? Ŵaiche kuti amanyilile wende wenu ni aila inkuipanganya.”<verse eid="2SA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26" />Che Yoabu ŵannesile che Daudi ni kwatuma ŵantenga ŵaakuye che Abuneli, nombewo ŵansimene ku chisima chi che Sila ni kummusya, nambo che Daudi nganaimanyililaga chele chindu cho. <verse eid="2SA 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27" />Che Abuneli paŵausile ku Hebuloni, che Yoabu ŵanjawisye pambali ni nnango nti akusaka kukunguluka nawo kwachisyepela. Pelepo che Yoabu ŵansomile mpamba che Abuneli pa lutumbo ligongo che Abuneli ŵaliji ŵauleje che Asaeli mpwakwe, ni che Abuneli ŵawile. <verse eid="2SA 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28" />Kanyuma che Daudi paŵapilikene ngani syo ŵatite, “Ambuje Akunnungu akwimanyilila kuti uneji ni umwenye wangu nganitukola maleŵa nkati chiwa chi che Abuneli mwana ju che Neli. <verse eid="2SA 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 3:29" />Maleŵa ga maulago go gaŵe kwa che Yoabu ni ŵapanyuumba jakwe, ni ŵa paulongo wa atatigwe! Ŵandu ŵapaulongo wa che Yoabu moŵa gose akasoŵekwa ni mundu jwakulwala chipapu, pane jwakulwala matana, pane jwakwenda ni ntindiso, pane kuulajikwa ni lipanga, pane jwakusoŵekwa ni chakulya!” <verse eid="2SA 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:30" />Che Yoabu ni mpwakwe che Abishai ŵammuleje che Abuneli pakuŵapo ŵaliji ŵauleje mpwawo che Asaeli katema ka ngondo kwele ku Gibeoni ko.<verse eid="2SA 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Abuneli akusichikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31" />Nipele, mwenye che Daudi ŵalamulile che Yoabu ni aŵala wose uŵaliji pamo nawo, apapulanye yakuwala yao ni kuwala magunia kuti ŵaalilile che Abuneli. Katema ka masiko, mwenye che Daudi ŵajesile panyuma pa lijenesa. <verse eid="2SA 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32" />Che Abuneli ŵasichikwe kwele ku Hebuloni ko ni mwenye ŵanlilile kwa liloŵe ali mumbali mwa lilembe, sooni ŵandu wose ŵatesile iyoyo peyo. <verse eid="2SA 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33" />Mwenye che Daudi ŵajimbile alu lujimbo lwa kulila kwa malumbo kwa ligongo li che Abuneli achitiji:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 3:33">“Uli, iŵele uli mpaka che Abuneli kuwa nti mundu jwakuloŵela?<verse eid="2SA 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34" />Makono genu nganigataŵikwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 3:34">Ni makongolo genu nganigataŵikwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 3:34">Mbwile nti yakuti kuwa mundu jwangalumbana!”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2SA 3:34">Nombe ŵandu wosepe ŵatandite kulila sooni.<verse eid="2SA 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35" />Nipele che Daudi ŵakanile kulya chachilichose pa lyele lyuŵa lya malilo lyo, ni ŵandu wose ŵaiche kukunchondelela kuti alye. Nambo che Daudi ŵalumbilile nikwasalila kuti, “Akunnungu amulaje iŵaga tindye nkate pane chindu chilichose lyuŵa likanaŵe kutiŵila.” <verse eid="2SA 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36" />Ŵandu wose ŵaiweni yeleyo, ni yanonyele. Elo, yosepe iŵatendaga mwenye yanonyelaga ŵandu wosepe. <verse eid="2SA 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37" />Kwayele, lyuŵa lila, Ŵaisilaeli wose ŵaimanyilile kuti mwenye che Daudi nganakamulangana ni che Yoabu kwaulaga che Abuneli mwanache ju che Neli. <verse eid="2SA 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38" />Mwenye che Daudi ŵaasalile ŵakutumichila ŵakwe, “Ana ngankwimanyilila kuti lelojino mundu jwankulu ni jwakumanyika kwannope awile pa Isilaeli? <verse eid="2SA 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39" />Nachiŵamuno uneji ndili mwenye junyitililwe mauta ni Akunnungu, nambo lelojino uneji ndili ndengwiche. Aŵa ŵanache ŵa che Seluya ŵa akuunagasya. Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaalamule ŵandu ŵachigongomalo ŵa kwa ugongomalo watesile.”<verse eid="2SA 3:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4" />
  <para style="s">Che Ishibosheti akuulajikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1" />Che Ishibosheti mwanache ju che Sauli, paŵapilikene kuti che Abuneli aulajikwe kwele ku Hebuloni, ŵapwele ntima ni ŵandu wose ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵakamwilwe ni lipamba lyekulungwa. <verse eid="2SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2" />Nipele che Ishibosheti mwanache ju che Sauli ŵakwete ŵandu ŵaŵili ŵaŵaliji ilongola ŵa mipingo ja ngondo ŵakukugumuchila. Jumo lina lyakwe che Baana ni jwine ŵaliji che Lekabu, wosepe ŵa ŵaliji ŵanache ŵa che Limoni mundu jwa lukosyo lwa Benjamini kutyochela musi wa ku Beeloti, pakuŵapo musi wa ku Beeloti waliji mu chilambo cha ku Benjamini. <verse eid="2SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3" />Ŵandu ŵaŵatamaga ku Beeloti kuundanda ko, ŵautuchile ku Gitaimu ni akutamanga kweleko nti achalendo mpaka lelojino.<verse eid="2SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4" />Chiŵelesi chine chi che Sauli ŵaliji che Mefibosheti mwanache ju che Sauli. Katema ch Sauli ni che Yonatani atatigwe paŵaulajkwe che Mefiboshe waliji ni yaka nsano. Yaaya jwakwe paŵapilikene ngani sya iwa yao iyatyochele ku musi wa ku Yesileeli ŵanjigele ni kuutuka nawo, nambo paŵaliji nkwanguya kuutuka nawo ŵangwisisye ni ŵaliji alemele makongo gose ganagaŵili.<verse eid="2SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5" />Che Lekabu ni che Baana ŵanache ŵa che Limoni mundu jwa ku Beeloti, ŵajawile ku nyuumba ji che Ishibosheti. Ŵaiche kweleko muusi, che Ishibosheti ali apumulile mu nyuumba mwakwe. <verse eid="2SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6" />Jwakulindilila pannango juŵaliji nkupeeta ngano wasimene lugono, ni ŵagonile. Pelepo che Lekabu ni che Baana mpwakwe ŵajinjile munkati. <verse eid="2SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 4:7" />Ali munkati mo ŵajawile ku chuumba chi che Ishibosheti, ŵansimene ali agonile lugono lwakutopela pachindanda, ni ŵammuleje. Ŵankatile ntwe wakwe ni kwaula nawo. Ŵajesile chilo chose achipitaga mu chiŵata cha lusulo lwa Yolodani. <verse eid="2SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:8" />Wele ntwe wo ŵanjauchisye che Daudi kwele ku Hebuloni ko ni kwasalila kuti, “Welewu uli ntwe u che Ishibosheti mwanache ju che Sauli jwammagongo jwenu, juŵasakaga kummulaga. Lyuŵa lya lelo Ambuje Akunnungu anlipichisye chisasi che Sauli ni uŵelesi ŵakwe kwaligongo lyenu mmwe ambuje ŵangu mwenye.”<verse eid="2SA 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9" />Nambo che Daudi ŵaajanjile che Lekabu ni che Baana mpwakwe, ŵanache ŵa che Limoni mundu jwa ku Beeloti kuti, “Ngulumbila kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajumi, juŵaukulupwisye umi wangu kwa ŵammagongo wosepe, <verse eid="2SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10" />ajula mundu juŵaiche kukuusalila kuti che Sauli awile, achiganisyaga kuti aiche kwa une ni utenga wambone, nankamwile ni nammuleje ku Sikilagi. Jelejo ni jaliji mbote jiŵapochele ligongo lya utenga wakwe uŵaganisyaga kuti uli wambone kwa uneji. <verse eid="2SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11" />Ana mundu jwangalumbana pakummulaga mundu jwambone ali agonile pachindanda, mu nyuumba mwakwe, uli ngaiŵa yambone kwa uneji kummuchisya chisasi kwaligongo maulago gatesile kwa kummulaga kuti akapagwa pachilambo?” <verse eid="2SA 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12" />Kwayele che Daudi ŵalamwile ŵandu ŵakwe, akaaulaje. Ŵaakatile makono ni makongolo gawo ni ilu yao kuikoleka mungulugulu litanda kwele ku Hebuloni ko. Nambo ŵaujigele ntwe u che Ishibosheti ni kuusika mu lilembe li che Abuneli kwele ku Hebuloni ko.<verse eid="2SA 4:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5" />
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akutendekwa mwenye jwa ku Isilaeli ni ku Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 11:1-9">1 Indu ya katema 11:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 14:1-7">14:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1" />Nipele ngosyo syose sya ku Isilaeli syanjaulile che Daudi kwele ku Hebuloni ko, ni kunsalila kuti, “Nnole, uweji tuli achalongo ŵenu ŵakuŵelekana. <verse eid="2SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2" />Kuundanda ko che Sauli paŵaliji mwenye jwetu uweji, mmweji ni jumwalongwesye Ŵaisilaeli ku ngondo, ni Ambuje Akunnungu ŵannanjile kuti, ‘Timme jwakuchinga jwa ŵandu ŵangu Ŵaisilaeli, ni timme jwankulu pa Isilaeli.’” <verse eid="2SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3" />Nipele achachekulu wose ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵanjaulile mwenye che Daudi kwele ku Hebuloni ko, nombejo ŵatesile lilangano nawo paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, nipele ŵanjitilile mauta che Daudi kuti aŵe mwenye jwa ku Isilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4" />Che Daudi ŵaliji ni yaka salasini paŵatandite kutawala, ni ŵatawele kwa yaka alobaini. <verse eid="2SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5" />Kwele ku Hebuloni ko, ŵaatawele ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda kwa yaka saba ni miesi sita, ni kwele ku Yelusalemu ko ŵaatawele ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli pamo ni ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda kwa yaka salasini na tatu.<verse eid="2SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6" />Kanyuma mwenye ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵajawile ku Yelusalemu kukwagungumuchila Ŵayebusi ŵaŵaliji achinsyene chilambo cho. Nambo Ŵayebusi Ŵanchembulwisye achitiji, “Nganjinjila mu musi mu, pakuŵa namose ŵangalola ni ŵalemele tachinsiŵila.” Ŵansalile yeleyo ligongo ŵaganisisye kuti che Daudi ngaakakombole kwinjila mmusi mo. <verse eid="2SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7" />Namose yeleyo, mwenye che Daudi ŵasumwile likome lya Siyoni, ni musi wo waŵilanjikwe, “Musi u che Daudi.”<verse eid="2SA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8" />Palyuŵa lyo, che Daudi ŵatite, “Mundu jwalijose jutachaputa Ŵayebusi apitile ku nkolola kuti akaapute ŵalemele ni ŵangalola ŵati mbumu jangu jikwachima.” Lyelelyo ni ligongo ŵandu akuti, “Ŵangalola ni ŵalemele ngaajinjila mu nyuumba ja uchimwene.”<verse eid="2SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9" />Che Daudi ŵatemi ku likome lyo, ni musi wo wauŵilasile “Musi u che Daudi.” Che Daudi ŵagumbesye litaka pamalo papaliji ni lichemba kutandilila chakungopochelo lyuŵa kwaula mukanti musi. <verse eid="2SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10" />Nombe che Daudi ŵapundile kukola machili kwannope ligongo Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwa ŵangondo ŵa kwinani ŵaliji pamo najo.<verse eid="2SA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11" />Nipele, mwenye che Hilamu jwa ku Tilo ŵatumile ŵantenga ku che Daudi, ŵampelechele sooni itela ya mielesi, ni maselemala ni ŵakutaŵa ŵaŵataŵile nyuumba ja uchimwene ji che Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12" />Kwayele, che Daudi ŵamanyilile kuti Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaliji anlimbisye kuti aŵe mwenye jwa ku Isilaeli, ni kuutenda umwenye wakwe uŵe wekulungwa kwaligongo lya ŵandu ŵakwe ŵa ku Isilaeli.<verse eid="2SA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13" />Che Daudi paŵatyosile ku Hebuloni ni kwika ku Yelusalemu ŵalombele achakongwe ŵajinji ni kukola ilanga yejinji. Ni ŵaŵeleche ŵanache ŵachilume ni ŵachikongwe ŵajinji. <verse eid="2SA 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14" />Gelega gali meena ga ŵanache ŵachilume, ŵaŵaŵeleche kwa achakongwe ŵakwe kwele ku Yelusalemu ko: Che Shamua ni che Shobabu ni che Natani ni che Selemani, <verse eid="2SA 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15" />ni che Ibali ni che Elishua ni che Nefegi ni che Yafia <verse eid="2SA 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16" />ni che Elishama ni che Eliada ni che Elifeleti.<verse eid="2SA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akwapunda Ŵafilisiti pangondo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 14:8-17">1 Indu ya katema 14:8-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17" />Ŵafilisiti paŵapilikene kuti che Daudi ŵaajitilile mauta aŵe mwenye jwa ku Isilaeli, ŵanawose ŵapite kukwasosa kuti ŵaakamule ni kwajigala, nambo che Daudi paŵapilikene ngani jo, ŵatulwiche kuja kwinjila mu likome. <verse eid="2SA 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18" />Ŵafilisiti ŵaiche ni kuŵika chigono ku chiŵata cha ku Lefaimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19" />Nipele, che Daudi ŵammusisye Ambuje Akunnungu, “Uli, nyaule ngaapute Ŵafilisiti? Uli chimuundende naapunde?” Nombe Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Daudi, “Njauleje, pakuŵapo kusyene tinannetende mwapunde Ŵafilisiti.” <verse eid="2SA 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20" />Nipele, che Daudi ŵakuiche ku Baali Pelasimu, ni kwapunda Ŵafilisiti, nipele ŵatite, “Ambuje Akunnungu apitile pasikati ja ŵammagongo ŵangu nti chikumba meesi.” Lyele ni ligongo pamalo po paŵilanjikwe Baali Pelasimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21" />Ŵafilisiti ŵautwiche, ŵalesile inyago yao, nombe che Daudi ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵaijigele.<verse eid="2SA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22" />Ulendo waaŵili, Ŵafilisiti ŵaiche sooni ni kuŵika chigono ku chiŵata cha Lefaimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23" />Che Daudi paŵammusisye Ambuje Akunnungu, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵanjanjile kuti, “Nkaagungumuchila nchityochelaga akuno kunli kuno, nambo nsyungule ni kwagungumuchila upaande wine nchityochelaga malo gagakulolegana ni itela ya mibani. <verse eid="2SA 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24" />Ni patimpikane liloŵe nti misiindo ja sajo kutyochela pa itela ya mibani jo, pelepo nlimbe ntima pakuŵapo une tiiche kulongolela mmbujo mwenu kuti ngaapute ŵangondo ŵa Ŵafilisiti.” <verse eid="2SA 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25" />Nipele, che Daudi ŵatesile mpela iŵasalilwe ni Ambuje Akunnungu, nombejo ŵaaputile Ŵafilisiti kutandilila ku Geba mpaka ku Geseli.<verse eid="2SA 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6" />
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akulijausya lisanduku lya lilangano ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 13:1-14">1 Indu ya katema 13:1-14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 15:25-16:6">15:25-16:6,43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1" />Che Daudi ŵaasonganyisye sooni ŵangondo elufu salasini ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵakumanyilila kuputana ngondo. <verse eid="2SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2" />Che Daudi ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵapite ku Baala Yuda, kwaula kukulijigala kweleko Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu lyalikuŵilanjikwa kwa liina lyakwe Ambuje Akunnungu ŵamachili, ŵakutama pa chitengu chakwe cha umwenye, pachanya pa yepanganyikwe yaili ni mapapiko. <verse eid="2SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3" />Nipele, ŵalijigele lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu kutyochela mu nyuumba ji che Abinadabu jijaliji ku chitumbi, ŵaliŵisile mmutuka jasambano. Che Usa ni che Ahio ŵanache ŵa che Abinadabu ŵaliji nkujilongosyo jele mutuka jo, <verse eid="2SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4" />jili ni lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu, ni che Ahio ŵaliji nkulongolela chammbujo mwa lisanduku lyo. <verse eid="2SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5" />Che Daudi ni ŵandu wose ŵa ku Isilaeli, ŵaliji nkwimba nyiimbo ni kutyala kwa machili gao gose, paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu. Ŵagombile ingwenyengwenye ni inanda ni tugoma twamwana ni kayamba ni choombo cha paung'asi chachikuŵilanjikwa matoasi. <verse eid="2SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6" />Paŵaiche ku luŵala lwakuputukulila yakulya lwa ku Nakoni, che Usa ŵaugolwesye nkono wakwe ni kulikamula lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu pakuŵa ng'ombe sila syalikuŵele <verse eid="2SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7" />Pelepo, lutumbilo lwa Ambuje Akunnungu lwannyichilile che Usa. Kwayele Akunnungu ŵammuleje papopo. Che Usa ŵawile papopo chiŵandi ni lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="2SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8" />Nombe che Daudi yaachimile pakuŵapo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵanjamwiche che Usa kwa chikali. Kwayele, pamalo po paŵilanjikwe Pelesi Usa mpaka lelojino. <verse eid="2SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9" />Palyuŵa lyo che Daudi ŵanjogwepe Ambuje Akunnungu, ni ŵatite, “Sambano uneji tingombole chinauli kulijigala ni kuligosa lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu?” <verse eid="2SA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10" />Kwayele, che Daudi ŵajogwepe kulijigala lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu ku musi wakwe musi wa che Daudi, nambo che Daudi ŵalijawisye ku nyuumba ku che Obedi Edomu jwa musi wa ku Giti. <verse eid="2SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11" />Lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu lyo lyatemi ku nyuumba ji che Obedi Edomu kwa miesi jitatu, nombe Ambuje Akunnungu ŵampele upile che Obedi Edomu ni ŵapannango wakwe wose.<verse eid="2SA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12" />Mwenye che Daudi paŵapilikene kuti Ambuje Akunnungu ŵapele upile ŵandu ŵapannango u che Obedi Edomu ni indu yose yakwete ligongo lya lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵajawile kukulijigala lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu mu nyuumba ji che Obedi Edomu ni kulijausya ku musi u che Daudi ali nkusengwa. <verse eid="2SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13" />Ŵandu ŵaŵalijigele lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu ŵala, paŵajesile sajo sita, che Daudi ŵaajimiche, ŵapeleche mbopesi ja ng'ombe jankambako ni mwanache jwa ng'ombe jwakwimbala. <verse eid="2SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14" />Che Daudi ŵatyasile paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu kwa machili gao gose ali awasile nguo ja chimbopesi. <verse eid="2SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15" />Kwayele, che Daudi ni Ŵaisilaeli wose ŵalijawisye lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu mpaka ku musi wa che Daudi kwa kuchina ni ali nkugomba mapenga. <verse eid="2SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16" />Lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu palyajinjilaga ku musi u che Daudi, che Mikali mwali ju che Sauli ŵalingulile pedilisha ni ŵammweni mwenye che Daudi ali nkugulukaguluka ni kutyala paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, nipele, ŵannyelwisye muntima mwakwe. <verse eid="2SA 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17" />Nipele ŵalijinjisye lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu mu lisakasa lyati che Daudi ŵalijimiche pelepo ni ŵaliŵisile pamalo pakwe. Nombe che Daudi ŵapeleche mbopesi syakutinisya ni mbopesi sya chitendewele paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="2SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18" />Che Daudi paŵamasile kupeleka mbopesi sya kutinisya ni mbopesi sya chitendewele, ŵaapele upile ŵandu kwa liina lya Ambuje Akunnungu ŵali ni machili gose. <verse eid="2SA 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19" />Sooni ŵaagaŵile yakulya ŵandu wosepe, achalume ni achakongwe, jwalijose ŵampele nkate ni chipaande cha nyama jejoche ni nkate wekolosye ni isogosi ya sabibu syejumu. Kanyuma ŵandu wose ŵatyosile, jwalijose jwausile kunyuumba kwakwe. <verse eid="2SA 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20" />Kanyuma che Daudi ŵausile kunyuumba jakwe kuti akaape upile ŵandu ŵamunyuumba jakwe, che Mikali mwali ju che Sauli ŵajawile kukwachingamila, ni ŵatite, “Mwenye jwa Ŵaisilaeli alijalwisye lelo, kwa kutama matakope paujo pa ŵakutumichila ŵakwe, achalume ni achakongwe mpela jwampungwane yakuti kuwula yakuwala yakwe paujo pa ŵandu pangali soni!”<verse eid="2SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21" />Che Daudi ŵanjanjile che Mikali, “Naliji nkutyala paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, juŵasagwile une pamalo pa atati ŵenu, ni ŵandu ŵa paulongo wakwe, kuti me mtawala pa Isilaeli, ni kwa ŵandu ŵakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, kwayele, uneji tindyale pe kwachimbichisya Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="2SA 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22" />Sooni tinalitulusye nansyene mwakupunda ni sambano. Mmweji timumone nganiŵa chindu, nambo ŵele ŵakutumichila achakongwe umwasasile wo tachinjimbichisya.”<verse eid="2SA 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23" />Nipele che Mikali mwali ju che Sauli nganaŵeleka mpaka chiŵa chakwe.<verse eid="2SA 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7" />
  <para style="s">Utenga wa Ambuje Akunnungu kwa che Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 17:1-15">1 Indu ya katema 17:1-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1" />Mwenye che Daudi paŵaliji nkutama ku nyuumba jakwe ja uchimwene, nombe Ambuje Akunnungu ali ankombolesye kukola chitendewele ni ŵammagongo wakwe kulikose, <verse eid="2SA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2" />mwenye che Daudi ŵansalile jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu che Natani kuti, “Nnole, uneji ngutama mu nyuumba jetaŵikwe ni itela ya mielesi, nambo lisanduku lya lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu likutama mu lisakasa.”<verse eid="2SA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3" />Che Natani ŵanjanjile mwenye, “Njaule nkatende chilichose chinkuchiganisya muntima mwenu, pakuŵapo Ambuje Akunnungu ali pamo ni mmwe.” <verse eid="2SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4" />Nambo chilo chilachila Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Natani, <verse eid="2SA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5" />kuti “Njaule nkaasalile jwakutumichila jwangu che Daudi kuti ‘Ambuje Akunnungu akuti nnyi: Uli mmwejo timundaŵile uneji nyuumba jakutama? <verse eid="2SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6" />Kutandilila alila lyuŵa panaakopwesye Ŵaisilaeli mu chilambo cha ku Misili mpaka lelojino nganindame mu nyuumba. Nyesile kulikose njitamaga mmasakasa. <verse eid="2SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7" />Kulikose kunyawile ni Ŵaisilaeli, uli apali chilongola julijose jwa lukosyo lwa Isilaeli junanlamulile kuti ŵagose ŵandu ŵangu Ŵaisilaeli junammusisye kuti: Kwachichi nganimundaŵila nyuumba ja itela ya mielesi.’”<verse eid="2SA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8" />“Kwayele, munsalile jwakutumichila jwangu che Daudi: Ambuje Akunnungu ŵa machili gose akuti nnyi, ‘Nantyosisye mwitinji kumwachingaga ngondolo, kuti mwatawale ŵandu ŵangu Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9" />Kutandilila katema ko mele pamo ni mmwe kulikose kumwajawile ni naauleje ŵammagongo ŵenu wose paujo penu. Tinantende mme jwankulu mpela achakulu ŵane ŵapachilambo. <verse eid="2SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10" />None tinaape ŵandu ŵangu Ŵaisilaeli pamalo pakutama, ni tinjatamika kweleko kuti akole malo gawogawope gakutama pangali ŵakwasausya sooni. Ni ŵandu ŵachigongomalo ngasiŵaalagasya sooni nti iyaliji kuundanda po, <verse eid="2SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:11" />kutandilila katema panaasagwile ŵakulamula kwalongosya ŵandu ŵangu Ŵaisilaeli. Sooni une tinankulupusye ni ŵammagongo ŵenu wosepe. Kupunda ni yeleyo, une Ambuje Akunnungu nguntangachisya kuti tinantaŵile nyuumba. <verse eid="2SA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12" />Ndaŵi jitinchiwa ni pitachinsika mmalembe ga achinangolo ŵenu, jumo jwa ŵanache ŵenu jutimummeleche mmwe mwasyene tinjintenda aŵe mwenye pamalo penu, ni une tinjiulimbisya umwenye wakwe. <verse eid="2SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13" />Jwelejo ni jutachitaŵa nyuumba kwaligongo lya liina lyangu ni chitengu chakwe cha umwenye tinjichilimbisya moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="2SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14" />Uneji tinjiŵa atatigwe, nombejo tachiŵa mwanangu. Atendaga yangalumbana, tinjinjamuka nti ŵandu yakuti kwajamuka achiŵanagwe ni lubokola. <verse eid="2SA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15" />Nambo ngasinantyochesya chinonyelo changu changamala nti inatite pakuchityosya ku che Sauli, junantyosisye paujo penu. <verse eid="2SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16" />Tiinjiulimbisya uŵelesi wenu ni umwenye wenu moŵa gose pangali mbesi. Chitengu chenu cha umwenye tiinjichilimbisya moŵa gose pangali mbesi.’”<verse eid="2SA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17" />Che Natani ŵansalile che Daudi indu yose iŵasalilwe ni Akunnungu mu yakuilola yo.<verse eid="2SA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akwatogolela Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 17:16-27">1 Indu ya katema 17:16-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18" />Nipele mwenye che Daudi ŵajinjile mu lisaka lyalili ni upagwe wa Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵatemi ni ŵapopesile kwa Ambuje Akunnungu achitiji, “Alakwe Akunnungu ŵali ni ukombole, uneji nduni ni uŵelesi wangu ali ŵani, pakuŵa, nganguŵajilwa kuipochela indu yamundendele uneji ni kuunjimbichisya mpaka apano pandili lelo! <verse eid="2SA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19" />Sooni, chindu chi chaliji chamwana pameso pa ŵalakwe Ambuje Akunnungu. Kupunda ni yeleyo mwalanjile ŵandu ŵapaulongo wangu indu yekulungwa mu yaka yejinji yaikwika ni muunosisye indu yankati iŵelesi yejinji yaikuika, ŵalakwe Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="2SA 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20" />Saleje ichichi yakupunda kukwenu! Pakuŵapo mmweji nkuumanyilila uneji jwakutumichila jwenu. <verse eid="2SA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21" />Kwaligongo lya chilanga chenu, ni malinga ni ntima wenu, ntesile yekulu yose yo, kuti une jwakutumichila jwenu ndameje njimanyililaga. <verse eid="2SA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵanli ni machili gose ŵalakwejo nli ŵakulu kwapunda ŵane wose. Nganapagwa Akunnungu jwali mpela malinga ni yanayose ituipikene ni mapilikanilo getu. <verse eid="2SA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23" />Sooni ana ŵandu chi pachilambo pano ŵakukombola kwalinganya ni ŵandu ŵenu Ŵaisilaeli, ŵati Akunnungu jwawo ŵajawile kwawombola atyoche ku Misili kuti aŵe ŵandu ŵakwe? Alakwe Akunnungu mwapikaniche pakutendela indu yekulungwa ni yakogoya kwaligongo lya ŵandu ŵenu, ni mwatopwele ŵandu ŵa ilambo ine ni minungu jawo paujo pao. <verse eid="2SA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24" />Namose kwalimbisya ŵandu ŵenu Ŵaisilaeli kwaligongo lyenu mwasyene, kuti aŵeje ŵandu ŵenu moŵa gose pangali mbesi, nomwe alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu mmele Akunnungu ŵawo.”<verse eid="2SA 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25" />“Nipele, sambano Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, choonde nchitindimisye chilanga chimwasasile nkati une jwakutumichila jwenu ni nkati iŵelesi yangu, mwalimbisye moŵa gose pangali mbesi mpela intite pakulanga. <verse eid="2SA 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26" />Ni liina lyenu tilichiŵa lyekulungwa moŵa gose, ni ŵandu tachitiji, ‘Ambuje Akunnungu ŵa machili gose ali Akunnungu pa Isilaeli.’ Ni iŵelesi yangu, une che Daudi jwakutumichila jwenu, tiichilimbangana paujo penu moŵa gose. <verse eid="2SA 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27" />Pakuŵapo alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu ŵamachili gose, Akunnungu jwa ku Isilaeli, muumunukulile une jwakutumichila jwenu, nchitiji, ‘Tinantaŵile nyuumba,’ lyelelyo ni ligongo lyakwe mbatile lung'wanu lwa kummenda mapopelo ga.”<verse eid="2SA 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28" />“Ni sambano, alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, mmweji nli Akunnungu, katema kose nkutindimisya ilanga yenu, ni muunanjile une jwakutumichila jwenu chelechi chindu chambone chi. <verse eid="2SA 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29" />Kwayele, ngummenda muupe upile uŵelesi wangu uneji jwakutumichila jwenu kuti utamilisye paujo penu moŵa gose pangali mbesi. Pakuŵapo mmweji Ambuje Akunnungu nnajile yeleyo, sooni kwa upile wenu, uŵelesi wangu tiuchikola upile moŵa gose pangali mbesi.”<verse eid="2SA 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akupunda ngondo syasijinji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 18:1-17">1 Indu ya katema 18:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1" />Pakumala yeleyo, che Daudi ŵaagungumuchile sooni ni Ŵafilisiti, ni ŵaapundile. Ŵasumwile musi wa Metege Ama kutyochela kwa Ŵafilisiti. <verse eid="2SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2" />Sooni ŵaapundile ŵangondo ŵa Ŵamoabu. Ni ŵaapanjile pa misitali mateka wo, ni kwagoneka manguku pasi. Ŵalamulaga kuti aŵala ŵaali pa misitali jiŵili aulajikwe ni aŵala ŵaali pa msitali ŵaatatu ŵaaleche ŵajumi. Kwayele, Ŵamoabu ŵaliji nkwatumichila che Daudi ni ŵaliji nkulipa nsongo.<verse eid="2SA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3" />Sooni che Daudi ŵampundile che Hadadeseli mwana ju che Lehobu, mwenye jwa ku Soba jwa chilambo cha Ŵaalamu. Che Daudi ŵapundile yeleyi katema che Hadadeseli paŵaliji mwitala kwaula kukugausya malo ga ku lusulo lwa Efulate liŵe pa utawala wakwe. <verse eid="2SA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4" />Che Daudi ŵaakamwile mateeka ŵandu ŵakukwela mu falasi elufu moja na mia saba, ni ŵangondo ŵakwenda wapasi elufu ishilini. Nipele che Daudi ŵakatile mitasi ja mmakongolo ga panyuma ja falasi ŵaakukwekwelemya mutuka, nambo ŵasigesye falasi ŵakwanila kukwekwelemya mutuka mia moja.<verse eid="2SA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5" />Ŵaalamu ŵakutama ku Damesiki paŵajawile kukunkamuchisya che Hadadeseli, mwenye jwa ku Soba, che Daudi ŵaagungumuchile ni kwaulaga ŵandu elufu ishilini na mbili. <verse eid="2SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6" />Sooni che Daudi ŵaŵisile igono ya ŵangondo wa Ŵaalamu ŵakutama ku Damesiki. Nipele Ŵaalamu ŵaliji ŵakutumichila ŵakwe ni sooni ŵaliji nkulipa nsongo. Ambuje Akunnungu ŵampele che Daudi kupunda kulikose kuŵajaulaga. <verse eid="2SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7" />Che Daudi ŵajigele yakulichinjila pantima ya sahabu iŵaijigalaga ŵangondo ŵa che Hadadeseli ni kuijausya ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8" />Sooni mwenye che Daudi ŵajigele shaba jejinji kwannope kutyochela ku misi ja ku Beta ni ku Belotai misi jiŵajitawalaga che Hadadeseli.<verse eid="2SA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9" />Che Toi mwenye jwa ku Hamati paŵapilikene kuti che Daudi ŵaapundile ŵangondo wose ŵa che Hadadeseli, <verse eid="2SA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:10" />ŵantumile che Yolamu mwanagwe kwa mwenye che Daudi kukwatogolela ligongo lyakuti amputile che Hadadeseli ni kumpunda. Ŵatesile yeleyo ligongo mwenye che Hadadeseli ni mwenye che Toi ŵaliji ŵammagongo nombe ŵamenyene ngondo kakajinji. Pakwaula po che Yolamu ŵanjigalile che Daudi ntuuka wa indu yejinji yepanganyikwe ni madini ga feza ni sahabu ni shaba. <verse eid="2SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11" />Yele indu yo che Daudi ŵaiŵisile pajika kwaligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu pamo ni madini ga feza ni sahabu ni jiŵasumwile kwa ŵandu ŵa ilambo yose ŵele ŵaŵaapundile pa ngondo, <verse eid="2SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:12" />yaani kutandilila ku Edomu ni ku Moabu ni ku Amoni ni kwa Ŵafilisiti ni ku Amaleki pamo ni indu iŵaijigele kwa mwenye che Hadadeseli mwanagwe che Lehobu mwenye jwa ku Soba.<verse eid="2SA 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13" />Nipele che Daudi ŵapundile kumanyika kwannope, paŵaujaga pakumala kwaulaga Ŵaedomu elufu kumi na nane, ku Chiŵata cha Njete. <verse eid="2SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14" />Ŵaŵisile chigono cha ŵangondo ŵakwe pa Edomu jose. Nombe Ŵaedomu wose ŵa kweleko ŵaliji ŵakutumichila ŵakwe. Ambuje Akunnungu ŵampele che Daudi kupunda kulikose kuŵajaulaga.<verse eid="2SA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15" />Kwayele, che Daudi ŵatawele chilambo chose cha Ŵaisilaeli, ni ŵalongwesye ŵandu ŵakwe kwagoloka pangali lusagu. <verse eid="2SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16" />Che Yoabu mwanagwe che Seluya, ni juŵaliji jwankulu jwa ŵangondo. Che Yehoshafati mwanagwe che Ahiludi, ni juŵaliji jwakulemba indu yose iyatendekwe. <verse eid="2SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17" />Che Sadoki mwanache ju che Ahitubu ni che Ahimeleki mwanache ju che Abiasali, ŵaliji ŵambopesi. Che Selaya ŵaliji jwakulemba indu yetendekwe pankungulu. <verse eid="2SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18" />Che Benaya mwanache ju che Yehoyada ŵaliji chilongola jwa ngosyo sya Ŵakeleti ni Ŵapelesi ŵaŵaliji ŵakulindilila ŵa che Daudi, nombe ŵanache ŵa che Daudi ŵaalongwesye ŵandu kugakuya malamusi ga pa uchimwene.<verse eid="2SA 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9" />
  <para style="s">Umbone u che Daudi ku che Mefibosheti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1" />Palyuŵa limo che Daudi ŵausisye kuti, “Ana kwana mundu jwalijose jwasigalile jwanjumi jwa pa ulongo u che Sauli? Iŵaga apali, ngasachile kwalosya unonyelo kwaligongo lya lilangano linatesile ku che Yonasani.”<verse eid="2SA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2" />Kwaliji ni jwakutumichila jwa paulongo u che Sauli jwakuŵilanjikwa che Siba. Ŵasalilwe kuti ajaule ku che Daudi. Mwenye che Daudi ŵammusisye kuti, “Ana mmweji nli che Siba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:2">Nombejo ŵajanjile, “Elo, ni une jwakutumichila jwenu.”<verse eid="2SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3" />Mwenye ŵausisye, “Uli, apali mundu jwajulijose jwasigalile pa ulongo wa che Yonatani kuti naapanganyichisye ya wema wa Akunnungu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:3">Che Siba ŵajanjile, “Apali mwanache ju che Yonatani, nambo jwelejo alemele makongolo.”<verse eid="2SA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4" />Mwenye ŵausisye, “Ali kwapi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:4">Che Siba ŵajanjile “Ali ku nyuumba ji che Makili mwanache ju che Amieli kwele ku Lodebali ko.” <verse eid="2SA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5" />Nipele mwenye che Daudi ŵatumile ŵandu kuti akanjigale, ŵandu wo ŵajile kukunjigala ku nyuumba ji che Makili mwanache ju che Amieli ku Lodebali.<verse eid="2SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6" />Nipele che Mefibosheti mwanache ju che Yonatani, juŵaliji chisukulu chi che Sauli ŵajawile kwa mwenye che Daudi, ŵanjinamile mwenye che Daudi kwapa luchimbichimbi. Che Daudi ŵammilasile, “Che Mefibosheti.” Nombejo ŵajanjile, “Ni une, jwakutumichila jwenu.”<verse eid="2SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7" />Che Daudi ŵansalile, “Nkajogopa. Uneji tinampanganyichisye ya wema kwaligongo lya atati ŵenu che Yonatani. Alila lisi lyose lilyaliji lya ambuje ŵenu che Sauli ngummuchisya. Nomwe, moŵa gose tinchilya pampasa pangu.” <verse eid="2SA 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8" />Che Mefibosheti ŵanjinamile che Daudi kulosya luchimbichimbi ni kuti, “Uneji ndili mpela mmbwa jewe, ligongo chichi muumbanganyichisye wema uno?”<verse eid="2SA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9" />Nipele mwenye che Daudi ŵammilasile che Siba jwakutumichila ju che Sauli, ŵansalile, “Aila ipanje yose i che Sauli ni ŵapaulongo wakwe napele chisukulu cha ambuje jwenu che Sauli. <verse eid="2SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10" />Mmweji ni ŵanache ŵenu ni ŵakutumichila ŵenu timunlimile che Mefibosheti ni tinnyiche nawo magowolo kuti chisukulu cha ambuje ŵenu akoleje chakulya moŵa gose. Nambo nsyene jo tachilya pa mpasa wangu.” Che Siba ŵaliji ni ŵanache ŵachilume kumi na tano ni ŵakutumichila ishilini.<verse eid="2SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11" />Nipele che Siba ŵansalile mwenye, “Uneji jwakutumichila, timbanganye kila chindu chichimuusalile.” Nipele che Mefibosheti ŵaliji nkulya chakulya pa mpasa wa mwenye nti jumo jwa ŵananche ŵa mwenye. <verse eid="2SA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 9:12" />Che Mefibosheti ŵakwete mwanache jwachilume jwannondi jwakuŵilanjikwa che Mika. Ŵandu wosepe ŵapaulongo wa che Siba ŵaliji ŵakutumichila ŵa che Mefibosheti. <verse eid="2SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:13" />Kwayele, che Mefibosheti juŵaliji alemele makongolo gawo gose, ŵaliji nkutama ku Yelusalemu, ni kulya chakulya pa mpasa wa mwenye moŵa gosepe.<verse eid="2SA 9:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10" />
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akwapunda Ŵaamoni ni Ŵaashulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 19:19">1 Indu ya katema 19:19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1" />Pakumala yeleyo, mwenye che Nahashi jwa Ŵaamoni ŵawile, ni mwanagwe jwakuŵilanjikwaa che Hanuni ŵaliji mwenye pamalo pa atatigwe. <verse eid="2SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2" />Mwenye che Daudi ni ŵatite, “Tinantendele indu yambone che Hanuni, mwanache ju che Nahashi mpela muŵandendele atatigwe indu yambone.” Kwayele, che Daudi ŵatumile ŵantenga kuti akantulasye che Hanuni ligongo lya chiwa cha atatigwe. Ni ŵantenga ŵa che Daudi ŵala paŵaiche mu chilambo cha Ŵaamoni, <verse eid="2SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3" />achakulu ŵa Ŵaamoni ŵansalile ambuje jwawo che Hanuni kuti, “Ana nkuganisya kuti che Daudi pakuntumichisya ŵandu ŵakuntulasya akunchimbichisya atatigwenu? Ana che Daudi nganaatuma aŵa ŵandu ŵa kukwenu kuti aulolesye ni kuuchilichisya musi nipele ausumule?”<verse eid="2SA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4" />Nipele, che Hanuni ŵaakamwile ŵantenga ŵa che Daudi ŵala ŵaamyosile ndewu upande umo, ni sooni ŵapapwile yakuwala yao pasikati kutandilila kungongo mpaka paasi, nipele ŵaalesile ajauleje. <verse eid="2SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5" />Che Daudi paŵasalilwe yeleyi, ŵatumile ŵandu akasimane nawo, ligongo ŵanyawo yakamwile soni nnope. Mwenye ŵasalile kuti, “Ntameje kaje ku Yeliko, mpaka sili simesile ndewu syenu, pele ni mmujeje kumusi.”<verse eid="2SA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6" />Ŵaamoni paŵaiweni kuti ŵaachimikasisye che Daudi, ŵakodisisye ŵangondo ŵa Ŵaalamu elufu ishilini ŵaakwenda wapasi kutyochela ku Betilehobu ni ku Soba; sooni mwenye jwa ku Maaka pamo ni ŵandu elufu moja, ni kutyochela ku Tobu ŵangondo elufu kumi na mbili.<verse eid="2SA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7" />Nombe che Daudi piŵapikene ŵantumile che Yoabu, ni mpingo wose wa ŵangondo ŵakukombola kujiputa ngondo. <verse eid="2SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8" />Ŵaamoni ŵatyosile ni kuliŵika chile kwa ngondo pa nnango wa musi ku Laba, musi wao wekulu. Nombe Ŵaalamu kutyochela ku Soba ni ku Lehobu ni ŵandu kutyochela ku Tobu ni ku Maaka ŵalipanjile peuto pakulanguka.<verse eid="2SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9" />Che Yoabu paŵaiweni kuti ngondo jili jakulimba paujo ni chakunyuma, ŵaasagwile ŵangondo ŵampepe ŵamachili kwannope ŵa Ŵaisilaeli, ni ŵaaŵisile pa ulongosi wakwe kuti aputane ni Ŵaalamu ŵaŵaliji pamalo pakulanguka. <verse eid="2SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10" />Ŵangondo ŵane ŵaŵasigalile ŵala ŵaaŵisile pa ulongosi wa mpwakwe che Abishai, nombejo ŵaapanjile kuti aputane ni Ŵaamoni. <verse eid="2SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11" />Che Yoabu ŵansalile che Abishai kuti, “Iŵaga Ŵaalamu akuumbunda machili, timungamuchisye nambo iŵaga Ŵaamoni akumpunda machili tiiche kukunkamuchisya. <verse eid="2SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12" />Nambo mme ŵakukalamuka! Tuputane chilumelume kwaligongo lya ŵandu ŵetu ni kwaligongo lya misi ja Akunnungu jwetu, nombe Ambuje Akunnungu atupanganyichisye yakuiwona kuti ili yambone kukwakwe.”<verse eid="2SA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13" />Nipele che Yoabu ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵasejele chammbujo kwagungumuchila Ŵaalamu, ni Ŵaalamu ŵautwiche paujo pao. <verse eid="2SA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14" />Ŵaamoni paŵaiweni kuti Ŵaalamu autwiche, nombe nawo ŵambutwiche che Abishai ni kwinjila mmusi. Che Yoabu ŵalesile kuputana ni Ŵaamoni ni kuuja ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15" />Nambo Ŵaalamu paŵaiweni kuti ŵaalepele Ŵaisilaeli, ŵasongangenye mipingo jao ja ŵangondo pamo. <verse eid="2SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16" />Mwenye che Hadadeseli ŵalajisye kuti akaajigale Ŵaalamu ŵaŵaliji pesi ja lusulo lwa Efulate, ŵaajausye ku Helamu achilongoswaga ni che Shobaki jwankulu jwa mpingo wa ngondo wa che Hadadeseli. <verse eid="2SA 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17" />Che Daudi paŵapilikene yeleyo, ŵaasongangenye pamo Ŵaisilaeli wose, ŵajombweche lusulo lwa Yolodani ni kwaula mpaka ku Helamu kuŵaliŵisile chile Ŵaalamu kuputana ngondo ni che Daudi, ni ŵatandite kuputana najo. <verse eid="2SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18" />Nambo Ŵaalamu ŵautwiche paujo pa Ŵaisilaeli. Che Daudi ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵauleje Ŵaalamu mia saba ŵaŵaliji nkwendesya mutuka sya ngondo, ni ŵakwela falasi elufu alobaini. Sooni ŵammulesye che Shobaki jwankulu jwa ngondo jwao, nombejo ŵawilile papopo. <verse eid="2SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19" />Katema mamwenye wose ŵaŵantumichilaga che Hadadeseli paŵaiweni kuti apundikwe pangondo ni Ŵaisilaeli, ŵasosile kwilana mu chitendewele ni Ŵaisilaeli, ni ŵaliji ŵakutumichila ŵa Ŵaisilaeli. Kwayele Ŵaalamu ŵajogwepe ni nganiŵaakamuchisya sooni Ŵaamoni.<verse eid="2SA 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11" />
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akutenda sambi ni che Batisheba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1" />Ni yaliji, kuundanda kwa kila chaka, katema mamwenye paŵajaulaga kukuputana ngondo, che Daudi ŵantumile che Yoabu ni achakulu ŵakwe ŵa ŵangondo pamo ni ŵangondo ŵa Ŵaisilaeli akaputane ngondo; ni ŵauleje Ŵaamoni ni kuusyungula musi wa ku Laba. Nambo che Daudi ŵasigele ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2" />Palyuŵa limo muusi, che Daudi ŵajimwiche pachindanda chakwe, ni ŵajendaga pachanya pa chipagala cha nyuumba jakwe ja umwenye chichajili mpela chitatali. Ali nkwendajenda pansakasa po, ŵammweni jwankongwe jumo ali nkoga kumangwakwe. Jwankongwe jo ŵaliji jwakusalala nnope. <verse eid="2SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3" />Che Daudi ŵantumile mundu kuuchilichisya kuti jwankongwe jo nduni. Mundu jo ŵansalile che Daudi kuti, “Jwankongwe jo ali Batisheba mwali ju che Eliamu, ni sooni ali ŵankwakwe che Ulia kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Ŵahiti.” <verse eid="2SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4" />Nipele, che Daudi ŵatumile ŵantenga akaajigale. Nipele che Batisheba ŵaiche ku che Daudi, nombe che Daudi ŵagonile ni jwankongwe jo. Jwankongwe jo ŵaliji nakopoka pe kumala moŵa gakwe ga pa lwesi. <verse eid="2SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5" />Pakupita moŵa jwankongwe jo ŵalimanyilile kuti akwete chitumbo, ni ŵapeleche utenga ku che Daudi kuti ali ni chitumbo chakwe.<verse eid="2SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6" />Nipele che Daudi ŵampelechele che Yoabu utenga waukuti, “Muntume che Ulia jwa lukosyo lwa Ŵahiti aiche kukwangu.” Nombe che Yoabu ŵantumile che Ulia ku che Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7" />Che Ulia paŵaiche ku che Daudi, che Daudi ŵammusisye ngani si che Yoabu, ni ŵandu wosepe, ni kuti ngondo jili uli. <verse eid="2SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8" />Pelepo che Daudi ŵansalile che Ulia, “Njaule kunyuumba jenu nkapumulile.” Che Ulia ŵatyosile ku nyuumba ja mwenye, ni papopo mwenye ŵampelechele ntulilo. <verse eid="2SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9" />Nambo che Ulia nganajaula ku nyuumba kwakwe, pamalo pakwe ŵagonile pannango wa nyuumba ja umwenye pamo ni ŵakulindilila ŵa mwenye. <verse eid="2SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10" />Paŵasalilwe che Daudi kuti che Ulia nganajaula ku nyuumba kwakwe, che Daudi ŵammusisye, “Mmweji mbusile lelo pejino, nganimpagwa kunyuumba jenu kwa moŵa gamajinji, ligongo chichi nganinjaula ku nyuumba jenu?”<verse eid="2SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11" />Che Ulia ŵanjanjile che Daudi, “Lisanduku lya lilangano pamo ni mipingo jose ja ŵangondo ŵa Ŵaisilaeli ni Ŵayuda akutamanga mmasakasa ku ngondo ko. Ambuje jwangu che Yoabu ni ŵakutumichila ŵakwe wose aŵisile chigono pakulanguka. Ana ikomboleka uneji nyaule ku nyuumba ngalye ni kung'wa ni kugona ni ŵankwangu? Ngulumbila, ngangukombola kupanganya chindu chanti chelecho.” <verse eid="2SA 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12" />Nipele che Daudi ŵansalile che Ulia, “Mwambone, ntameje apano lelo, malaŵi tinannechele kuti njaule.” Kwayele che Ulia ŵatemi mmusi mu Yelusalemu pa lyuŵa lyo. Pa lyuŵa lyaŵili lyakwe, <verse eid="2SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13" />che Daudi ŵammilasile che Ulia kuti akalye nawo chakulya ni kung'wa ku nyuumba jakwe ko, ni ŵantesile che Ulia akolelwe. Namose yeleyo, chilo chila che Ulia nganajaula ku nyuumba kwakwe, nambo ŵagonile pampasa wakwe pamo ni ŵakulindilila ŵa mwenye.<verse eid="2SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14" />Kundaŵi kwakwe, che Daudi ŵannembele che Yoabu chikalata chiŵampele che Ulia anjauchisye che Yoabu. <verse eid="2SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15" />Mu chikalata cho che Daudi ŵalembile yelei, “Mummiche che Ulia pa msitali wammbujo, pamalo pajikogoya nnope ngondo ni mmujilanje chapanyuma asigale jika kuti aputikwe awe.” <verse eid="2SA 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16" />Nipele, che Yoabu paŵaugungumuchile musi, ŵammisile che Ulia pamalo paŵaimanyilile kuti ŵangondo ŵa ŵammagongo ŵaliji ŵamachili kwannope. <verse eid="2SA 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17" />Achinsyene musi wo ŵatyosile mmusi wao ni kwika kuputana ni che Yoabu ni ŵangondo ŵaŵaliji pamo nawo. Ŵandu ŵampepe mu ŵangondo ŵa che Daudi ŵaulajikwe. Che Ulia jwa lukosyo lwa Ŵahiti nombe najo ŵaulajikwe.<verse eid="2SA 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18" />Nipele, che Yoabu ŵampelechele utenga mwenye che Daudi achinsalilaga yosepe iyatendekwe ku ngondo. <verse eid="2SA 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19" />Che Yoabu ŵansalile jwantenga juŵantumile jo yeleyi, “Patinkamale kunsalila mwenye indu yosepe ya pangondo, <verse eid="2SA 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20" />mwenye akukombola kutumbila, ni kummusya kuti, ‘Ligongo chichi pamwaputanaga po mwajawile kuŵandichila musi? Nganimmanyililaga kuti akakombwele kunsoma imaje ali mwipupa mwa musi wao? <verse eid="2SA 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21" />Ana ŵani ŵammuleje che Abimeleki mwanache ju che Yelubesheti? Ana nganaŵa jwankongwe jumo mmusi wa ku Tebesi juŵampatuchisye lisyago kutyochela mu lipupa, ni lyammuleje che Abimeleki? Ligongo chichi mwajawile kuŵandichila lipupa?’ Mmwejo nkaasalile yelei, ‘Namose jwakutumichila jwenu che Ulia jwa lukosyo wa Ŵahiti nombejo awile.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22" />Jwantenga jula ŵatyosile. Paŵaiche ŵansalile che Daudi yanayose iŵasalilwe ni che Yoabu kuti asale. <verse eid="2SA 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23" />Jwantenga ŵansalile che Daudi, “Achammagongo ŵetu ŵatupundile machili, ŵatyosile paasa musi ni kutugungumuchila pakulanguka. Nambo uweji twaatopwesye mpaka ku nnango wa musi wao. <verse eid="2SA 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24" />Nipele ŵakukuta mikunje ŵatusomile imaje uweji ŵakutumichila ŵenu kutyochela pepupa. Ŵakutumichila ŵampepe aulajikwe. Namose jwakutumichila jwenu che Ulia jwa lukosyo lwa Ŵahiti, nombejo awile.” <verse eid="2SA 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25" />Che Daudi ŵansalile jwantenga jula kuti, “Nkaasalile che Yoabu yelei, ‘Chele chindu chi chikansausya pakuŵapo chiwa ngachikusagula, pangondo mundu jwalijose jula akuwa. Nlimbichile kulimbana ni ŵandu ŵa musi wo mpaka patimuusumule.’ Nkaasalile che Yoabu yeleyo kuti mwalimbisye ntima.”<verse eid="2SA 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26" />Che Batisheba ŵankwakwe che Ulia jwa lukosyo lwa Ŵahiti paŵapilikene kuti che Ulia aulajikwe, ŵalisile kwa malumbo kwalilila ŵankwakwe. <verse eid="2SA 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27" />Gali gamasile moŵa ga kulila malilo gala che Daudi ŵannyichisye che Batisheba mu nyuumba jakwe, ni ŵaliji ŵankwakwe. Jwankongwe jo ŵammelechele mwanache jwannume, nambo Ambuje Akunnungu ngananonyelwa ni iŵaitesile che Daudi yo.<verse eid="2SA 11:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12" />
  <para style="s">Che Natani akwachapuchila che Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵantumile jwakulondola che Natani ku che Daudi. Che Natani ŵanjaulile che Daudi, ŵansalile kuti, “Ŵapali achalume ŵaŵili pa musi umo. Jumo ŵaliji jwachipanje ni jwine ŵaliji jwakulaga. <verse eid="2SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2" />Jwachipanje jula ŵakwete ngondolo syasijinji ni ng'ombe syasijinji nnope. <verse eid="2SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3" />Nambo jwakulaga jula nganakola chindu chine chilichose ikaŵe kangondolo kankolo kamope, kele kaŵasumile. Kangondolo ko ŵakagosile nombeko kakusile munyuumba jakwe pamo ni achiŵanagwe. Ngondolo jo ŵajilisyaga chakulya chilachila nti chichalyaga ni kujing'wesya mu chikombe chakwe nsyene.Ŵagonaga ali akapakete pa makongolo gakwe. Kaliji mpela mwanache jwakwe jwankongwe. <verse eid="2SA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4" />Palyuŵa limo jwachipanje jula ŵasime ni jwannendo. Nipele jwachipanje jula nganasaka kwigala jumo mwa ngondolo syakwe nsyene pane ng'ombe jakwe, kuti ansinjile jwannendo jwakwe. Pamalo pakwe ŵajawile ni kujigala ngondolo ja jwakulaga jula, ni kunsinjila jwannendo jwakwe.” <verse eid="2SA 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5" />Che Daudi paŵapilikene ngani sya mundu jwachipanje jo, yaachimile kwannope. Ni ŵansalile jwakulondola che Natani kuti, “Ngulumbila kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajumi kuti mundu jwatesile yeleyo akuŵajilwa kuwa! <verse eid="2SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6" />Akusachilwa anlipe mundu jwakulaga jo kangondolo ko, sooni pa kangondolo ko awuchisye ŵananche ŵane ŵangondolo ncheche, pakuŵapo atesile chindu changalumbana ni nganakola chanasa!”<verse eid="2SA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7" />Jwakulondola che Natani ŵansalile che Daudi, “Mmweji ni mundu jo! Sambano mpilikane, chelechi ni chakusala Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwa ku Isilaeli, ‘Nanjitilile mauta mme mwenye pa Ŵaisilaeli ni nankulupwisye mmakono mu che Sauli. <verse eid="2SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8" />Nampele umwenye wa mmbuje gwenu ni achiŵali ŵakwe, aŵe achiŵankwenu sooni nantesile mme mwenye jwa ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli ni ŵa ku Yuda. Yeleyo ikaliji ngaikukwana nganjonjechesye nnope mwakupunda yeleyo. <verse eid="2SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9" />Ligongo chichi, nlinyosisye liloŵe lyangu uneji Ambuje Akunnungu ni kuitenda yakusakala yi paujo pangu? Mummuleje che Ulia jwa lukosyo lwa Ŵahiti, ni lipanga, munjigele ŵankwakwe kuntenda ŵankwenu. Mwatendekasisye Ŵaamoni ammulaje Ulia jo pangondo! <verse eid="2SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10" />Kwayeleyo, pakuŵa muunyosisye une ni munjigele jwankongwe ju che Ulia jwa lukosyo lwa Ŵahiti aŵe ŵankwenu, maulago ngagatyoka pa uŵelesi wenu.’ <verse eid="2SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11" />Gelega ni gaakusala Ambuje Akunnungu, ‘Nnole, tinangwisisye masausyo pannango wenu mwasyene. Tinaajigale achiŵankwenu nchilolaga kumpa jwapachiŵandi penu, nombejo tachigona nawo muusi mbee. <verse eid="2SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12" />Mmweji mwatesile yeleyo kwa chisyepela, nambo uneji tinachitende chelecho muusi mbee Ŵaisilaeli wose achilolaga.’”<verse eid="2SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13" />Nipele, che Daudi ŵansalile che Natani, “Naaleŵele Ambuje Akunnungu.” Che Natani ŵansalile che Daudi, “Ambuje Akunnungu annechelesye sambi jenu, nomwe ngammwa. <verse eid="2SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14" />Nambo, pakuŵa kwakupanganya yeleyo mwatesile ŵammagongo ŵa Ambuje Akunnungu alosye manyosyo, mwanache jutimummeleche tachiwa.” <verse eid="2SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15" />Nipele che Natani ŵausile kunyuumba kwakwe.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 12:15">Mwanache ju che Daudi akuwa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:15">Ambuje Akunnungu ŵamputile mwanache juŵaŵelechele che Daudi ku che Batisheba ŵankwakwe che Ulia jwa lukosyo lwa Ŵahiti, nombejo ŵalwasile nnope. <verse eid="2SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16" />Che Daudi ŵapopesile kwa Akunnungu kuti mwanache alame. Ŵataŵile kulya ni ŵajawile kuchuumba kwakwe, ni chilo chose ŵagonile paasi. <verse eid="2SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17" />Ŵakutumichila achakulu ŵa mu nyuumba mo ŵankuiye ni kunchondelela ajimuche, nambo ŵakanile, ni nganalya chakulya chilichose pamo nawo. <verse eid="2SA 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18" />Pakumala chijumaa chimo, mwanache jo jwawile. Ŵakutumichila ŵa che Daudi ŵajogwepe kwasalila kuti mwanache awile, pakuŵapo ŵapelaga kuti, “Mwanache jo paŵaliji jwanjumi, twakungulwiche nawo, nambo nganatupikanila. Sambano chitwasalile chinauli kuti mwanache jwakwe awile? Panepa taliulasye.”<verse eid="2SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19" />Che Daudi paŵaweni ŵakutumichila ŵakwe akusogoda, ŵaimanyilile kuti mwanache ajasiche. Kwayele ŵaausisye kuti, “Uli, mwanache ajasiche?” Nombe ŵanyawo ŵajanjile, “Elo! Ajasiche.” <verse eid="2SA 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20" />Nipele, che Daudi ŵajimi kutyochela paasi pala, ŵajosile, ŵalipachile mauta ni kuwala nguo sine. Nipele ŵajawile ku nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu ni kwapopelela. Nipele ŵausile ku nyuumba jakwe ni paŵasachile chakulya, ŵampele, nombejo ŵalile. <verse eid="2SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21" />Pelepo ŵakutumichila ŵakwe ŵausisye kuti, “Ana chelechi chili chindu chi chinkuchipanganya chi? Mwanache paŵaliji jwanjumi mmwejo mwataŵile ni kwalilila. Nambo paajasiche, njimi ni kulya chakulya.” <verse eid="2SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22" />Che Daudi ŵajanjile, “Isyene mwanache paŵaliji jwanjumi nataŵile ni kulila. Natesile yeleyo ligongo naganisisye kuti, ‘Ana ŵani akwimanyilila? Panepa Ambuje Akunnungu akangolele chanasa kuti mwanache aŵe jwanjumi.’ <verse eid="2SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23" />Nambo sambano ajasiche, kwachichi ndaŵe? Uli, uneji ngukombola kummusya pachilambo? Palyuŵa limo tinyaule kwele kwajawile ko, nambo jwelejo ngakombola kuuja kukwangu.”<verse eid="2SA 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Selemani akupagwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24" />Pelepo che Daudi ŵantusisye ntima che Batisheba ŵankwakwe. Ŵagonile nawo, nombejo ŵakwete chitumbo ni kuligopola mwanache jwannume, ni che Daudi ŵammilasile Selemani. Ambuje Akunnungu ŵannonyele mwanache jo, <verse eid="2SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:25" />ni ŵantumile jwakulondola che Natani ku che Daudi kuti ammilanje mwanache jo Yedidia, malumbo gakwe jwakunonyelwa ni Ambuje Akunnungu.<verse eid="2SA 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akusumula musi wa ku Laba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 20:1b-3">1 Indu ya katema 20:1b-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26" />Katema ko, che Yoabu ŵaugungumuchile musi wa ku Laba musi wa Ŵaamoni, nombejo ŵausumwile wele musi wa uchimwene wo. <verse eid="2SA 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27" />Che Yoabu ŵatumile utenga ku che Daudi waukuti, “Naugungumuchile musi wa ku Laba, ni une ngamulile uliwa wao. <verse eid="2SA 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28" />Sambano mwasonganye mipingo jose ja ŵangodo jajisigele, nkaŵiche chigono kuusyungula musi wo ni kuusumula. Nangaŵa yeleyo, nausumulaga une tiuŵilanjikwe kwa liina lyangu.” <verse eid="2SA 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29" />Kwayele che Daudi ŵaasonganyisye mipingo ja ŵangondo jose, ŵajawile ku Laba, ŵaugungumuchile ni kuusumula musi wo. <verse eid="2SA 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30" />Kutyochela pantwe wa chinyago cha nnungu Moleki jwa Ŵaamoni, che Daudi ŵajigele chindu mpela singwa cha sahabu chachili ni utopele wa kilogilamu salasini na tano; ni nkati mwakwe mwaliji ni liganga lya ndalama. Che Daudi ŵajigele liganga lyo ni ŵaliŵisile mu chindu chakwe chachili mpela singwa. Sooni ŵajigele indu yejinji nnope mu mmusi wo. <verse eid="2SA 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31" />Sooni ŵaajigele ŵandu ŵa mmusi wo ŵaaŵisile apanganye masengo kwa kutumia misumeno ni sululu ni maŵago ni kwatesya apanganye masengo pa litanuli lya matofali. Yeleyo ni iŵaitesile misi jinajose ja Ŵaamoni. Mbesi jakwe che Daudi ni ŵandu wose ŵausile ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Che Amunoni akunkamulila che Tamali alumbugwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1" />Ni yaliji che Abusalomu mwanache jwa che Daudi ŵakwete alumbugwe juŵaliji jwakusalala kwannope, liina lyakwe ŵaŵilanjikwe che Tamali. Nombe mwanache jwine ju che Daudi liina lyakwe che Amunoni, ŵannonyele che Tamali. <verse eid="2SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2" />Che Amunoni chaakolele chakugona ni che Tamali mwakwichila kuŵa jwakulwala kwaligongo lya che Tamali alumbugwe, pakuŵapo che Tamali ŵaliji jwangaonegana ni jwannume, ni yaoneche kuti ili yakulimba kwa che Amunoni kwatendele chachilichose. <verse eid="2SA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3" />Nipele, che Amunoni ŵakwete mbusangagwe liina lyakwe che Yonadabu mwanache jwa che Shimea, mpwakwe che Daudi. Che Yonadabu jo ŵaliji mundu jwakwete umanyilisi nnope wa pachilambo. <verse eid="2SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4" />Che Yonadabu ni ŵammusisye che Amunoni kuti, “Mmweji nli mwanache jwa mwenye, ligongo chichi nkuganda ni kuloleka jwangasangalala kila lyuŵa? Ana ligongo chichi ngankuusalila une?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:4">Che Amunoni ŵanjanjile kuti, “Une ngunnonyela che Tamali nlumbugwawo achimwene jwangu che Abusalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5" />Che Yonadabu ŵansalile che Amunoni, “Njaule nkagone pachindanda penu, nkalambuchisye kulwala. Atati ŵenu pataiche kunnola, mwasalile kuti, ‘Choonde nkaasalile che Tamali nlumbwangu kuti aiche kukuundelechela chakulya kuti une ndye. Aiche kukuundelechela chakulya cho kunokuno, uneji ndili nkulola, sooni nsyene jo andisye.’” <verse eid="2SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6" />Kwayele, che Amunoni ŵajendelechele kugona pachindanda, achilitesyaga akulwala. Mwenye paŵajawile kunnola, che Amunoni ŵansalile kuti, “Choonde nkaasalile che Tamali nlumbwangu kuti aiche akuno, kuti andelechele makalikali une njilolaga, ni sooni nsyene jo andisye.”<verse eid="2SA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7" />Kwayele, che Daudi ŵapeleche utenga kwa che Tamali juŵaliji mu nyumba ja chimwenye kunsalila kuti “Njaule ku nyuumba ja achimwene jwenu che Amunoni, nkaatelechele chakulya.” <verse eid="2SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8" />Kwayele che Tamali ŵajawile ku nyuumba ji che Amunoni, achimwene jwakwe, ni ŵansimene ali agonile. Ŵajigele utandi, ŵawunyile ni ŵakolosisye mikate ni ŵajiteleche che Amunoni achilolaga. <verse eid="2SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9" />Nipele che Tamali ŵajityosisye mikate jo mu chiteleko kuti ŵaape che Amunoni, nambo che Amunoni ŵakanile kulya, ŵatite kila mundu akopoche paasa, ni ŵanawose ŵakopweche. <verse eid="2SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10" />Nipele, che Amunoni ŵansalile che Tamali, “Sambano mumbelechele mikate jo ku chuumba kwangu kuti mundisye.” Che Tamali ŵajigele mikate jiŵajiteleche jo ni kujijausya ku chuumba kwa che Amunoni achimwene jwakwe. <verse eid="2SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11" />Paŵapaga mikate jo, che Amunoni ŵankamwile che Tamali ni ŵansalile kuti, “Nnyiche kungone ni une.”<verse eid="2SA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12" />Nambo che Tamali jo ŵansalile kuti, “Ngwamba achimwene, ngasimuunganganichisya. Chindu chanti yeleyi ngachikusachilwa kupanganyikwa pa Isilaeli. Nkatenda chindu chakuloŵela chi. <verse eid="2SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13" />Kwa uneji ngangukombola kujipilila soni ji. Ni kwa mmwejo, chimme jumo mwa ŵandu ŵangalumbana ni ŵakuloŵela pa Isilaeli. Nipele, uneji ngunchondelela, nkunguluche ni mwenye pakuŵapo ngankanya kuunomba une.” <verse eid="2SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14" />Nambo che Amunoni nganasaka kwapikanila che Tamali, ni pakuŵapo ŵampundile machili, ŵankamulile che Tamali jo, ni ŵagonile najo.<verse eid="2SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15" />Nipele, che Amunoni ŵammenjile che Tamali nnope. Ŵammenjile kupunda ni muŵannonyelaga kuundanda. Che Amunoni ŵansalile che Tamali kuti, “Ntyoche njaule.”<verse eid="2SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16" />Che Tamali ŵanjanjile kuti, “Ngaŵa yeleyo achimwene, ungalumbana wa kuuminga wu chiuŵe wekulungwa kupunda ni imuundendele yi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:16">Nambo che Amunoni nganasaka kwapikanila. <verse eid="2SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17" />Ni ŵammilasile jwanchanda juŵantumichilaga, ŵansalile kuti, “Muntyosye jwankongwe ju paujo pangu. Ni nnango mbugale ni njinjili.” <verse eid="2SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18" />Che Amunoni ni jwanchanda jula ŵakopweche paasa ni kuugala nnango ni njinjili.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:18">Che Tamali ŵaliji awasile mwinjilo weleu wa makono gamaleu, wetotele ulembo, mwelemu ni muŵawalilaga ŵanache achakongwe ŵa mwenye ŵaŵaliji achiŵaŵalipe. <verse eid="2SA 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19" />Nipele, che Tamali ŵalitasile liwu muntwe, ŵapapwile mwinjilo wakwe ula, ŵaŵisile makono gakwe pantwe, nipele ŵatyosile achililaga kwakunyanyisya. <verse eid="2SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20" />Che Abusalomu achimwene jwakwe ŵammusisye, “Uli, che Amunoni achimwene jwenu agonile ni mmwe? Sambano mmyalale alumbu ŵangu, ŵelewo ali achimwene jwenu. Yeleyi nkalaga nayo muntima.” Nombe che Tamali ŵatamaga ku nyuumba kwa che Abusalomu ali nkusupuka mpela mundu jwakuwilwa.<verse eid="2SA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21" />Mwenye che Daudi paŵapilikene chele chindu cho ŵatumbile kwannope. <verse eid="2SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22" />Che Abusalomu ŵanchimile che Amunoni kwannope, ni nganaŵecheta nawo chindu chilichose, ligongo ŵanjalwisye che Tamali alumbugwe.<verse eid="2SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Abusalomu Akummulaga che Amunoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23" />Pali papite yaka iŵili, katema ŵaŵakataga manyunya ga ngondolo ŵa che Abusalomu paŵaliji ku Baali Hasoli chiŵandi ni mpika wa ku Efulaimu, che Abusalomu ŵaalaliche ŵanache ŵachilume wosepe ŵa mwenye kwaula kweleko. <verse eid="2SA 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24" />Che Abusalomu ŵajawile kwa mwenye che Daudi, ni ŵansalile, “Mwenye, une jwakutumichila jwenu ngwaula ku masengo ga kwakata manyunya ngondolo ni ŵandu ŵangu. Ni ngwaŵenda ŵalakwe mwenye ni ŵakamusi ŵenu nnyicheje tukamulangane ni une.”<verse eid="2SA 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25" />Mwenye ŵanjanjile kuti, “Ngaŵa yeleyo, mwanangu, tukajaula ŵanawose, tukaika kunlemela.” Atamose kuti che Abusalomu ŵalinjile kwanyenga atatigwe kuti ajaule, mwenye ŵakanile, nambo ŵampele upile kuti indu ikaajendele yambone. <verse eid="2SA 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26" />Pelepo che Abusalomu ŵansalile, “Iŵaga ngankwaula, nipele mwaluhusu mpwangu che Amunoni tujaule nawo.” Mwenye ŵajanjile kuti, “Ana ligongo chichi ajaule pamo ni mmwe?” <verse eid="2SA 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27" />Nambo che Abusalomu ŵapundile kunchondelela mwenye, ni kumbesi mwenye ŵakundile kuti che Amunoni ni achiŵanagwe ŵachilume wose ajaulanje. <verse eid="2SA 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28" />Che Abusalomu ŵalajisye ŵandu ŵakwe kuti, “Munnolechesye che Amunoni patang'we divai ni kukolelwa kwannope, nansalilaga kuti, ‘Mumpute che Amunoni,’ nipele mumpute ni kummulaga. Nkajogopa. Uli, nganiŵa une junampele ulamusi wu? Nlimbangane ni kukola lunda.” <verse eid="2SA 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29" />Kwayele, ŵakutumichila ŵa che Abusalomu ŵantesile che Amunoni mpela iŵatite kusalilwa ni che Abusalomu, nipele ŵanache ŵachilume ŵane ŵa mwenye ŵatyosile kila mundu ŵakwesile mu nyumbu jwakwe ni kuutuka.<verse eid="2SA 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30" />Ali bado mwitala, che Daudi ŵasalilwe kuti ŵanache ŵakwe wose aulajikwe ni che Abusalomu, nganasigalila namose jumo. <verse eid="2SA 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31" />Mwenye che Daudi ŵajimi, ŵapapwile yakuwala yao kwa kusupuka ni ŵagonile pasi. Namose ŵakutumichila ŵakwe wose ŵaŵaliji ajimi chiŵandi nawo ŵapapwile yakuwala yao. <verse eid="2SA 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32" />Nambo che Yonadabu, mwanache jwa che Shimea mpwakwe che Daudi ŵansalile kuti, “Ambuje ŵangu, nkaganisya kuti achiŵanagwenu wose aulajikwe. Che Amunoni jikape ni jwaulajikwe. Gelega che Abusalomu ŵagapanjile kugatendekanya chitandilile akala katema che Amunoni paŵankamulile che Tamali nlumbugwe. <verse eid="2SA 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33" />Kwayele, ambuje ŵangu, nkaganisya muntima mwenu kuti ŵanache ŵenu ŵanawose awile. Che Amunoni jikape ni jwaulajikwe.” <verse eid="2SA 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34" />Nambo che Abusalomu ŵaliji autwiche. Nombe jwanchanda juŵaliji samu jawo kulindilila, papopo ŵauweni mpingo wekulungwa wa ŵandu alinkuluka ku chitumbi pa litala lyakutyochela ku Holonaimu. <verse eid="2SA 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35" />Che Yonadabu ŵansalile mwenye kuti, “Nnole, ŵanache ŵenu mwenye ali apano, iŵele mpela une jwakutumichila jwenu indite kunsalila.” <verse eid="2SA 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36" />Namala pe jwakutumichila jula kuŵecheta, ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa mwenye ŵajinjile, ŵatandite kulila kwakunyanyisya. Mwenye ni ŵakutumichila ŵakwe wose, ŵalisile ligogo.<verse eid="2SA 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37" />Nambo che Abusalomu ŵautuchile kwa che Talimai mwanache jwa che Amihudi, mwenye jwa musi wa ku Geshuli. Mwenye che Daudi ŵalisile malilo ga che Amunoni mwanagwe kwa moŵa gamajinji. <verse eid="2SA 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:38" />Che Abusalomu paŵautuchile ku Geshuli, ŵatemi kweleko kwa yaka itatu. <verse eid="2SA 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39" />Mwenye che Daudi pakumala matanga ga kuwililwa ni che Amunoni, ŵatandite kulajila kwawona che Abusalomu mwanagwe.<verse eid="2SA 13:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14" />
  <para style="s">Che Yoabu akuganisya yakuti kummusya che Abusalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1" />Che Yoabu mwanache ju che Seluya ŵaimaanyilile kuti ntima wa mwenye waliji nkwakumbuchila kwannope che Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2" />Kwayele che Yoabu ŵantumile mundu kwele ku Tekoa ko kuti akansose jwankongwe jwakwete lunda. Paŵannyichenawo, che Yoabu ŵansalile kuti, “Nlinamanile kuti nkulila malilo. Mmwale yakuwala yapamalilo, nkapakala mauta, nambo nlitende nti jwankongwe jwakulila malilo kwa moŵa gamajinji kwaligongo lya mundu jwakwe jwawile. <verse eid="2SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3" />Nipele njaule kwa mwenye nkaasalile ayi ingunsalila yi.” Nipele che Yoabu ŵansalile maloŵe gakwasalila mwenye. <verse eid="2SA 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4" />Jwele jwankongwe jwakutyochela ku Tekoa jo ŵajawile kwa mwenye, ŵatindiŵele ni kukotama mpaka pasi paujo pa mwenye, kwa uchimbichimbi, ni ŵansalile, “Alakwe mwenye, mungamuchisye.”<verse eid="2SA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5" />Mwenye ŵammusisye, “Ana chikunsauusya chichi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:5">Jwankongwe jula ŵajanjile, “Ngulilasika, uneji ndili jwankongwe jwawililwe ni ŵankwakwe, ŵankwangu awile. <verse eid="2SA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6" />Nakwete ŵanache achalume ŵaŵili. Palyuŵa limo, paŵaliji kwikonde, ŵatandite kumenyana. Pakuŵapo nganapagwa mundu jwalijose jwakuti ŵaapokolanye, jumo ŵamputile njakwe, ni ŵammuleje. <verse eid="2SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7" />Sambano ntundu wangu wose ung'alawiche uneji jwakutumichila jwenu. Akusakanga nankoposye mwanangu jwammuleje njakwe kuti ŵaaulaje ligongo auleje mpwakwe. Kwayele, tammulaje jwelejo jwati sambano ni jutaŵe jwakwinjila majumba. Atendaga yeleyo, taŵe atyosisye kusyene chilolelo changu chachisigalile, ni ŵankwangu ngaasigalilwa ni liina namose mmeleko pachilambo pano.”<verse eid="2SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8" />Mwenye ŵansalile jwankongwe jula, “Mmuje kumangwenu, timalisye chele chindu cho.” <verse eid="2SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9" />Jwele jwankongwe jwa kutyochela ku Tekoa jo ŵatite, “Ambuje jwangu mwenye, chileŵo chose chiŵe pa une ni pa ulongo wa atati ŵangu. Kwayele, mmwe ni umwenye wenu nkaŵa ni chileŵo.”<verse eid="2SA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10" />Mwenye ŵajanjile, “Iŵaga mundu jwalijose tachinjogoya, munyichisye kukwangu, nombejo ngasansausya sooni.” <verse eid="2SA 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11" />Jwele jwankongwe jo ŵatite, “Choonde mwenye muumbopelele kwa Ambuje Akunnungu jwenu kuti asiŵilile jwakuuchisya maulago ga mwanangu jo akatenda chileŵo chiine chekulungwa chakummulaga ajula mwanangu jwine jula.” Mwenye che Daudi ŵansalile kuti, “Ngulumbila kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajumi, ngapagwa namose jumo jutachimmulasya mwanagwenu.” <verse eid="2SA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12" />Jwankongwe jula ŵansalile, “Ngummenda, uneji jwakutumichila jwenu, munechelele mechete liloŵe limo kukwenu alakwe mwenye.” Mwenye ŵanjanjile, “Mmechete.” <verse eid="2SA 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13" />Jwankongwe jula ŵansalile, “Kwachichi, mpanjile au ugongomalo wu nkati ŵandu ŵa Akunnungu? Malinga ni intite kusala nkati chele chindu cho, mmwe mwasyene nlilamwile kuti nkwete chileŵo pakuŵapo ngankusaka kunnechelela mwanagwenu auje pamusi kutyochela kwele kwautuchile. <verse eid="2SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14" />Uweji ŵanawose chituwe. Uweji tuli mpela meesi gagajitiche, gati gangakukumbikwa. Namose Akunnungu ngaulaga nambo akusosa litala kuti jwaŵinjikwe auje kutyochela kwele kwautuchile. <verse eid="2SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15" />Uneji iiche kukunguluka ni mmwe, ambuje jwangu mwenye, pakuŵa ŵandu ŵanyogoisye. Nipele, uneji jwakutumichila jwenu, naganisisye kuti, ‘Mmbaya ngakunguluche ni mwenye, panepa mwenye taachitenda achi chindu chiingwasalila uneji jwakutumichila jwakwe. <verse eid="2SA 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16" />Pakuŵapo mwenye tachimbikanila ni kuungulupusya mmakono mwa mundu jwakusaka kuumulaga uneji pamo ni mwanangu kuti ndyoche mu kupochela aila yatugosele Akunnungu.’ <verse eid="2SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17" />Ni uneji jwakutumichila jwenu naganisisye kuti, ‘Liloŵe lya ambuje jwangu mwenye tilimbe chitendewele muntima, pakuŵa ŵelewo ambuje ŵangu mwenye wo ali mpela katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Akunnungu pa kukombola kulekanganya indu yambone ni yangalumbana.’ Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwenu, aŵe pamo ni mmwe.”<verse eid="2SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18" />Pelepo mwenye ŵanjanjile jwankongwe jula, “Nkaasisa chindu chachilichose tichinammusye.” Jwankongwe jula ŵajanjile, “Mmechete alakwe ambuje jwangu mwenye.” <verse eid="2SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19" />Mwenye ŵammusisye, “Uli che Yoabu nombe ali mu chele chindu chi?” Jwankongwe jula ŵajanjile, “Ngulumbila kwa ŵalakwe ambuje jwangu mwenye, mundu ngakombola kusepuchila kunlyo pane kunchiji pa chele chindu chinsasile ambuje jwangu mwenye. Che Yoabu jwakutumichila jwenu jula ni juŵandumile. Jwelejo ni jwasalile une aga maloŵe gose ganansalile, uneji jwakutumichila jwenu. <verse eid="2SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20" />Che Yoabu ŵatesile yeleyo kuti ŵalakwejo mwenye nchiganichisye chele chindu chi sooni. Nambo, alakwe ambuje jwangu nkwete lunda mpela lwa achikatumetume ŵa kwinani ŵa Akunnungu namose nkombwele kugamanyilila ganagose gagali pachilambo.”<verse eid="2SA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21" />Nipele mwenye ŵansalile che Yoabu, “Mwambone nnope, tiindende che chindu chi. Njaule, nkanjigale ajula jwanchanda che Abusalomu mummusye pamusi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22" />Che Yoabu ŵatindiŵele ni kukotama mpaka paasi kwa uchimbichimbi ni kwapa mwenye upile, ni ŵatite, “Lelo uneji jwakutumichila jwenu ngumanyilila kuti ngundikwe paujo penu, ligongo mmwe ambuje wangu mwenye nchikundile chindu chimendile.” <verse eid="2SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23" />Pelepo che Yoabu ŵajawile mpaka ku Geshuli ŵanjigele che Abusalomu ni kummusya ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24" />Nambo mwenye ŵatite, “Che Abusalomu atame kwakutalichila ni une, atame ku nyuumba jakwe. Akaika apano kukuunola.” Kwayele che Abusalomu ŵaliji nkutama kwakutalika, kumangwakwe ni nganasimanaga ni mwenye che Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Abusalomu ni mwenye che Daudi akwilana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25" />Pa Isilaeli pose nganapagwa juŵalapikwaga kwa usalale wakwe mpela che Abusalomu. Kutandilila kusajo kwakwe mpaka peuwo pakwe, che Abusalomu nganakola chilema chachilichose. <verse eid="2SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26" />Kila paŵamyolaga umbo sya muntwe wakwe, pakuŵa ŵamyolaga kakajinji pasyantopelaga, ŵasipimile utopele wakwe, waliji kilo siŵili malinga ni ipimo ya chimwenye. <verse eid="2SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27" />Che Abusalomu ŵaŵeleche ŵanache ŵatatu achalume pamo ni mwali jumo liina lyakwe che Tamali. Che Tamali ŵaliji mwali jwakusalala.<verse eid="2SA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28" />Che Abusalomu ŵatemi yaka iŵili kwele ku Yelusalemu ko pangasimana ni mwenye che Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29" />Nipele, che Abusalomu ŵatumile utengwa ku che Yoabu, kuti ajaule kwa mwenye pamalo pakwe, nambo che Yoabu ŵakanile. Che Abusalomu ŵatumile utenga kaaŵili nambo che Yoabu ŵakanile. <verse eid="2SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30" />Nipele, che Abusalomu ŵaasalile ŵakutumichila ŵakwe kuti, “Nnole, che Yoabu akwete ngunda wa shayili chiŵandika ni ngunda wangu. Njaulanje nkauchome mooto.” Kwayele ŵakutumichila ŵa che Abusalmu ŵauchomile mooto ngunda wa che Yoabu. <verse eid="2SA 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31" />Che Yoabu ŵajawile ku nyuumba ku che Abusalomu ni kummusya kuti, “Kwachichi ŵakutumichila ŵenu auchomile mooto ngunda wangu?” <verse eid="2SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32" />Che Abusalomu ŵajanjile, “Nnole, nampelechele utenga nnyiche akuno kuti nantume kwa mwenye, nkaausye kuti, ‘Kwachichi iche akuno kutyochela ku Geshuli? Ikaliji yambone kukwangu ngasigalile kukoko.’ Sambano muungamuchisye kuti ngombole kusimana ni mwenye. Iŵaga ngwete chileŵo, nipele, amulaje!” <verse eid="2SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33" />Kwayele, che Yoabu ŵajawile ni kwasalila mwenye gele maloŵe gose go, nombe mwenye ŵammilasile che Abusalomu. Nombe che Abusalomu ŵajinjile kwa mwenye, ŵatindiŵele ni kukotama mpaka paasi paujo pa mwenye kwa uchimbichimbi. Ni mwenye ŵankumbatile che Abusalomu.<verse eid="2SA 14:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15" />
  <para style="s">Che Abusalomu akuŵika chikotopasyo chakungalauka mwenye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1" />Pagapite moŵa gamajinji, che Abusalomu ŵaŵisile chile mutuka jakukwekwelemwa ni falasi pamo ni ŵandu hansini kuti ŵaalongolele. <verse eid="2SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2" />Che Abusalomu ŵasyoŵelele kwimuka kundaŵipe ni kwaula kwima ku litala lyalikwaula ku nnango wa musi. Mundu jwalijose juŵaliji ni ligambo lilyasachile kuti alipeleche kwa mwenye kuti likalamulikwe kweleko, che Abusalomu ŵammilanga mundu jo pambali ni kummusya, “Nkutyochela musi chi?” Mundu jo ajilaga kuti atyochele musi fulani wa lukosyo lwa ku Isilaeli, <verse eid="2SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3" />che Abusalomu ŵansalilaga kuti, “Magambo genu gali gausyene. Nambo ngapagwa mundu jwakwima pamalo pa mwenye kumpikanila.” <verse eid="2SA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4" />Sooni, che Abusalomu ŵansalilaga kuti, “Ikaŵe kuti ŵasagwile uneji kuti me jwakulamula jwa ku Isilaeli, kila mundu jwakwete magambo pane isausyo iliyose, akaiche kwa uneji, noneji ngaalamwile yele yaakuti ili isyene yo.” <verse eid="2SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5" />Kupunda ni yeleyo, mundu jwalijose juŵaiche kwa che Abusalome ni kwajinamila kwa uchimbichimbi, che Abusalomu ŵankamwile ni makono gakwe ni kwakumbata. <verse eid="2SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6" />Nipele, mwelemo ni muŵatendelaga che Abusalomu kwa Ŵaisilaeli wose ŵaŵaikaga kwa mwenye kuti ŵalamulile. Pakutenda yeleyo, che Abusalomu ŵatesile Ŵaisilaeli ŵajinji ankunde mmitima jao.<verse eid="2SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7" />Pali papite yaka ncheche, che Abusalomu ŵaasalile mwenye kuti, “Choonde mungunde nyaule ku Hebuloni ko kuti ngatende inalumbilile kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, <verse eid="2SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8" />pakuŵa une jwakutumichila jwenu, panatemi akula ku Geshuli mu chilambo cha ku Lamu, nalumbilile kwa Ambuje Akunnungu njitiji iŵaga Ambuje Akunnungu tachimmusya kumusi ku Yelusalemu, nipele tinjapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu kwele ku Hebuloni ko.” <verse eid="2SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9" />Nombe Mwenye ŵansalile kuti, “Njaule mu chitendewele.” Che Abusalomu ŵatyosile kwaula ku Hebuloni. <verse eid="2SA 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10" />Nambo che Abusalomu ŵatumile utenga kwachisyepela ku ngosyo syose sya ku Isilaeli, waukuti, “Papopo patimpikane kusona kwa lipenga, njileje kuti, ‘Che Abusalomu atendekwe kuŵa mwenye kwele ku Hebuloni ko!’” <verse eid="2SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 15:11" />Che Abusalomu paŵajawile ku Hebuloni ko, ŵajawile ni ŵandu mia mbili ŵaŵaalaliche kutyochela ku Yelusalemu. Nombe ŵanyawo ŵajawile kweleko kwa nningwa wambone, mwangamanyilila chindu chilichose nkati ukotopasyo wa che Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:12" />Che Abusalomu paŵaliji nkutyosya mbopesi, ŵatumile utenga ku musi wa ku Gilo kwaŵilanga che Ahitofeli, juŵatamaga ku musi wa ku Gilo, juŵankamuchisyaga mwenye che Daudi kulamula indu. Kwayele malindi wa che Abusalomu wapatile machili, ni ŵandu ŵaŵalongene ni che Abusalomu ŵajonjesyeche.<verse eid="2SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwenye che Daudi akuutuka ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13" />Jwantenga ŵaiche ni kunsalila che Daudi kuti, “Mitima ja Ŵaisilaeli jikukamulangana ni che Abusalomu!”<verse eid="2SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14" />Nipele, che Daudi ŵaasalile ŵakutumichila ŵakwe ŵaŵaliji pamo nawo mu mmusi wa ku Yelusalemu kuti, “Njisangane, tuutuche, nangaŵaga yeleyo ngapagwa jutalame. Tujanguyeje kutyoka, che Abusalomu akukombola kwika pelepa kwa chitema ni kummulaga kila mundu mu musi wu.”<verse eid="2SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15" />Ŵakutumichila wose ŵa mwenye ŵanjanjile mwenye jula kuti, “Uweji ŵakutumichila ŵenu tuli chile kupanganya chachili chose chinkuchisaka alakwe mwenye.” <verse eid="2SA 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16" />Nipele, mwenye ŵatyosile pamo ni ŵandu ŵa munyuumba jakwe ni ŵakutumichila ŵakwe wose, nambo ŵaalesile ilanga yakwe likumi ajigose nyuumba ja chimwenye.<verse eid="2SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17" />Mwenye ŵatyosile pamo ni ŵandu ŵakwe wose. Nambo ŵajimi kanandi paŵaichenje pa nyuumba jajili kumbesi musi. <verse eid="2SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18" />Ŵakutumichila ŵakwe wose, pamo ni Ŵakeleti ni Ŵapelesi ŵaŵaliji ŵakulindilila ŵakwe, ni Ŵagiti wose mia sita, ŵaŵankuiye mwenye che Daudi kutyochela ku musi wa ku Gati ŵapitile paujo pa mwenye achinnongolelaga. <verse eid="2SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19" />Nipele, mwenye che Daudi paŵammweni che Itai jwa lukosyo lwa Ŵagiti, ŵansalile, “Ligongo chichi nomwe ntyosile pamo ni uweji? Mmuje nkatame ni jwele mwenye che Abusalomu. Pakuŵa mmwejo nli jwannendo akuno, sooni mmweji mbutwiche kutyochela kumangwenu. <verse eid="2SA 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20" />Mmweji nnyiche akuno liiso. Ana lelo nantende mme mundu jwakwendajenda pamo ni uweji, akuno ngangukumanyilila kungwaula? Mmuje kumangwenu pamo achalongo achinjenu. Nombe Ambuje Akunnungu antendele indu yambone ni mwakulupilichika kwakwe.”<verse eid="2SA 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21" />Nambo che Itai ŵanjanjile mwenye, “Ngulumbila kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajumi ni kwa alakwe ambuje ŵangu mwenye, palipose pachimme, iŵaga mu chiwa pane mu umi, niuneji jwakutumichila jwenu time papopo.”<verse eid="2SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22" />Nipele, che Daudi ŵansalile che Itai, “Mwambone, twende basi.” Nipele che Itai Mgiti ŵapitile nsyene jo pamo ni achalume ŵaŵaliji nawo pamo ni ŵanache ŵao. <verse eid="2SA 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23" />Che Daudi paŵaliji nkupita pamo ni ŵandu ŵakwe, ŵandu wose ŵaŵasigalile mu chilambo mo ŵalisile kwa kunyanyisya. Mwenye che Daudi ŵajombweche lichemba lya Kidiloni pamo ni ŵandu wose, ni ŵajawile mwipululu.<verse eid="2SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24" />Che Sadoki nombe najo ŵaliji papopo pamo ni Ŵalawi wose ali ajigele Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu. Ŵatusile paasi Lisanduku lya Akunnungu lyo, nombe jwambopesi che Abiasali ŵatyosisye mbopesi mpaka ŵandu wose paŵamasile kukopoka mu musi ŵa ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25" />Nipele mwenye ŵansalile che Sadoki, “Nlijigale Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu nliusye mu musi. Naga Ambuje Akunnungu taachingunda, tachimusya apano, ni kuundesya naliwone sooni Lisanduku lya lilangano pamo ni pamalo pano paakutama. <verse eid="2SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26" />Nambo iŵaga Ambuje Akunnungu ngakunonyelwa ni une, nipele, uneji ndili chile, ambanganyichisye chachilichose chakuchiona kuti chili chambone kukwakwe.” <verse eid="2SA 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27" />Mwenye che Daudi ŵansalile sooni jwambopesi che Sadoki, “Mmweji nli jwakwiwona yakwiwona, munjigale mwanagwenu che Ahimaasi ni che Yonatani mwanache jwa che Abiasali mmujangane kumusi mu chitendewele. <verse eid="2SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28" />Une tingalindilile pa yakombochela kwele ku chipululu mpaka pachimuusalile indu yaikuti kwendelechela.” <verse eid="2SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29" />Kwayele che Sadoki ni che Abiasali ŵaliusisye Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu mu musi ku Yelusalemu ni kutama mmomo.<verse eid="2SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30" />Nambo che Daudi ŵajendelechele ni ulendo, ŵakwesisye chikwesya cha Miseituni akuno ali nkulila, nganawala ilatu, ni ali aunichile nguwo ku ntwe kulosya kuti akusupuka. Nombe ŵandu wose ŵaŵaliji pamo nawo ŵaunichile mitwe jawo ni ŵaliji nkukwesya chikwesya akuno ali nkulila. <verse eid="2SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31" />Kele katema ko, che Daudi ŵasalilwe kuti che Ahitofeli ŵaliji pamo ni ŵakugalauka ŵaŵaliunjile ni che Abusalomu. Pelepo che Daudi ŵapopesile achitiji, “Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, chachilichose ngunchondelela, ngagalausye maloŵe ga che Ahitofeli gaŵansalile che Abusalomu gaŵe gangali mate.”<verse eid="2SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32" />Che Daudi paŵaiche pachanya chikwesya, peuto paŵasyoŵelele kwapopelela Akunnungu, mundu jumo liina lyakwe che Hushai jwakutyochela ku Aliki ŵaiche kukunchingamila, yakuwala yakwe ili yepapule ni ali alitasile luundu mu ntwe wakwe. <verse eid="2SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33" />Che Daudi ŵansalile kuti, “Mwajaulaga pamo ni une chimundopele. <verse eid="2SA 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34" />Nambo mmwejo timungamuchisye une naga nkuwujila ku musi wa ku Yelusalemu, kweleko nkaasalile che Abusalomu kuti ‘Alakwe mwenye une time jwakutumichila jwenu, mpela inatite kuŵa jwakutumichila kwa atati ŵenu kuundanda ko.’ Kwakutenda yeleyo timungamuchisye une ni kugakanila maloŵe gatakaŵechete che Ahitofeli ku che Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35" />Ŵambopesi che Sadoki ni che Abiasali taŵe pamo nomwe mu mmusi! Nipele, chachilichose chichimpikane ku nyuumba ja mwenye, mwasalile ŵambopesi che Sadoki ni che Abiasali. <verse eid="2SA 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36" />Nnole ŵanache ŵawo ŵaŵili achalume, che Ahimaasi mwana jwa che Sadoki ni che Yonatani mwana jwa che Abiasali, alinji pamo nao. Chachilichose chichimpikane tinchatuma aiche kukuumanyisya.” <verse eid="2SA 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37" />Nipele, che Hushai mmbusanga jwa mwenye che Daudi, ŵausile ku Yelusalemu katema che Abusalomu paŵaliji nkwinjila mu musi.<verse eid="2SA 15:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16" />
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akusimana ni che Siba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1" />Che Daudi paŵajesile chambujo kanandi kutyochela pachanya chikwesya pala, ŵasimene ni che Siba jwakutumichila jwa che Mefibosheti, ali ni mbunda siŵili syeŵiche chile sili sitwichile mikate mia mbili ni mikate mia moja jekolosye ni sabibu syejumu, ni keki mia moja jekolosye ni isogosi ya tini ni nsaku wekolosye ni lipende umo wetaje divai. <verse eid="2SA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2" />Nipele mwenye ŵammusisye che Siba, “Ligongo chi nnyichenawo ayi indu yi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:2">Che Siba ŵajanjile, “Mbunda si ni kuti akweleje ŵandu ŵa munyuumba jenu. Mikate ni mikate jekolosye ni isogosi kuti alyeje ŵandu, nombe divai ni kuti ang'wenyeje ŵandu ŵatapele mu chipululu muno.” <verse eid="2SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3" />Mwenye ŵammusisye, “Chisukulu cha ambuje ŵenu ali kwapi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:3">Che Siba ŵajanjile kuti, “Ŵelewo asigele mu musi ku Yelusalemu ligongo akuganisya kuti ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli tachimmuchisya umwenye wa che Sauli anganga ŵao.” <verse eid="2SA 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4" />Mwenye ŵansalile che Siba, “Indu yose iyaliji ya che Mefibosheti sambano eŵele indu yenu.” Che Siba ŵajanjile kuti, “Ngutogolela, ambuje ŵangu mwenye, ni une ngunchondelela ngundikwe moŵa gose paujo penu.”<verse eid="2SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Shimei akunnwesya che Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5" />Katema mwenye che Daudi paŵaŵandichile ku Bahulimu, ŵakopochele mundu jumo jwa paulongo wa che Sauli, liina lyakwe che Shimei mwana jwa che Gela, akuno achilwesaga pangaleka. <verse eid="2SA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6" />Ni ŵaliji nkwaponyela maganga che Daudi ni ŵakutumichila ŵakwe atamuno ŵakulindilila wosepe pamo ni ŵangondo ŵaliji ansyungwile che Daudi chakunchiji ni chakunlyo. <verse eid="2SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7" />Che Shimei ŵannwesyaga che Daudi ali nkuti, “Njaule ako! njaule ako! Mmweji mundu jwakuulaga, mundu jwangafai mmwe! <verse eid="2SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8" />Ambuje Akunnungu ammuchichisye ligongo lya ŵandu wosepe ŵa paulongo wa che Sauli umwauleje, ni mwasumwile umwenye wakwe. Sambano Ambuje Akunnungu aupeleche umwenye kwa mwanache jwenu che Abusalomu. Nnole sambano kumala kwenu ni kweleku mmwejo jwakuulaga ŵandu.”<verse eid="2SA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9" />Pelepo che Abishai achikulugwe ŵaliji che Seluya ŵansalile mwenye che Daudi kuti, “Ligongo chi jwele mundu jwali mpela mmbwa jewe ji jinnwesye mmweji ambuje ŵangu mwenye? Muungunde naajaulile, ni une tinaakate palukosi.” <verse eid="2SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10" />Mwenye ŵajanjile, “Ana kwana ichichi pasikati jangu ni ŵanyamwe ŵanache ŵa che Seluya? Iŵaga Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile kuti ‘Mwalwesye che Daudi,’ nduni jwakukombola kuusya kuti ‘Kwachichi nkutenda yeleyo?’” <verse eid="2SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11" />Sooni mwenye che Daudi ŵansalile che Abishai ni ŵakutumichila ŵane wosepe, “Iŵaga mwanache jwangu nansyene akusaka kuumulaga, uli ngaŵa mwakupunda kwa mundu jwa lukosyo lwa Benyamini? Ŵanyamwe munneche anwesye pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu ni ŵantumile kuti anwesye. <verse eid="2SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12" />Ikomboleka Ambuje Akunnungu tachilolechesye chilewo changu ni kundipa yambone pa malweso gangugapata lelo jino.” <verse eid="2SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13" />Kwayele che Daudi ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵajendelechele ni ulendo akuno che Shimei ŵaliji nkwakuilisya mungulugulu chikwesya mwakulolegana ni che Daudi, ali nkwalwesya, akuno alinkwaponya maganga ni kwamwasila luundu. <verse eid="2SA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14" />Nipele mwenye che Daudi pamo ni ŵandu ŵaŵaliji pamo nawo, ŵaiche ku lusulo lwa Yolodani ali apesilenje. Nipele ŵapumulile pelepo.<verse eid="2SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ushauli u che Hushai ni che Ahitofeli ku che Abusalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15" />Katema ko, che Abusalomu ni ŵandu wose ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵajawile mmusi ku Yelusalemu, nombe che Ahitofeli ŵaliji pamo nawo. <verse eid="2SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16" />Che Hushai mundu jwa ku Aliki mbusanga jwa che Daudi, ŵanjaulile che Abusalomu ni ŵansalile, “Mwenye ntameje yaka yejinji! Mwenye ntameje yaka yejinji!” <verse eid="2SA 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17" />Che Abusalomu ŵammusisye che Hushai, “Uli, au uli unonyelo wenu waukutamilisya kwa mbusanga jwenu che Daudi? Ligongo chi nganinjaula pamo ni mbusanga jwenu?” <verse eid="2SA 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18" />Che Hushai ŵajanjile, “Ngwamba! Pakuŵapo ajula jwasagulikwe ni Ambuje Akunnungu, ni ŵandu ŵa, ni ŵandu wose ŵa ku Isilaeli, jwelejo ni jwatime pamo najo, sooni tisigale ni jwelejo. <verse eid="2SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19" />Kupunda ni yeleyo, ana ŵani utinaatumichileje? Ana ngaŵa jwelejo mwanache jwa ambuje ŵangu? Nipele mpelaga inaatumichile atati gwenu, iyoyo ni itinantumichile ni mmwe wakwe.”<verse eid="2SA 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20" />Pelepo che Abusalomu ŵansalile che Ahitofeli kuti, “Mumbe ushauli, ana tutende ichichi?” <verse eid="2SA 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21" />Che Ahitofeli ŵansalile che Abusalomu, “Ngoneje ni ilanga ya atati ŵenu ŵaŵalesile kujilola nyuumba jakwe ja chimwenye. Kanyuma ŵandu wosepe ŵa ku Isilaeli pachapikane kuti mwachimisye atati ŵenu, pelepo ŵandu wosepe ŵaali pamo nomwe tachilimbiswa.” <verse eid="2SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22" />Kwayele ŵandu ŵankolochesye che Abusalomu lisakasa pachanya chipagala, nombejo ŵagonile ni ilanga ya atatigwe, ŵandu wosepe ŵa ku Isilaeli ali nkulolechesya. <verse eid="2SA 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23" />Pa moŵa go, ushauli wauli wose uwakopwesye che Ahitofeli waliji mpela asalilwe ni Akunnungu. Ni ushauli waukopwesye che Ahitofeli wachimbichikwe ni che Daudi ni che Abusalomu.<verse eid="2SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17" />
  <para style="s">Che Hushai akunlemwekasya che Abusalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1" />Pakumala yeleyo che Ahitofeli ŵansalile che Abusalomu, “Mungunde sagule ŵandu elufu kumi na mbili nyaule ngaakuilisye che Daudi chilo chino. <verse eid="2SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2" />Tinaagungumuchile katema ali apesile ni sooni ali ajasile chikulupi, ni une tinajogoye. Ŵandu wosepe ŵaali pamo nawo tautuche. Tingaaulaje mwenye pewo, <verse eid="2SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3" />ni kwausya ŵandu ŵane wose kukwenu mpela mwakuujila nlombelwa kwa jwannume jwakwe. Ŵandu wose unkwasaka tachitama kwa chitendewele.” <verse eid="2SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4" />Wele ushauli wa che Ahitofeli wo waoneche kuti uli wambone ku che Abusalomu ni achachekulu wose wa ku Isilaeli.<verse eid="2SA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5" />Nambo che Abusalomu ŵatite, “Mummilanje che Hushai mundu jwa ku Aliki jula nombe, tupikanile chichatusalile.” <verse eid="2SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6" />Che Hushai paŵaiche kwa che Abusalomu, che Abusalomu ŵammusisye, “Yeleyi ni iŵatite kusala che Ahitofeli. Uli tutendeje mpela yatite kusala? Nangaŵaga yeleyo, ntusalile yankuti kuiona.”<verse eid="2SA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7" />Che Hushai ŵansalile che Abusalomu, “Katema kano ushauli wasasile che Ahitofeli ngaŵa wambone. <verse eid="2SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8" />Nkumanyilila kuti atati ŵenu ni ŵandu ŵakwe ali ŵamachili ni kuti yaachimile kwannope mpela chinyama chachikuŵilanjikwa dubu jankolo jesumulikwe ŵanache ŵakwe kwitinji. Konjechesya ni yeleyo, nkwimanyilila kuti atati ŵenu ali mundu jwasyoŵelele ngondo. Ŵelewo ngaatama chilo chose pamo ni ŵangondo ŵakwe. <verse eid="2SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9" />Namose sambano alisisile mu mbugu pane pamalo pane. Aŵaga jwandanda kujigungumuchila mipingo jenu, mundu jwalijose juchapikane ngani ji tachiŵecheta kuti ŵandu achajinji ŵaŵaliji pamo ni che Abusalomu aulajikwe. <verse eid="2SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10" />Nipele ŵandu ŵenu pachapikane yeleyo, namose aŵala ŵandu ŵenu ŵaali ni machili, ŵaali ni mitima jangajogopa mpela masimba, tachipwa mitima kwa lipamba. Pakuŵapo Ŵaisilaeli wosepe akumanyilila kuti atati ŵenu ali ŵakuputana ngondo kwa machili ni wose ŵaali pamo nawo ali ŵandu ŵaukombola kuputana ngondo. <verse eid="2SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11" />Ushauli wangu ni au, mwasonganganye ŵandu wose ŵa ku Isilaeli kutandilila ku kumpoto ku Dani mpaka cha kulujenda ku Beli sheba, aŵeje ŵajinji nti msanga wa mu bahali, nomwe mwasyene njauleje ku ngondo ko. <verse eid="2SA 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12" />Pelepo tutunjaulile che Daudi pamalo palipose pachaŵe, tutwagungumuchile mpela mangame yagakuti kupatuchila pa litaka. Nipele ngapagwa juchasigalile namose aŵeje nsyene jo pane ŵandu ŵakwe wose ŵaali pamo nawo. <verse eid="2SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13" />Iŵaga tautuchile mmusi wauliwose, nipele ŵandu wosepe ŵa ku Isilaeli taichenawo ngonji ni kujisyunguchisya pa musi wo ni kuuwuwutila ku chiŵata, sooni kweleko ngachisigalila chachilichose namose tuganga twa musi wo.”<verse eid="2SA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14" />Che Abusalomu pamo ni ŵandu wose ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵatite, “Chindu chasasile che Hushai chili chambone kupunda ni chi che Ahitofeli.” Ni ŵaulesile ushauli wa che Ahitofeli pakuŵapo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasachile kuti aila yambone iŵaisasile che Ahitofeli yo ikakomboleka kuti che Abusalomu lyasimane limbulunga.<verse eid="2SA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Hushai akunsalila che Daudi atoloche</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15" />Nipele che Hushai ŵaasalile ŵambopesi che Sadoki ni che Abiasali indu iŵaŵechete che Ahitofeli kwa che Abusalomu ni kwa achachekulu ŵa Ŵaisilaeli ni indu iŵaŵechete nsyene jo. <verse eid="2SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16" />Ni ŵaasalile ŵaapelechele utenga mwenye che Daudi kwakwanguya kuti akagona chilo cho pa yakombochela ku chipululu, nambo kwa yaili yose, ajombocheje ni kwaula kuti akakamulikwa ni kuulajikwa, nsyene jo pamo ni ŵandu ŵakwe wosepe. <verse eid="2SA 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17" />Katema ko, che Yonatani ni che Ahimaasi ŵaliji nkwalindilila chiŵandika ni iliŵa ya meesi ya ku Enilogeli, pakuŵa yaliji yakogoya nnope kukwawo koneka ali nkwinjila mmusi. Kakajinji jwakutumichila jumpepe jwankongwe ŵaliji nkwajauchisya utenga, nombe nawo ŵajausyaga kwa mwenye che Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18" />Nambo katema ko, ŵaoneche ni jwanchanda jumo juŵajawile kwasalila che Abusalomu. Kwayele che Yonasani ni che Ahimaasi ŵatyosile kwakwanguya, ŵajawile ku Bahulimu ku nyuumba ja mundu jumpepe juŵakwete chisima mu lutenje lwakwe. Ŵajinjile mu chisima mo ni kulisisa. <verse eid="2SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19" />Ŵankwakwe nsyene nyuumba jo ŵajigele chakuunichila ni kuchiunichila chisima cho, nipele ŵajaniche yakulya pachanya pa chakuunichila cho. Ngani syo nganisimanyika. <verse eid="2SA 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20" />Ŵandu ŵakwe che Abusalomu paŵaiche kwa jwankongwe jo, ŵansalile, “Ali kwapi che Ahimaasi ni che Yonasani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">Jwankongwe jo ŵajanjile, “Ajombweche kasulo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">Paŵaakuilisye ni kulepela kwawona, ŵausile mu musi ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21" />Ŵakutumichila ŵa che Abusalomu paŵamasile kutyoka, che Yonasani ni che Ahimaasi ŵakopweche mu chisima, ŵajawile kwa mwenye che Daudi ni kwasalila ngani syo. Ŵansalile kuti, “Ntyoche, njomboche lusulo mwakwanguya, ligongo che Ahitofeli ŵaashauli che Abusalomu indu yachiintende mmulale.” <verse eid="2SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22" />Kwayele, che Daudi ŵatyosile ni ŵandu wosepe uŵaliji pamo nawo, ŵajombweche lusulo lwa Yolodani. Pajaiche kundaŵi nganapagwa mundu juŵasigalile pangajomboka lusulo lwa Yolodani.<verse eid="2SA 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23" />Che Ahitofeli paŵaiweni kuti ŵandu nganatenda iŵaŵechete ila, ŵakwesile mbunda jakwe, ŵajawile kumangwakwe, ku musi wakwe. Paŵaiche kweleko, ŵaŵisile chenene indu ya mu nyuumba jakwe, ni ŵalitaŵilile. Ŵawile ni ŵansichile ku lilembe lya atatigwe.<verse eid="2SA 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24" />Che Daudi ŵajawile ku Mahanaimu, nombe che Abusalomu ŵajombweche lusulo lwa Yolodani pamo ni ŵandu wose ŵa ku Isilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25" />Katema ko, che Abusalomu ŵammisile che Amasa kuŵa chilongola jwa mpingo wakwe wa ngondo pamalo pa che Yoabu. Che Amasa ŵaliji mwanache jwa che Yitila, jwa ntundu wa Ishumaeli, juŵalombele che Abigaili mwali ju che Nahashi alumbugwe che Seluya juŵaliji achikulugwe che Yoabu. <verse eid="2SA 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26" />Che Abusalomu pamo ni Ŵaisilaeli ŵaŵisile chigono chao ku chilambo cha ku Gileadi.<verse eid="2SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27" />Che Daudi paŵaiche ku Mahanaimu, ŵasimene ni che Shobi mwanache jwa che Nahashi kutyochela musi wa ku Laba ku chilambo cha Ŵaamoni ni che Makili mwanache jwa che Amieli kutyochela musi waku Lodebali pamo ni che Basilai kutyochela ku Logelimu ku chilambo cha ku Gileadi. <verse eid="2SA 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28" />Ŵaichenawo indanda ni mabilika ni iteleko ni ngano ni shayili ni utandi ni ngano syekalanje ni mbwanda ni nguunde, <verse eid="2SA 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:29" />ni uchi ni siagi ni ngondolo ni jibini kuti che Daudi alye pamo ni ŵandu ŵaŵaliji pamo nawo. Lingongo ŵatite, “Ŵandu ŵa jakwete sala, apesilenje ni sooni jakwete njota kwaligongo lya ulendo weleu mu chipululu.”<verse eid="2SA 17:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18" />
  <para style="s">Che Abusalomu akuulajikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1" />Che Daudi ŵaasonganyisye ŵangondo ŵaŵaliji pamo nawo, ni ŵaaŵisile mmipingo ja ŵangondo elufu mojamoja ni mipingo ja ŵangondo mia moja mia moja, ali mkulongoswa ni ilongola ŵao. <verse eid="2SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2" />Che Daudi ŵaatumile ŵangondo ŵakwe ku ngondo ali ŵaagaŵenye katatu: Mpingo waandanda ŵalongwesye che Yoabu, waaŵili ŵalongwesye che Abishai mwanache jwa che Seluya, mpwakwe che Yoabu ni mpingo waatatu ŵalongwesye che Itai jwakutyochela ku Giti. Mwenye ŵaasalile ŵandu kuti, “Uneji nansyene tinjijaula ni ŵanyamwe ku ngondo.” <verse eid="2SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3" />Nambo ŵangondo ŵansalile, “Mmwejo nganjaula ni uwe, iŵaga uweji tutuutuche, ŵammagongo ngaikosya nkati uweji. Namose mbindikati jetu awaga ŵanyawo ngaikosya, mmwejo nli mundu jwamuimu kwapunda ŵangondo elufu kumi mwa uweji. Kwayele ili yambone nnope kwa mmwejo kutukamuchisya nli mmusi.” <verse eid="2SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4" />Mwenye ŵansalile kuti, “Chachilichose chinkuchiwona kuti chikwanonyelesya mwanya, uneji tinjichitenda.” Kwayele mwenye ŵajimi mungulugulu nnango, akuno ŵangondo ŵakwe ali nkupita kutyoka paasa ali mmipingo ja ŵandu mia moja mia moja ni mmipingo ja ŵandu elufu mojamoja. <verse eid="2SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 18:5" />Mwenye ŵaalamulile che Yoabu ni che Abishai ni che Itai kuti, “Muntendele chanasa jwanchanda che Abusalomu kwa ligongo lyangu.” Ŵandu wose ŵampilikene mwenye paŵaasalilaga achakulu ŵa ngondo ŵakwe yankati che Abusalomu.<verse eid="2SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:6" />Kwayele mpingo wa ŵangondo wa che Daudi ŵapite mu ukweti kuputana ngondo ni ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli. Ngondo jo jatendeche mu likonde lya ku Efulaimu. <verse eid="2SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7" />Ŵakutumichila ŵa che Daudi ŵaapundile Ŵaisilaeli. Pa lyuŵa lyo ŵauleje ŵandu mpela elufu ishilini. <verse eid="2SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:8" />Jele ngondo jo jajenele ku chilambo kose ni ŵandu ŵajinji ŵawilile mwikonde kupunda ni aŵala ŵaŵawile kwa lipanga ku ngondo.<verse eid="2SA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9" />Nipele, che Abusalomu ali akwesile pa mbunda falasi jwakwe, wasimine ni ŵakutumichila ŵa che Daudi. Mbunda falasi jila pajapitaga kuusi kwa lujambi lwekulungwa lwa mwaloni, pelepo umbo sya che Abusalomu syapaniile pa mwaloni po. Che Abusalomu wasigalile ali nkulelemba, ni mbunda falasi jakwe jajendelechele mmbujo. <verse eid="2SA 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10" />Nipele mundu jumo paŵaiweni yeleyo, waasalile che Yoabu kuti, “Nammweni che Abusalomu ali nkulelemba pa chitela cha mwaloni.” <verse eid="2SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11" />Che Yoabu ŵansalile mundu jo kuti, “Nkuti mwaweni che Abusalomu, ana ligongo chi nganimwaulaga papopo? Une ngasangalele kwakuti ngampele ipande likumi ya madini ga feza kupwatika nkaanda wa jwangondo jwamachili.” <verse eid="2SA 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12" />Nambo mundu jo ŵajanjile che Yoabu kuti, “Atamuno kuti ngaŵe mbochele mmakono mwangu ipande ya feza yakwana elufu moja ngangatambasukule nkono wangu kuti nankwaye mwanache jwa mwenye jo. Nkumbuchile kuti mwenye ŵanlamulile mmwejo ni che Abishai ni che Itai, uwe tuli nkupikana achitiji, munkolele chanasa jwanchanda che Abusalomu kwaligongo lyangu. <verse eid="2SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13" />Ni sooni nganyosisye maloŵe ga mwenye wo, pakummulaga jwanchanda jo, ni ikamanyiche, pakuti pangali yakusisika pameso pa mwenye sooni mmwejo mwasyene ngankanjenjele.” <verse eid="2SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14" />Che Yoabu ŵansalile, “Nkaangaŵisya.” Ŵajigele mipamba jenandi jitatu mmakono, ŵajawile ni kunsoma che Abusalomu pantima, che Abusalomu ali chiŵela ŵajumi pa lujambi lwa mwaloni lula. <verse eid="2SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15" />Nipele, achachanda likumi ŵaŵajigalanga yakumenyanilana che Yoabu, ŵaiche kwasyungula che Abusalomu, ŵamputile ni kummulaga.<verse eid="2SA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16" />Pelepo che Yoabu ŵagombile lipenga ni ŵangondo wose ŵalesile kwakuilisya Ŵaisilaeli, ŵausile. <verse eid="2SA 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17" />Ŵanjigele che Abusalomu ŵanjasile ku lisimbo lyekulungwa mu litinji mula ni kugaunjika maganga liunjili lyekulungwa. Ŵandu wosepe ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵautwiche, kila mundu kumangwakwe. <verse eid="2SA 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18" />Che Abusalomu paŵaliji ŵajumi, ŵalitaŵile luchanamila mu Chiŵata cha Mwenye, pakuŵapo ŵatite kuti, “Nganingola mwanache jwannume jwampaka aŵilanjilwe ni liina lyangu kuti ŵandu angumbuchileje.” Ŵalupele luchanamila lyo liina lyawo. Nipele mpaka lelo jino lukuŵilanjikwa, “Luchanamila lwa che Abusalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akusalilwa nkati chiwa chi che Abusalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19" />Nipele, che Ahimaasi mwanache jwa che Sadoki, ŵatite, “Mungunde mutuche ngansalile mwenye ngani si yakuti Ambuje Akunnungu ankulupwisye mmakono ga ŵammagongo ŵakwe.” <verse eid="2SA 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20" />Che Yoabu ŵanjanjile kuti, “Lelo ngaŵa mmwe utinjausye ngani syo. Nkukombola kwausya ngani pa lyuŵa line. Nambo lelo ngansachilwa kwausya ngani silisyose pakuŵa mwanache jwa mwenye awile.” <verse eid="2SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21" />Pelepo che Yoabu ŵansalile mundu jumpepe jwali Mkushi achitiji, “Mmejo, njaule nkaasalile mwenye aila innyieni.” Mkushi ŵajineme uchimbichimbi paujo pa che Yoabu, ni ŵatyosile achiutukaga. <verse eid="2SA 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22" />Nipele che Ahimaasi mwanache jwa che Sadoki ŵansalile sooni che Yoabu kuti, “Ngaŵa chindu, mungunde ni une jwakwe naakuye Mkushi jula chapanyuma njiutukaga!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:22">Che Yoabu ŵansalile, “Mwanangu ligongo chichi nkuti mwakuye chapanyuma? Mmwejo ngampata mbote jilijose ligongo lya utenga wu!”<verse eid="2SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23" />Che Ahimaasi ŵajanjile “Ngaŵa chindu, uneji ngusaka kwaula.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:23">Nipele che Yoabu ŵansalile, “Ayaga, njauleje.” Pelepo che Ahimaasi ŵautwiche achipitaga litala lya kuchiŵata cha lusulo lwa Yolodani, ni ŵampundile Mkushi jula.<verse eid="2SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24" />Katema che Daudi ali atemi pasikati ja nnango wa musi waukuugula chapasa ni chamunkati jwakulindilila pannango ŵakwesile pa likumba mpaka penani pa nnango ni paŵalolite ŵammweni mundu ali nkuutuka jika. <verse eid="2SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25" />Jwakulindilila jo ŵanyanyisye kunsalila mwenye. Mwenye ŵatite, “Naga ali jikape nikuti ali ni ngani syambone.” Mundu jula ŵaiche pakuŵandichila.<verse eid="2SA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26" />Jwakulindilila ŵammweni mundu jwine ali nkuutuka, ŵaŵilasile sooni pannango achitiji, “Nnole, mundu jwine akuutuka ali jika!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:26">Mwenye ŵatite, “Nombe najo akuichisya ngani syambone.” <verse eid="2SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27" />Jwakulindilila jula ŵatite, “Nguona kuti ajula jwakuutuka mwakupunda jula ali che Ahimaasi mwanache jwa che Sadoki.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:27">Mwenye ŵatite, “Jwelejo ali mundu jwambone, akutuichisya ngani syambone.”<verse eid="2SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28" />Pelepo che Ahimaasi ŵansalile mwenye kwa kunyanyisya kuti, “Indu yosepe ili chenene.” Ŵatindiŵele ni kukotama mpaka paasi paujo pa mwenye kwa uchimbichimbi ni kuti, “Achimbichikwe Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, jwankulupwisye kutyochela kwa ŵandu ŵaŵangalawiche alakwe ambuje ŵangu mwenye.” <verse eid="2SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29" />Mwenye ŵammusisye, “Uli jwanchanda che Abusalomu ali ichenene?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:29">Che Ahimaasi ŵajanjile, “Katema che Yoabu paŵandumile une jwakutumichila jwenu, nauweni mpingo wa ŵandu uli jagalijagali nambo ngingumanyilila kuti kwaliji kwana chichi.” <verse eid="2SA 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30" />Mwenye ŵatite, “Njime pambali nlindilileje pelepo.” Nipele che Ahimaasi ŵasejele pambali ni kwima jii.<verse eid="2SA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31" />Pelepo Mkushi jula ŵaiche, Nombe najo ŵatite kuti, “Naaichisye ngani syambone ambuje ŵangu mwenye. Pakuŵapo lelojino Ambuje Akunnungu ammombwele kutyochela kwa aŵala wosepe ŵaŵangalawiche alakwe.” <verse eid="2SA 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32" />Mwenye ŵausisye, “Uli jwanchanda che Abusalomu ali chenene?” Mkushi jula ŵajanjile, “Ŵammagongo ŵenu, ambuje ŵangu mwenye, pamo ni ŵanawose ŵakungalauka achisakaga kuti linsimane limbulunga, gaasimane mpela igansimene jwele jwanchanda che Abusalomu jo.” <verse eid="2SA 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33" />Pelepo mwenye jaakamwile ndengu. Ŵakwesile ku chuumba chachili penani pa nnango ni kulila. Paŵaliji nkukwela ŵalilaga achitiji, “Mmwe mwanangu che Abusalomu, mwanangu che Abusalomu! Mmbaya ngawile une pamalo penu! Yii, che Abusalomu mwanangu! Mwanangu!”<verse eid="2SA 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19" />
  <para style="s">Che Yoabu akunjamuka che Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1" />Che Yoabu ŵasalilwe kuti mwenye ŵaliji nkulila ni kulila kwa malumbo kwaligongo lya chiwa chi Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2" />Kwayele, sangalala ja kupunda kwa lyuŵa lyo kwagalawiche kuwa kulila kwa malumbo ŵangondo wose ŵa che Daudi, pakuŵa pa lyuŵa lyo ŵangondo ŵapikene kuti mwenye akwalilila kwa malumbo che Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3" />Kwayele, pa lyuŵa lyo, ŵandu ŵajinjile mmusi ali jii mpela ŵandu ŵakuuja mmusi jili jakwete soni pa kuutuka ku ngondo. <verse eid="2SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4" />Mwenye ŵaliunichile kumeso ni kulila kwa kunyanyisya achitiji, “Kulaga kwenu mwanangu che Abusalomu! Kulaga kwenu che Abusalomu mwanangu! Mwanangu!” <verse eid="2SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5" />Pelepo che Yoabu ŵajinjile mu nyuumba ja mwenye, ŵansalile, “Lelo jino ntutasile soni ŵakutumichila ŵenu ŵanawose ŵati tuukulupwisye umi wenu, umi wa ŵanache ŵenu achalume ni umi wa ŵanache ŵenu achakongwe, ni umi wa achakongwe ŵenu ni umi wa ilanga yenu. <verse eid="2SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6" />Ŵalakwe jo nkwanonyela aŵala ŵaakunchima ni kwachima aŵala ŵaakunnonyela. Ntulosisye pangasisika lelo jino kuti ilongola ŵa ngondo ni ŵakutumichila ŵenu nganaŵa chindu kukwenu. Nguiwona kuti lelo, che Abusalomu akaŵe chiŵela ŵajumi, ni uweji ŵanawose tukawile, mmwejo nkasangalele. <verse eid="2SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7" />Sambano njime nkopoche paasa nkakunguluche ni ŵakutumichila ŵenu maloŵe gakwalimbisya mitima. Pakuŵa uneji ngulumbilila kwa liina lya Ambuje Akunnungu kuti naga nganjaula wosepe tiŵatile chilo chino. Ni chelechi tichiŵe changalumbana kwannope kukwenu kupunda yangalumbana yose yinsimene nayo kutandilila kuuchanda wenu mpaka lelo jino.” <verse eid="2SA 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8" />Nipele, mwenye ŵatyosile ŵajawile, ŵatemi pamalo pakwe chiŵandika ni nlango. Ŵandu wosepe paŵasalilwe kuti mwenye ali pannango, ŵanawose ŵanjaulile.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 19:8">Che Daudi akuliŵika chile kuuja ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:8">Katema ko, Ŵaisilaeli wose aŵala ŵaŵankuyaga che Abusalomu ŵatilile kila mundu kumangwakwe. <verse eid="2SA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9" />Ŵandu ŵa ngosyo syosye sya Ŵaisilaeli ŵaliji nkukangana achinsyenepe, achitiji, “Mwenye che Daudi ŵatuwombwele kwa ŵammagongo ŵetu, sooni ŵatukulupwisye kwa Ŵafilisiti. Nambo sambano achiutwiche chilambo, kwautuka che Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10" />Sooni che Abusalomu utwanjitilile mauta kuti aŵe mwenye jwetu, sambano aulajikwe ku ngondo. Sambano ligongo chi ngatukukungulichila yankati kummusya che Daudi aŵe mwenye?”<verse eid="2SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11" />Mwenye che Daudi ŵatumile utenga kwa ŵambopesi che Sadoki ni che Abiasali kuti, “Mwaausye achachekulu ŵa ku Yuda kuti ‘Ligongo chi ŵanyawo akukaŵa kwaula kukwajigala mwenye kuti aujile ku kunyuumba jao ja chimwenye? Pakuŵa indu yakuiŵecheta Ŵaisilaeli wosepe inyichilile une mwenye. <verse eid="2SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12" />Mwanya nli achalongo achinjangu, mwanya nli ŵakuŵelekana ni une, ligongo chi nkukaaŵa kummusya mwenye?’” <verse eid="2SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13" />Sooni che Daudi ŵalajisye maloŵe gakwasalila che Amasa kuti, “Uli mmweji nganimma nlongo njangu jwakuŵelekana? Akunnungu amulaje iŵaga kutandilila lelojino ngasinantenda mmwejo kuŵa jwankulu jwa ŵangondo ŵangu pamalo pa che Yoabu.” <verse eid="2SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14" />Kwayele, mwenye che Daudi ŵajitesile mitima ja ŵandu wose ŵa ku Yuda jakunde kwanti ŵaliji ni nningwa umo. Ŵanjauchisye utenga waukuti, “Mmuje pamo ni ŵakutumichila ŵenu wosepe.” <verse eid="2SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15" />Nipele, mwenye ŵaiche pa lusulo lwa Yolodani ni ŵandu wosepe ŵa ku Yuda ŵaiche mpaka ku Giligali kukwachingamila mwenye ni ŵanjombosye pa lusulo lwa Yolodani.<verse eid="2SA 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16" />Che Shimei mwanache jwa che Gela, jwa lukosyo lwa Benyamini mundu kutyochela ku Bahulimu, ŵajangwiye kwaula pamo ni ŵandu ŵajinji kuti ŵaachingamile mwenye che Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17" />Che Shimei ŵajawile pamo ni Ŵabenjamini elufu moja. Che Siba jwakutumichila jwa paulongo wa che Sauli, pamo ni ŵanache ŵakwe kumi na tano ni ŵakutumichila ishilini, ŵajawile kwakwanguya ku lusulo lwa Yolodani mwenye che Daudi akanaiche. <verse eid="2SA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18" />Nipele, ŵajombweche lusulo kwapelechesya ŵapaulongo wa mwenye komboka ni ŵatesile kila chindu chiŵaisachile mwenye.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 19:18">Che Daudi akunnechelesya che Shimei</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:18">Mwenye che Daudi paŵaŵandichile komboka lusulo lwa Yolodani, che Shimei mwanache jwa che Gela ŵaiche ni ŵatindiŵele ni kukotama mpaka paasi paujo pa mwenye kulosya uchimbichimbi. <verse eid="2SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19" />Ni ŵansalile mwenye kuti, “Choonde ambuje ŵangu mwenye, nkaamalanjila kuti ngwete chileŵo atamuno nkachikumbuchila chileŵo chinatesile alila lyuŵa limwakopokaga mmusi wa ku Yelusalemu. Ngummenda yeila nkaiŵika muntima mwenu. <verse eid="2SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20" />Pakuŵapo uneji jwakutumichila jwenu nguimanyilila kuti natesile sambi. Lyeleli ni ligongo nyiiche lelo jino, ndili jwaandanda pa lukosyo lwa Yusufu, kukunchingamila mmwe mwenye ambuje ŵangu.” <verse eid="2SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21" />Pelepo che Abishai mwanache jwa che Seluya ŵatite, “Uli che Shimei ngakusachilwa kuulajikwa, pakutipala ŵannwesile mundu jwati Ambuje Akunnungu ansagwile kwa kunjitilila mauta?” <verse eid="2SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22" />Nambo che Daudi ŵaasalile che Abishai ni che Yoabu nkulugwe kuti, “Ŵani ansalile kuti muungamuchisye? Uli nkusakanga kuunyichisya masauko? Uneji ni jundi mwenye jwa ku Isilaeli, ni ngapagwa mundu julijose pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli juchaulajikwe lelojino.” <verse eid="2SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23" />Nipele mwenye ŵansalile che Shimei kuti, “Ngammulajikwa.” Mwenye ŵanlumbilile che Shimei.<verse eid="2SA 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akunlechelesya che Mefibosheti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24" />Che Mefibosheti chisukulu chi che Sauli, ŵajawile nombejo kunchingamila mwenye che Daudi. Kutandilila alila lyuŵa mwenye paŵakopweche mu Yelusalemu mpaka paŵausile mu chitendewele, che Mefibosheti nginagulula ngongolo, nginamyola ndewu, ni sooni nginachapa yakuwala yao. <verse eid="2SA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25" />Nipele yaliji paŵaiche kutyochela ku Yelusalemu kwachingamila mwenye che Daudi, che Daudi ŵammusisye, “Che Mefibosheti, ana ligongo chichi nganinjaula pamo ni une?” <verse eid="2SA 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26" />Che Mefibosheti ŵajanjile, “Alakwe mwenye ambuje ŵangu, mpela inkuti kumanyilila, uneji ndili jwalemele. Nansalile jwakutumichila jwangu kuti, ‘Mundandichile chakutamila pa mbunda jangu kuti ngwele nyaule pamo ni mwenye, nambo jwakutumichila jwangu ŵang'alawiche.’ <verse eid="2SA 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27" />Sambano anamanile kwa ŵalakwe ambuje ŵangu mwenye. Nambo ŵalakwe ambuje ŵangu mwenye nkuchimanyilila chindu chakutenda mpela katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Akunnungu yakuti kumanyilila. Ntendeje chilichose chinkuchiwona kuti chili chambone kukwenu. <verse eid="2SA 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28" />Pakuŵa ŵapaulongo wosepe ŵa atati ŵangu ŵaliji ŵandu ŵaŵaŵajilwe kuwa paujo penu, alakwe mwenye ambuje ŵangu. Mwamisile uneji jwakutumichila jwenu pasikati ja ŵandu ŵaŵalyaga pa mpasa wenu. Uli une nguŵajilwa kulichenjela paujo penu ŵalakwe mwenye?” <verse eid="2SA 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29" />Mwenye ŵansalile, “Nkaasalila mwakupunda nkati indu yenu mwasyene. Uneji masile kulamula kuti mmwejo pamo ni che Siba tingaŵane lisi li che Sauli.” <verse eid="2SA 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30" />Nambo che Mefibosheti ŵansalile mwenye kuti, “Munkunde che Siba jikape ajigale lisi lyose. Uneji ingwanile kuti alakwe mwenye ambuje ŵangu mbusile kumusi kwa chitendewele.”<verse eid="2SA 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akuntendela indu yambone che Basilai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31" />Che Basilai mundu jwa ku Gileadi ŵaiche kutyochela musi ku Logelimu. Ŵajawile pamo ni mwenye ku lusulo lwa Yolodani kuti ŵaapelechesye mpaka peesi ja lusulo. <verse eid="2SA 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32" />Che Basilai ŵaliji achekulwipe kwannope, ŵaliji ni yaka semanini. Nombe che Basilai ŵaliji nkupeleka yakulya kwa mwenye pa moŵa giŵatamaga mwenye wo ku Mahanaimu, pakuŵa jweleju jwaliji mundu jwakusichila kwannope. <verse eid="2SA 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33" />Nipele, mwenye che Daudi ŵansalile che Basilai, “Tujaule ŵanawose ku Yelusalemu ni une jwakwe tingampe indu itiyinsoŵe.” <verse eid="2SA 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34" />Nambo che Basilai ŵansalile mwenye kuti, “Mwenye, nganingola yaka yejinji, pakuti nyaule ni mmwejo ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35" />Uneji lelojino ngwete yaka semanini. Uli, ngukombola kulekanganya indu yambone ni yangalumbana? Uli uneji jwakutumichila jwenu ngukombola kumanyilila kunong'a kwa yakulya pane yakung'wa? Uli uneji ngukombola kupikanila yambone liloŵe lya ŵakwimba achalume pane achakongwe? Ligongo chichi une jwakutumichila jwenu ngaŵe nsigo wakuntopela kwa ŵalakwe mwenye ambuje ŵangu? <verse eid="2SA 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36" />Uneji jwakutumichila jwenu tinyomboche ni mmwejo lusulo lwa Yolodani ni kumpelechesya kwa lwendo lwejipi. Ligongo chichi, mwenye andipe ntulilo wekulungwa wanti yeleyo? <verse eid="2SA 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37" />Ngummenda, mungunde uneji jwakutumichila jwenu muje, kuti mwilile ku musi wangu, chiŵandika ni lilembe lya atati ŵangu ni achikulu ŵangu. Nambo aju jwakutumichila jwenu che Kimuhamu, munkunde ajomboche pamo ni mmwe mwenye ambuje ŵangu, ni mumpanganyichisye chilichose chinkuchiwona chili chambone.”<verse eid="2SA 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38" />Mwenye ŵansalile, “Che Kimuhamu tajaule ni une, ni tinantendele chilichose chachili chambone kukwenu. Ni chilichose chichinsache nantendele, tinantendele.” <verse eid="2SA 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39" />Pelepo ŵandu wosepe ŵajombweche lusulo lwa Yolodani ni mwenye nombe ŵajombweche. Mwenye ŵagolwesye makono ni kwakupata che Basilai ni kwapa upile, ni che Basilai ŵausile kumangwakwe.<verse eid="2SA 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵayuda ni Ŵaisilaeli akukangana ligongo lya mwenye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40" />Mwenye ŵajombweche ni ŵajawile mpaka ku Gileadi, ni che Kimuhamu ŵalongene nawo. Ŵandu wosepe ŵa ku Yuda ni nusu ja ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵampelechesye mwenye. <verse eid="2SA 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41" />Nipele, ŵandu wosepe ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵaiche kwa mwenye ni kunsalila, “Ligongo chichi achalongo achinjetu ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda akuliwona kuti akwete chigolochelo chakunjigala ni kumpelechesya ŵalakwe pampepe ni ŵapannango wenu ni ŵandu ŵenu wose, kunjombosya lusulo lwa Yolodani?”<verse eid="2SA 19:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42" />Ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda ŵajanjile ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli kuti, “Twatesile yeleyo ligongo, mwenye ŵa ali nlongo njetu nsyenesyene. Kwachichi nkutumbila kwaligongo lya chindu chi? Ana uweji tulile chilichose pa katema kalikose chakuti mwenye atupele? Pane ŵelewo atupele ntuuka uliwose?”<verse eid="2SA 19:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43" />Ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵaajanjile ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda kuti, “Uweji ni utukuŵajilwa kuti che Daudi aŵe mwenye jwetu mala kumi kumpunda mwenye. Ligongo chi mwatunyosisye? Ana uweji ngaŵa ni utwaliji ŵandanda kuŵecheta kuti mwenye ŵetu auje sooni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:43">Nambo ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda ŵaŵechete kwa maloŵe gakalipa nnope kwapunda Ŵaisilaeli.<verse eid="2SA 19:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20" />
  <para style="s">Che Sheba akwagalauka che Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1" />Nipele ku Gileadi ko ŵapali mundu jumo jwangalumbana, liina lyakwe che Sheba mwanagwe che Bikili, jwalukosyo lwa Benyamini. Nipele che Sheba ŵagombile lipenga ni kuti, “Uwe ŵangali chetu mu umwenye wa che Daudi, sooni nganitukola chindu mwa mwanache jwa che Yese. Ŵanyamwe ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli, kila mundu agambe kwaula ku lisakasa lyakwe!” <verse eid="2SA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2" />Kwayele, ŵandu wosepe ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵannesile che Daudi, ŵankuiye che Sheba mwanache jwa che Bikili. Nambo ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda ŵasigalile kuŵa ŵakukulupichika ni ŵankuiye mwenye che Daudi kutandilila ku lusulo lwa Yolodani mpaka mmusi wa ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3" />Mbesi, che Daudi ŵaiche ku nyuumba jao ku Yelusalemu. Ŵaajigele ilanga yakwe likumi ŵaŵaalesile kuti ajilolele nyuumba jakwe, ŵaaŵisile ku nyuumba jimo ni kwaŵika ŵakulindilila, ŵaapele yakulya, nambo nganagona nawo. Kwayele ilanga wo ŵaaugalile mu nyuumba mo mpaka mmoŵa ga chiwa chawo, ni ŵatemi mpela achakongwe ŵaŵililwe ni achiŵankwawo.<verse eid="2SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4" />Nipele, mwenye ŵansalile che Amasa kuti, “Mumilanjile ŵandu wose ŵa ku Yuda pa moŵa gatatu ga, ni mmwe mwasyene nnyicheje.” <verse eid="2SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5" />Nipele, che Amasa ŵajawile kwaŵilanga ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda. Nambo nganachelenga kuuja pa katema kakasachilwe ni mwenye. <verse eid="2SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6" />Pelepo che Daudi ŵansalile che Abishai kuti, “Sambano che Sheba mwanache jwa che Bikili tatuichisye masausyo gamakulungwa kupunda che Abusalomu. Njigale ŵangondo ŵangu munkuye che Sheba jo akaika kwinjila mu misi jajili ni likome ni kutoloka, tukaawona sooni.” <verse eid="2SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7" />Che Abishai ŵatyosile ali pamo ni che Yoabu, ni ŵakulindilila ŵa mwenye pamo ni ŵakukombola kuputana ngondo wose, ŵatyosile ku Yelusalemu kwaula kwakuilisya che Sheba mwanache jwa che Bikili. <verse eid="2SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8" />Paŵaiche pa lwala lyekulungwa kwele ku Gibeoni ko, che Amasa ŵatyosile kwachingamila. Che Yoabu ŵaliji awasile yakuwala ya pangondo, ni pachanya pa chakuwala cho kwaliji ni nkaanda mu chiunu mwakwe uwakamulile ligonelo lilyaliji ni chipula chekulungwa. Che Yoabu paŵaliji nkuŵandichila, lipanga lila lyakopweche mu ligonelo lyakwe ni kugwilila paasi. <verse eid="2SA 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9" />Che Yoabu ŵansalile che Amasa, “Ana nli chenene nlongo njangu?” Pelepo che Yoabu ŵankamwile ndewu che Amasa jula ni nkono wakwe wakunlyo kulitenda nti akwakumba. <verse eid="2SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10" />Nambo che Amasa nganachiiwona chipula chichaaliji mmakono mwa che Yoabu. Nipele, che Yoabu ŵansomile che Amasa pa lutumbo ni chipula chila, matumbo gakwe gasolotweche ni ŵagwile paasi. Che Amasa ŵawile pangali che Yoabu kwasoma sooni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:10">Nipele che Yoabu ni che Abishai mpwakwe ŵajendelechele kwakuilisya che Sheba mwanache jwa che Bikili. <verse eid="2SA 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11" />Mundu jumo jwa mpingo wa che Yoabu ŵaiche ni kwima chiŵandika ni chiilu chi che Amasa, achitiji, “Jwajulijose jwakunsaka che Yoabu ni jwajulijose jwakunsaka che Daudi, ŵaakuye che Yoabu!” <verse eid="2SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12" />Che Amasa ŵawile ali ajosile miasi jakwe ali agonile pasikati ja litala lyekulungwa. Kwayele kila mundu juŵapitile pelepo, paŵammweni ŵajimi. Nambo ajula mundu paŵaiweni kuti ŵandu wosepe ŵaiche ni kwima pelepo, ŵachityosisye chiilu chi che Amasa pa litala pala, ŵachijawisye kwitinji ni kuchiunichila ni nguo. <verse eid="2SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13" />Paŵautyosisye nteembo wa che Amasa pa litala pala, ŵandu wosepe ŵajendelechele kwakuya che Yoabu ŵaŵankuilisyaga che Sheba mwanache jwa che Bikili.<verse eid="2SA 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14" />Che Sheba ŵapitile mu ngosyo syosepe sya ku Isilaeli mpaka musi wa ku Abeli Beti Maaka. Ŵandu wosepe ŵaŵatamaga malo ja Ŵabikili ŵanonyelwe ni ŵankuiye. <verse eid="2SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15" />Ŵangondo wosepe ŵaŵaliji pamo ni che Yoabu ŵajawile kungumuchila che Sheba ali mu mmusi wa ku Abeli Beti Maaka mo. Ŵaunjiche litaka chiŵandi ni lipupa nti malo jakwelela, nipele ŵatandite kugumula lipupa ni kugwisya paasi. <verse eid="2SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16" />Nipele, jwankongwe jumpepe juŵaliji ni lunda ŵapikaniche kutyochela mmusi ali nkuti, “Mpilikanile! Mpilikanile! Mwasalile che Yoabu aiche kuti ngunguluche nawo.” <verse eid="2SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17" />Che Yoabu ŵajawile chiŵandika ni jwankongwe jo, nombe jwankongwe jo ŵammusisye, “Ana mmweji ni che Yoabu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Che Yoabu ŵajanjile, “Elo ni uneji.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Jwankongwe jula ŵansalile, “Mumbilikanile uneji jwakutumichila jwenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Che Yoabu ŵansalile, “Elo ngumpikanila.” <verse eid="2SA 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18" />Jwankongwe jula ŵansalile kuti, “Kalakala ko ŵandu ŵatiji, ‘Mwalechanje akaŵende ushauli ku musi wa ku Abeli.’ Yeleyi ni iŵatiji kumalisya magambo gao. <verse eid="2SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19" />Uneji ndili jumo mwa aŵala ŵakusaka chitendewele ni chikulupilichiko mu Isilaeli. Sambano mmwe nningwa wenu kuujonaga musi wauli mpela achikulu pa Isilaeli. Ana ligongo chi nkusaka kuujonanga musi wauli wakwe Ambuje Akunnungu?” <verse eid="2SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20" />Che Yoabu ŵajanjile, “Ngwamba, une ngangusosa kuulyulyunganya nsinda wu atamuno kuujonanga. <verse eid="2SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21" />Intite kusala ngaŵa isyene! Nambo mundu jumo kutyochela ku matumbi ga ku Efulaimu jwakuŵilanjikwa che Sheba mwanache jwa che Bikili atandite kungalauka mwenye che Daudi. Muntyosye kukwangu jwele mundu jo, ni une tinjityoka mmusi wenu.” Jwankongwe jo ŵansalile che Yoabu kuti, “Ntwe wakwe tinjiuponyela kukwenu kupitila pa likumba.” <verse eid="2SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22" />Pelepo jwele jwankongwe jo ŵapite kwa ŵandu wose ali ni ushauli wakwe wa lunda, nombewo ŵankatile ntwe che Sheba mwanache jwa che Bikili ni kuchijasila kwa che Yoabu. Kwayele che Yoabu ŵagombile lipenga kulosya kuti ngondo jimasile, ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵatyosile mu musi mo, kila mundu ŵajawile ku nyuumba kwakwe. Nipele che Yoabu ŵausile kwa mwenye che Daudi, ku musi wa ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵakamusi ŵa che Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23" />Che Yoabu ŵaliji jwankulu jwa mpingo wose wa ŵangondo wa ku Isilaeli. Che Benaya mwanache jwa che Yehoyada ŵaliji jwankulu jwa ŵakulindilila wa mwenye. <verse eid="2SA 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24" />Che Adolamu ŵaliji chilongola jwa aŵala ŵakupanganya masengo gakukanganichisya, che Yehoshafati mwanache jwa che Ahiudi ŵaliji jwakugosa ikumbuchisyo yaindu yayakopochelaga paumwenye. <verse eid="2SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25" />Che Shausha ŵaliji jwakulemba jwa mwenye, che Sadoki ni che Abiasali ŵaliji ŵambopesi. <verse eid="2SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26" />Nombe che Ila jwa musi wa ku Yaili ŵaliji jwambopesi jwaŵatumichilaga che Daudi jikape.<verse eid="2SA 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21" />
  <para style="s">Iŵelesi i che Sauli ikuulajikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1" />Katema ka umwenye wa mwenye che Daudi jakopochele sala kwa yaka itatu yakuyana. Kwayele mwenye che Daudi ŵapopesile kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, nombe Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile, sala ji jityochele ligongo “Che Sauli ni ŵapaulongo wakwe akwete chileŵo cha kuulaga, ligongo ŵaauleje Ŵagibeoni.” <verse eid="2SA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2" />Kwayele mwenye che Daudi ŵaaŵilasile Ŵagibeoni ni kukunguluka nawo. Ŵagibeoni nganaŵa Ŵaisilaeli nambo ŵaliji ŵakusigala mwa Ŵaamoli. Atamose Ŵaisilaeli ŵalumbilile kuti ngisiŵaaulaga Ŵagibeoni wo nambo che Sauli ŵalinjile kwaulaga ŵanawose ligongo ŵasakaga kuti Ŵaisilaeli ni Ŵayuda ataŵale chilambo chose. <verse eid="2SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3" />Che Daudi ŵausisye Ŵagibeoni, “Nkusaka nampanganyichisye ichichi? Tindipe chinauli kwa ugongomalo wantendele kuti nkombole kuchipa upile chilambo chi ni ŵandu ŵakwe Ambuje Akunnungu?” <verse eid="2SA 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4" />Ŵagibeoni ŵanjanjile, “Umenyani ŵa uweji ni che Sauli pamo ni ŵa paulongo wakwe ngaulipila madini ga feza pane sahabu ni namose uweji kumbulaga Mwisilaeli jwajuli jose.” Mwenye ŵausisye sooni kuti, “Sambano nkusaka naatendele ichichi?” <verse eid="2SA 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5" />Ni ŵajanjile kuti, “Che Sauli ŵasachile kuti atujonanje ni kutumala, akasigalila atamuno mundu jwalijose jwajumi mu chilambo chose cha Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6" />Nipele, ntupeje ŵandu saba ŵachilume kutyochela mu uŵelesi wa che Sauli, ni uweji tutwaulaje kwakwataŵilila paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu ku chitumbi cha ku Gibea ku musi wa che Sauli juŵajitililwe mauta ni Ambuje Akunnungu kuŵa mwenye.” Mwenye ŵatite kuti, “Tinjapeleka kukwenu.”<verse eid="2SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7" />Nambo mwenye nganiŵaapa che Mefibosheti mwanache jwa che Yonatani, chisukulu chi che Sauli ligongo che Yonathani ni che Daudi ŵatesile lilangano paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="2SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8" />Nambo mwenye ŵaajigele che Amunoni ni che Mefibosheti, ŵanache ŵaŵili ŵa che Lisipa mwali jwa che Ahiya ŵaŵaŵelechele che Sauli, pamo ni ŵanache nsano ŵachilume ŵa che Mikali, mwali ju che Sauli ŵaŵaŵelechele che Adilieli mwanache jwa che Basilai jwa ku Meholati. <verse eid="2SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9" />Ŵele ŵanache saba ŵachilume wo, che Daudi ŵaapeleche kwa Ŵagibeoni, nombewo ŵaataŵilile ku chitumbi paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵanawose saba ŵawile kwanakamo. Ŵanache wo ŵaulajikwe pa moŵa gaandanda ga magungulo ga shayili.<verse eid="2SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10" />Nipele, che Lisipa mwali ju che Ahiya ŵajigele kagunia, ni ŵatandiche palwala. Ŵatemi pelepo kutandilila magungulo pagaliji nkutanda mpaka ula pajatandite kunya ni kuganyoya malilo go. Katema kose ko, ŵaiŵingaga ijuni ya mwinani ni inyama ya mwitinji, chilo ni muusi kuti, ikaika pa malilo go. <verse eid="2SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11" />Che Daudi paŵapilikene yaitesile che Lisipa mwali ju che Ahiya, chilanga chi che Sauli, <verse eid="2SA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12" />ŵajawile ni kugajigala maupa ga che Sauli ni che Yonatani mwanagwe kutyochela kwa ŵandu ŵa ku Yabeshi Gileadi, ŵaŵagajiŵile pa luŵala lwakusongangana ŵandu ŵa ku Beti Shani pa lyuŵa Ŵafilisi paŵaakoleche che Sauli ni che Yonatani pa lyuŵa liŵammuleje che Sauli kwele ku chitumbi ku Giliboa ko. <verse eid="2SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13" />Che Daudi ŵagajigele maupa ga che Sauli ni che Yonatani mwanagwe kutyochela kweleko, sooni ŵagasonganyisye maupa ga achachanda saba ŵaŵaauleje kwa kwataŵilila ŵala. <verse eid="2SA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14" />Nipele, ŵandu ŵa che Daudi ŵagasichile maupa ga che Sauli ni che Yonatani mwanagwe ku chilambo cha Benyamini, kwele ku Sela pa lilembe li che Kishi atatigwe che Sauli. Ŵatesile kila chindu chiŵasalilwe ni mwenye. Pakumala yeleyo, Akunnungu ŵagajanjile mapopelelo kwaligongo lya chilambo cho.<verse eid="2SA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵaisilaeli akuputana ngondo ni makammandu ga Ŵafilisiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 20:4-8">1 Indu ya katema 20:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15" />Nipele Ŵafilisiti ŵaputene ngondo sooni ni Ŵaisilaeli. Nombe che Daudi ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵajawile kuputana ngondo ni Ŵafilisiti. Che Daudi ŵapesile nnope pa lyuŵa lyo. <verse eid="2SA 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16" />Che Ishibi Benobu, jumo jwa uŵelesi ŵa makammandu ŵaŵaŵilanjikwe Ŵalefai, jwele mpamba wakwe utopele wakwe waliji kilo tatu ni nusu, ni ŵaliji ni lipanga lyasambano nchiunu mwakwe, ni ŵaganisisye yakuti tammulaje che Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17" />Nambo che Abishai mwanache jwa che Seluya ŵajawile kwakamuchisya che Daudi. Che Abishai ŵangungumuchile Mfilisiti jula ni kummulaga. Kwayele, ŵandu ŵanlumbilile che Daudi achitiji, “Nganjaula sooni ku ngondo ni uwe kogopela kuti tachimmulaga, ligongo mmwejo nli chikulupi cha Ŵaisilaeli wosepe.”<verse eid="2SA 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18" />Kanyuma, jakopochele ngondo sooni ni Ŵafilisiti ku Gobu ko. Kweleko che Sibekai jwa ku Husha ŵauleje che Safu juŵaliji jumo mwa uŵelesi wa makammandu ŵaŵaŵilanjikwe Ŵalefai. <verse eid="2SA 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19" />Jakopochele ngondo sooni ni Ŵafilisiti kwele ku Gobu ko. Nombe che Elihanani mwanache ju che Yaili Legimu, mundu jwa ku Beselehemu ŵammuleje Goliati jwa ku Giti, jwati chikumbu cha mpamba wakwe chaliji chekulungwa mpela chitela chakuluchila. <verse eid="2SA 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20" />Kanyuma jakopochele ngondo sooni kwele ku Gati ko, ni kweleko kwaliji ni mundu jumo juŵaliji jwanleu, juŵaliji ni yaala sita pa kila ligasa ni yala sita pa kila sajo, Yala yosepe yaliji ishilini na nne. Sooni jweleju ŵaliji jwa uŵelesi wa Ŵalefai. <verse eid="2SA 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21" />Chikammandu ju paŵaatukene Ŵaisilaeli, che Yonatani mwanache jwa che Shimei, mpwakwe che Daudi ŵammuleje. <verse eid="2SA 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22" />Ŵele ŵandu ncheche wo ŵaliji uŵelesi wa makammandu gagaŵilanjikwe Ŵalefai ku Gati ko, nombewo ŵaulajikwe ni che Daudi ni ŵakutumichila ŵakwe.<verse eid="2SA 21:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22" />
  <para style="s">Lujimbo lwakupunda lwa che Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1" />Che Daudi ŵaajimbile Ambuje Akunnungu maloŵe ga lujimbo lu pele Ambuje Akunnungu paŵaakulupwisye kutyochela kwa ŵammagongo ŵakwe wose, nombe kutyochela kwa che Sauli. <verse eid="2SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2" />Ŵajimbile yeleyi: Ambuje Akunnungu ali lwala lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:2">likome lyangu, ni chiwombolo changu.<verse eid="2SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3" />Ambuje Akunnungu, ali lwala lwangu, pamalo pangulijuŵa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">mmwejo nli chakulichinga pantima pangu ni machili ga ukulupusyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">mmwejo nli likome lyangu ni pamalo pangu pangulijuŵa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">Nkulupusyo jwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">nkungulupusya kutyochela kwa ŵandu ŵaukoleko. <verse eid="2SA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4" />Ngummilanga ŵalakwejo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵakuŵajilwa kulapikwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:4">nkuungulupusya kutyochela kwa ŵammagongo ŵangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5" />Pakuŵa matumbela ga chiwa gasyungulile une,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:5">chikumba mesi cha uwonasi chaanyigele,<verse eid="2SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6" />ngonji sya lilembe syasyungulile une,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:6">itanje ya chiwa yandanjisye. <verse eid="2SA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7" />Mu kulaga kwangu naaŵilasile Ambuje Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">naalilile Akunnungu ŵangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">Kutyochela mu nyuumba jakwe ŵapilikene liloŵe lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">kulila kwangu kwaichilile mmapilikanilo gakwe.<verse eid="2SA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8" />Chilambo chatetemele ni kutenganyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:8">misingi ja kwinani jagwengwelwiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:8">ligongo Akunnungu ŵaliji atumbile. <verse eid="2SA 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9" />Lyosi lyatutumaga mu mbula mwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:9">mooto wakonanga wakopokaga mkang'wa mwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:9">makala ga mooto gakolelaga mkang'wa mo.<verse eid="2SA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10" />Ŵapapwile liunde ni ŵaiche paasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:10">liunde lyakupilila lyaliji ku sajo syawo.<verse eid="2SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11" />Ŵachikwesile chepanganyikwe chachili ni mapapiko ni kuguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:11">ŵajigalikwe pachanya ni mapapiko ga mbungo.<verse eid="2SA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12" />Ŵalisyunguchisye chipi kosekose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:12">chiunichilo chakwe chaliji maunde gakandapala ga ula gagumbele ni mesi.<verse eid="2SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13" />Kutyochela ni kung'alima kwa upagwe wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:13">maunde gasejele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:13">janyele ula ja maganga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:13">ni kumesya kwa njasi.<verse eid="2SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵalindime kutyochela kwinani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:14">Liloŵe lya jwali kwinani nnope lyapikaniche.<verse eid="2SA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15" />Ŵaponyisye mipamba ni kwapwilinganya ŵammagongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:15">kumesya kwa njasi, ŵammagongo ŵautwiche.<verse eid="2SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16" />Iŵata ya mu bahali yaunukulikwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">misingi ja chilambo jaoneche</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">Ambuje Akunnungu paŵaakalipilaga ŵammagongo ŵakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">kwa mbumu syasikopweche kwa machili mmbula mwakwe.<verse eid="2SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵagolwesye nkono wao kutyochela mwinani, ŵanyigele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:17">ŵanjuwile kutyoka pamalo pakusokosya mmesi.<verse eid="2SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18" />Ŵangulupwisye kutyoka kwa ŵammagongo ŵangu jwakwete machili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:18">ŵele ŵaŵanjimaga une,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:18">pakuŵapo ŵakwete ŵamachili nnope kuumbunda une.<verse eid="2SA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19" />Ŵaagungumuchile une pa lyuŵa linaliji pa masausyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:19">nambo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵangamuchisye.<verse eid="2SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20" />Ŵanyigele ni kuumika pamalo salama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:20">ŵangulupwisye ligongo ŵanonyelwe ni une.<verse eid="2SA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵambanganyichisye malinga ni indite kukundikwa paujo pakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:21">ŵambele upile malinga ni ungali chileŵo wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22" />Pakuŵapo nagajitichisye malamusi gakwe Ambuje Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:22">ni sooni nganindende yachigongomalo ni kwaleka Akunnungu ŵangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23" />Ngamulisye malajisyo gakwe gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:23">nganineka kugakuya mashalaiti gakwe.<verse eid="2SA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24" />Mele jwangali chileŵo paujo pakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:24">nalisiŵilile kuti ngasindenda ileŵo.<verse eid="2SA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25" />Ambuje Akunnungu ambele ntuuka malinga ni kukundikwa kwangu paujo pao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:25">malinga ni ungakola ileŵo paujo pao.<verse eid="2SA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26" />Kwa ŵandu ŵakukulupilichika nkulilosya kuŵa ŵakukulupichika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:26">kwa ŵandu ŵangali chileŵo nkulilosya kuŵa jwangali chileŵo.<verse eid="2SA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27" />Mmwejo nli ŵambone kwa ŵandu ŵali ŵambone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:27">nambo kwa ŵachigongomalo nkulilosya kuŵa ŵakukanila.<verse eid="2SA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28" />Nkwakulupusya ŵandu ŵaakulitulusya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:28">nambo nkwalolechesya ŵandu ŵakulikwesya kuti mwatulusye.<verse eid="2SA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29" />Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, nli lilanguka lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:29">Akunnungu ŵangu, nkuumulichila mu chipi<verse eid="2SA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30" />Nkuumba machili gakwagungumuchila ŵammagongo ŵangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:30">ni machili gakukwela mapupa gawo.<verse eid="2SA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31" />Akunnungu, akwalongosya ŵandu kuipanganya indu mwakulungamika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:31">yose yalanjile Ambuje Akunnungu ili isyene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:31">ŵelewo ali chakulichinga pantima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:31">kwa ŵandu wose ŵakulijuŵa kukwakwe.<verse eid="2SA 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32" />Ŵani ŵali Akunnungu ikaŵe Ambuje Akunnungu pe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:32">Ŵani ŵali lwala pakulijuŵa ikaŵe Akunnungu ŵetu?<verse eid="2SA 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33" />Akunnungu ni pamalo pangu pakulimba pakulijuŵa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:33">akuitenda ipanganyo yangu iŵe yakulungamika.<verse eid="2SA 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34" />Akugalimbisya makongolo gangu mpela ga ngolombwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:34">akungombolesya kwima paitumbi.<verse eid="2SA 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35" />Akunyiganisya makono gangu kuputana ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:35">akugalimbisya makono gangu kukuta ukunje kwa kulonda.<verse eid="2SA 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36" />Nkuumba chakulichinga pantima chakuungulupusya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:36">chikamuchisyo chenu chindesile une me jwankulu<verse eid="2SA 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37" />Muunyonjechesye litala lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:37">kuti makongolo gangu nganigatelesya.<verse eid="2SA 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38" />Naatopwele ŵammagongo ŵangu ni kwaaulaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:38">nganimujila panyuma mpaka panaamasile ŵanawose.<verse eid="2SA 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39" />Naauleje ŵanawose, nganakombola kwima sooni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:39">ŵagwile paasi pa makongolo gangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40" />Mwambele machili ga kuputana ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:40">mwatesile ŵammagongo ŵangu atindiŵale ni kukotama mpaka paasi pa makongolo gangu kulosya uchimbichimbi.<verse eid="2SA 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41" />Mwatesile ŵammagongo ŵangu agalauche ni kuutuka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:41">ni uneji naajonasile aŵala wose ŵaŵamengaga.<verse eid="2SA 22:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42" />Ŵasosile ukamuchisyo, nambo nganapagwa ŵakwakulupusya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:42">ŵammilasile Ambuje Akunnungu, nambo nganaajanga.<verse eid="2SA 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43" />Naasyajilesyajile ni ŵaliji mpela luundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:43">ni naakanyete ni kwaliŵataliŵata mpela matope mu litala.<verse eid="2SA 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44" />Mwangulupwisye ni ŵandu ŵangu ŵaŵaagunguluchile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:44">muundesile me jwakutawala jwa ilambo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:44">Ŵandu ŵangangwamanyilila sambano akuundumichila.<verse eid="2SA 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45" />Achalendo akuunyichilila ali nkulitulusya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:45">papopo napikana pe ngani syangu, akuunyitichisya.<verse eid="2SA 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46" />Achalendo ŵatengwiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:46">ŵatyosile mmakome gawo ali nkutetemela.<verse eid="2SA 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47" />Ambuje Akunnungu ali ŵajumi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:47">achimbichikwe lwala lwangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:47">Akuswe Akunnungu ŵangu, lwala lwa ukulupusyo wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48" />Ŵelewo ni ŵakuuchisya ugongomalo kwaligongo lyangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:48">ni kwaŵika ŵandu ŵa ilambo ine paasi pa ulamusi wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49" />Mungulupwisye kutyochela kwa ŵammagongo ŵangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:49">Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, muungusisye pachanya pa ŵaakunganila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:49">ni kuumbokasya kwa ŵandu ŵakakatima ntima.<verse eid="2SA 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50" />Kwayele, tinjinlapa ŵalakwe Ambuje Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:50">pasikati ja ŵandu ŵa ilambo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:50">tinjililapa liina lyenu.<verse eid="2SA 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51" />Akunnungu antesile mwenye jwammisile kuti apunde kwakukulungwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:51">Akunnosya chinonyelo chakwe changamala jwelejo jwansagwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:51">che Daudi ni iŵelesi yakwe moŵa gose pangali mbesi.<verse eid="2SA 22:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23" />
  <para style="s">Maloŵe gakumalichisya ga che Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1" />Aga ni maloŵe gakumalichisya ga che Daudi. Uli utenga wa che Daudi mwanache jwa che Yese, mundu juŵatendekwe kuŵa jwankulu ni Akumanani, mundu juŵajimbaga nyiimbo sya Ŵaisilaeli juŵasagulikwe ni Akunnungu ŵa che Yakobu.<verse eid="2SA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2" />Mbumu jwa Ambuje Akunnungu akuŵecheta kwa litala lya une,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:2">ni maloŵe gangugaŵecheta gakukopochela kwa ŵelewo.<verse eid="2SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3" />Akunnungu jwa ku Isilaeli ŵaasasile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">Lwala lwa ku Isilaeli ŵaasalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">mundu pakwatawala ŵandu kwa litala lyalikukundikwa paujo pangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">Jwakutawala kwa kwakwachimbichisya Akunnungu,<verse eid="2SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4" />jwelejo ali mpela lilanguka lya kundaŵi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:4">palikukopoka lyuŵa kundaŵi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:4">kundaŵi kwangali maunde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:4">mpela lilanguka pakumala kunya ula jajikusipusya manyasi paasi.<verse eid="2SA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5" />Ana ŵamunyuumba jangu nganasagulikwa ni Akunnungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">Elo ŵelewo atesile lilangano lya moŵa gose pangali mbesi ni uneji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">ngaalileka lilangano lyakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">Nombejo tachitenda indu yangu inyendelechele yambone ni chenene mu yanayose ingiuilajila.<verse eid="2SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6" />Nambo ŵandu wose ŵangakwajitichisya Akunnungu ali mpela miiŵa jajikwasikwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:6">pakuŵa ngajikomboleka kujigalikwa ni makono,<verse eid="2SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7" />kuti njikamula ikusachilwa ntumie yuma pane mpini wa mpamba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:7">Nombe tijichomekwe papopo ni moto.<verse eid="2SA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵangondo ŵakulimbangana ŵa che Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 11:10-41">1 Indu ya katema 11:10-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8" />Gelega gali meena ga ŵangondo ŵakulimbangana ŵaŵaliji ni che Daudi: Che Yoshebi Bashebeti jwa ku Takimoni juŵaliji chilongola jwa aŵala ŵandu ŵatatu, jweleju ŵaputene ni mpamba wakwe, ni kwaulaga ŵandu mia nane pa lyuŵa limo.<verse eid="2SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9" />Juŵakuiye pa aŵala ŵandu ŵamachili ŵatatu ŵala jwaliji che Eleasali mwanache jwa che Dodo, jwa ntundu wa Mwahohi. Palyuŵa limo, che Eleasali ŵaliji pamo ni che Daudi katema paŵaatukene Ŵafilisiti ŵaŵasongangene kuputana ngondo ku Pasi Damimu, ni Ŵaisilaeli ŵaatisile Ŵafilisiti. <verse eid="2SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10" />Nambo che Eleasali ŵajimi mwakulimbila ni kuputana ni Ŵafilisiti mpaka nkono wakwe pawalepele kupinda, ni ŵasigalile uli ukamulene ni lipanga lyakwe. Palyuŵa lyo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaatesile apunde kwannope. Pakumala kupunda ko, Ŵaisilaeli ŵaiche kuŵaliji che Eleasali kujigala indu ya Ŵafilisiti ŵaŵaulajikwe.<verse eid="2SA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11" />Jwangondo jwakulimbangana jwaatatu ŵaliji che Shama mwanache jwa che Agee, jwa ku Halali. Ŵafilisiti ŵasongangene kwele ku Lehi ko, pamalo papaliji ni ngunda wa dengu, nombe Ŵaisilaeli ŵaautwiche Ŵafilisiti. <verse eid="2SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12" />Nambo che Shama ŵajimi mwakulimbila pasikati ja ngunda wo kuti akasumulwa, nombejo ŵauleje Ŵafilisiti. Ambuje Akunnungu ŵapundisye kwannope.<verse eid="2SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13" />Nipele, ŵangondo ŵakulimbangana ŵatatu pasikati ja ŵangondo ŵakulimbangana salasini ŵatulwiche katema ka magungulo, ŵaiche kwa che Daudi ku mbugu kwele ku Adulamu ko. Pa katema ko ŵangondo ŵa Ŵafilisiti ŵaliji aŵisile chigono ku chiŵata cha ku Lefaimu. <verse eid="2SA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14" />Nombe che Daudi pa katema ko ŵaliji ku likome, ni chigono cha ŵangondo Ŵafilisiti pa katema ko chaliji mmusi wa ku Beselehemu. <verse eid="2SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15" />Pa lyuŵa limo che Daudi jaakwete njota, ni ŵatite, “Ikaliji yambone mundu akambele mesi gakung'wa ga chisima chichili kuŵandikana ni nnango wakwinjilila mmusi, ku Beselehemu!” <verse eid="2SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16" />Kwayele Aŵala ŵangondo ŵakulimbangana ŵatatu ŵatyosile, ŵapelete pasikati ja chigono cha ŵangondo ŵa Ŵafilisiti, ŵajawile ni kuteka meesi ku chisima cha ku Beselehemu, chiŵandi ni nnango wakwinjilila mmusi, ŵagaichisye kwa che Daudi. Nambo che Daudi ŵagakanile kung'wa, pamalo pakwe ŵagajitilile paasi mpela mbopesi ja chakung'wa kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, <verse eid="2SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17" />ni ŵatite, “Ngulumbila kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, nganingola chigolochelo chakung'wa aga mesi ga, ana aga mesi ga ngaŵa mpela miasi ja aŵala ŵandu ŵautasile umi wao mu chakogoya kugaichasya?” Kwayele, che Daudi nganang'wa mesi go. Yeleyo ni indu iŵaitesile aŵala ŵangondo ŵakulimbangana ŵatatu ŵala.<verse eid="2SA 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18" />Che Abiasali mpwakwe che Yoabu, mwanache jwa che Seluya, ŵaliji jwankulu jwa ŵangondo ŵakulimbangana salasini. Jwelejo ŵamenyene kwa mpamba wakwe ni ŵandu mia tatu, ni kwaulaga pa lyuŵa limo, ŵapikaniche mpela aŵala ŵangondo ŵakulimbangana ŵatatu ŵala. <verse eid="2SA 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19" />Ana aju nganaŵa jwakumanyika kwannope pasikati ja ŵangondo ŵakulimbangana salasini ŵala? Kwayele ŵaliji chilongola jwawo, nambo nganaŵa jumo jwao aŵala ŵangondo ŵatatu ŵala. <verse eid="2SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20" />Che Benaya mwanache jwa che Yehoyada ŵaliji jwangondo jwakulimbangana kutyochela ku Kabiseeli, juŵatesile indu yejinji yekulungwa. Ŵauleje ŵangondo ŵamachili ŵaŵili ŵaŵaliji ŵakulimba mitima kwapunda wosepe ŵa ku Moabu. Sooni pa lyuŵa limo balafu jili jipali, ŵajinjile mwisimbo ni ŵauleje lisimba mwelemo. <verse eid="2SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21" />Nombe ŵammuleje Mmisili jwalewipe jwakandapala. Mmisili jo ŵakwete mpamba, nambo che Benaya ŵanjaulile ali ajigele chidonga pe, ŵansumwile mpamba wo, ni kummulaga Mmisili jo ni mpamba wakwe nsyene. <verse eid="2SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22" />Che Benaya mwanache jwa che Yehoyada ŵatesile indu yi, ni ŵapikaniche pasikati ja aŵala ŵangondo ŵatatu ŵala. <verse eid="2SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23" />Nipele ŵaliji jwachimbichikwe kupikanika pasikati ja aŵala ŵangondo ŵakulimbangana salasini nachiŵamuno nganaŵa mpela aŵala ŵangondo ŵatatu ŵala. Ni che Daudi ŵantesile kuŵa jwankulu jwa ŵakulindilila ŵakwe nsyene. <verse eid="2SA 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24" />Che Asaeli mpwakwe che Yoabu, ŵaliji jumo mwa ŵangondo ŵakulimbangana salasini. Ŵangondo ŵakulimbangana ŵane ŵa che Daudi ŵaliji che Elihanani mwanache jwa che Dodo jwa ku Beselehemu <verse eid="2SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25" />che Shama jwa ku Halodi ni che Elika jwa ku Halodi <verse eid="2SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26" />ni che Helesi jwa ku Paliti ni che Ila mwanache jwa che Ikeshi jwa kutyochela ku Tekoa <verse eid="2SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27" />ni che Abieseli jwa ku Anatoti ni che Mebunai jwa ku Husha <verse eid="2SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28" />ni che Salimoni jwa ku Ahohi ni che Mahalai jwa ku Netofati, <verse eid="2SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29" />che Helebu mwanache jwa che Baana jwa ku Netofati ni che Itai mwanache jwa che Libai kutyochela ku Gibea ku malo ja lukosyo lwa Benyamini, <verse eid="2SA 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30" />ni che Benaya jwa ku Pilatoni ni che Hidai kutyochela ku tusulo sya ku Gaashi, <verse eid="2SA 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31" />che Abi Aliboni jwa ku Alaba ni che Asimaweti jwa ku Bahulimu, <verse eid="2SA 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32" />ni che Eliaba, jwa ku Shaaliboni ni ŵanache ŵa che Yasheni ni che Yonatani, <verse eid="2SA 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:33" />ni che Shama jwa ku Halali ni che Ahimu mwanache jwa che Shalali jwa ku Halali, <verse eid="2SA 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34" />ni che Elifeleti mwanache jwa che Ahasibai, jwa ku Maaka ni che Eliamu mwanache jwa che Ahitofeli jwa ku Gilo <verse eid="2SA 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35" />che Hesilo jwa ku Kalimeli ni che Paalai jwa ku Alabi, <verse eid="2SA 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36" />ni che Igali mwanache jwa che Natani kutyochela ku Soba, ni che Bani jwa ku Gadi <verse eid="2SA 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37" />che Seleki Mwaamoni ni che Nahalai jwa ku Beeloti juŵaliji jwakwigala yakumenyanila ya che Yoabu mwanache jwa che Seluya, <verse eid="2SA 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38" />ni che Ila ni che Gelebu kutyochela Yatili, <verse eid="2SA 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39" />ni che Ulia jwa lukosyo lwa Hiti. Ŵanawose kwapamo ŵaliji ŵangondo ŵakulimbangana salasini na saba.<verse eid="2SA 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24" />
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akwaŵalanga Ŵaisilaeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 21:1-27">1 Indu ya katema 21:1-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaatumbilile sooni Ŵaisilaeli, ŵanyenjile che Daudi, ŵansalile kuti ŵaaŵalanje ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli ni ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda. <verse eid="2SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2" />Kwayele, mwenye ŵansalile che Yoabu, ni achakulungwa ŵa mipingo ja ŵangondo ŵaŵaliji pamo nawo, “Njaulangane ku ngosyo syose sya ku Isilaeli kutandilila ku Dani mpaka ku Beli Sheba, nkalembe mena ga ŵandu ŵakuputana ngondo kuti naimanyilile ali ŵalingwa.” <verse eid="2SA 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3" />Nambo che Yoabu ŵanjanjile mwenye kuti, “Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, ŵaajonjechesye Ŵaisilaeli mala mia moja kupunda mwaŵelele sambano, nomwe ambuje ŵangu mwenye nnyiwoneje konjecheka ko ni meeso genu mwasyene. Nambo, ligongo chi alakwe ambuje ŵangu mwenye nkusaka kutenda chele chindu chi?” <verse eid="2SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4" />Nambo chaŵechete mwenye chaliji ni machili kwannope kwa che Yoabu ni achakulu ŵa mipingo ja ŵangondo! Nipele, che Yoabu ni achakulu ŵa mipingo ja ŵangondo ŵatyosile paujo pa mwenye, ŵajawile kwajandika Ŵaisilaeli ŵali ni ukombole wa kuputana. <verse eid="2SA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5" />Kuundanda ŵajombweche lusulo lwa Yolodani ni ŵaŵisile chigono ku Aloeli chakulujenda kwa musi kwaula ku kuchiŵata kwaula ku Gadi ni mpaka ku Yaseli. <verse eid="2SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6" />Nipele, ŵajawile ku Gileadi ni ŵajawile ku Kadeshi ku chilambo cha Ŵahiti, nipele ŵajawile ku Dani, ni kutyochela kweleko ŵasyungwile kwaula ku Sidoni. <verse eid="2SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7" />Nipele ŵaiche ku likome lya musi wa ku Tilo, ŵajinjile mu misi jose ja Ŵahivi ni Ŵakanaani. Nipele ŵatyosile kwaula chakulujenda kwa chilambo cha ku Yuda mpaka ku Beli Sheba ko. <verse eid="2SA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8" />Piŵamasile kupita mu chilambo chose, ŵausile ku Yelusalemu pakumala miesi tisa na moŵa ishilini. <verse eid="2SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9" />Nipele che Yoabu ŵamjauchisye mwenye chiŵalanjilo cha ŵandu wosepe ŵakukombola kuputana ngondo. Ku chilambo cha Ŵaisilaeli kwapali ni achalume laki nane; ni ku Yuda kwapali ni achalume laki tano. <verse eid="2SA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10" />Nambo che Daudi ŵalasile kwannope mu ntima mwakwe pakumala kwaŵalanga ŵandu. Kwayele, che Daudi ŵansalile Ambuje Akunnungu kuti, “Ndesile sambi jekulungwa kwa chindu chimbangenyisye chi. Nambo sano alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, ngunchondelela muunechelesye uneji jwakutumichila jwenu, pakuŵapo ndesile chindu chakuloŵela kwannope.” <verse eid="2SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11" />Kundaŵi kwakwe liloŵe lya Akunnungu lyannyichilile jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu che Daudi juŵaliji jwakulolesya jwa che Daudi kuti, <verse eid="2SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12" />“Njaule ku che Daudi nkaasalile: ‘Yeleyi ni yaakuti kusala Ambuje Akunnungu: Ngumpa kusagula pa iputiko itatu itinjimpa, nomwe nsagule chiputiko chimo chachinjichitenda kukwenu.’” <verse eid="2SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13" />Kwayele, che Gadi ŵanjaulile che Daudi ni kunsalila, “Uli, paŵeje ni sala ja yaka saba mu chilambo mwenu, pane uli, mmweji mwautuche ŵammagongo ŵenu kwa miesi jitatu ali nkunkuilisya, pane kuŵeje ni ilwele yakogoya yakulekanganalekanga pa chilambo pano kwa moŵa gatatu? Sambano nganisye chenene itinjile, ni muusalile kuti ngaasalile ŵandumile wo.” <verse eid="2SA 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14" />Che Daudi ŵajanjile che Gadi kuti, “Ndengwiche malungo. Mmbaya Ambuje Akunnungu wo anyamuche, pakuŵa ali ŵa chanasa kwannope, kupunda kugwilila mmakono mwa ŵandu.”<verse eid="2SA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15" />Nipele, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaaichisye Ŵaisilaeli ilwele, kutandilila kundaŵi mpaka pa katema kakaŵichikwe. Ŵandu elufu sabini ŵawile mu chilambo mose kutandilila chakumpoto ku Dani mpaka chakulujenda ku Beli Sheba. <verse eid="2SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16" />Nambo katema katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu paŵagolwesye nkono wakwe kuti aujonanje musi wa ku Yelusalemu, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaugalawisye nningwa wakwe. Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile jwele katumetume jwakwinani juŵaaulagaga ŵandu jo kuti, “Nneche! Ikwanile; mmusye nkono wenu.” Katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajimi chiŵandi ni luŵala lwakukuŵitila ngano lwa che Alauna, jwa lukosyo lwa Yebusi. <verse eid="2SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17" />Che Daudi paŵammweni jwele katumetume jwa kwinani juŵaaulagaga ŵandu jo ŵansalile Ambuje Akunnungu kuti, “Nnole, uneji ni jundesile sambi ni kutenda ugongomalo wu! Ŵandu ŵa nganatenda chakulemwa. Ngunchondelela kwannope muunyamuche uneji ni ŵapaulongo wa atati ŵangu.”<verse eid="2SA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18" />Pa lyuŵa lilyolyo che Gadi ŵanjaulile che Daudi ni ŵansalile kuti, “Nkwesye kanandi, njaule nkaataŵile Ambuje Akunnungu chilisa, ku luŵala lwakukuŵitila ngano lwa che Alauna jwa lukosyo lwa Yebusi.” <verse eid="2SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19" />Nipele, che Daudi ŵakwesisye malinga ni liloŵe li che Gadi mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite pakwasalila. <verse eid="2SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20" />Che Alauna paŵalolite chakwichela ŵammweni mwenye ali nkwaŵandichila ali ni ŵakutumichila ŵakwe, nombejo ŵatyosile, ŵajawile ni kutindiŵala ni kukotama mpaka paasi paujo pa mwenye kulosya uchimbichimbi. <verse eid="2SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21" />Nipele che Alauna ŵammusisye mwenye, “Ligongo chi ambuje ŵangu mwenye muunyichilile uneji jwakutumichila jwenu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:21">Che Daudi ŵajanjile, “Iche kukusuma luŵala lwenu lwakukuŵitila ngano kuti naataŵile Ambuje Akunnungu chilisa kuti tauni jajikwamala ŵandu jityoche.”<verse eid="2SA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22" />Nombe che Alauna ŵansalile che Daudi, “Ambuje ŵangu mwenye, njigale chilichose chinkuchiwona kuti chikunfai ni kutyosya mbopesi. Uneji ngutyosya ngombe si kwaligongo lya mbopesi jakutinisya ni itela yakukuŵitila ngano ni itela ya kwataŵilila ng'ombe paakulima iŵeje sasu. <verse eid="2SA 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23" />Yelei yose, ngumpa alakwe mwenye. Ngukulupilila kuti Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu, tachijikunda mbopesi jenu.”<verse eid="2SA 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24" />Nambo mwenye ŵansalile che Alauna, “Ngwamba! Mmwejo ngamumba chindu chachilichose. Uneji tisume kukwenu kwa ntengo wakwe. Ngangwatyochesya Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵangu, mbopesi jakutinisya janganimbvanganyichisye masengo.” Kwayele mwenye che Daudi ŵasumile luŵala lwakukuŵitila ngano ni ngombe kwa ipande hansini ya madini ga feza. <verse eid="2SA 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25" />Nipele che Daudi ŵaataŵile Ambuje Akunnungu chilisa pamalo po ni kwatyochesya mbopesi sya kutinisya ni sya chitendewele. Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵagajitichisye mapopelo kwaligongo lya chilambo, ni ajila tauni jijaaulagaga Ŵaisilaeli jalesile.<verse eid="2SA 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24" />
</usx>